<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LEV" style="id">- Toma Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Levi Nuiti</para>
  <para style="toc1">Levi Nuiti Ta-Zɛʋɛi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Levi Nuiti</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lev</para>
  <para style="mt1">Levi Nuiti</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ta-Zɛʋɛi</para>
  <para style="imt">Sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeizuʋɛ ma woo mɔungiti</para>
  <para style="ip">Tɔgi niiti GALA ge ti veeni Izilayɛle nuiti zea ga Moize maaʋele, naati ka ti Levi Nuiti Ta-Zɛʋɛi zu. Tɔgi naati pilɛgɛ zalaɠaiti kula ʋelei ʋa, ta devei niiti ti logai GALA dɛbi ʋelei ʋa seɠe ʋɛlɛi ɲadegai wu. Levi nuiti ti ɠɛni ga bolodai Izilayɛle nuiti saama, nii GALA ge yiimazeɠeni la ga ti ɠɛ ga zalaɠa ɠula nuiti, ti ɠaaɓa GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu wotiiti ma. Faaɠwɛ nu wolai tanigaa ti laaʋɛ da ga GALA goo wo nui Moize ɠa é Minazeɠe Pɔlɔmai ma zɛʋɛ lɔɔlugɔ mɔungiti sɛʋɛa, Levi Nuiti Ta-Zɛʋɛi ta zɔiti (Zenɛze, Ɛgezɔde, naa ʋɛɛ Gaalu Sɛʋɛi ʋa ta Tɔ Sɛʋɛi Velesiɛi). Naa ɠulaʋɛ kɛlɛma sɛʋɛi nii ɓɔɠɔi zu, tɔɔzei Levi Nuiti Ta-Zɛʋɛi nii tɔɔzeiʋɛ ga é ɠɛ ma GALA ge niima wooiti boni Moize ma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 1:1">1:1</ref></char>). Tanigaa ti ɠɛ sɛʋɛi nii ma ɓuɠaiti gaalɛɛni ba, ti ɠula sɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai tanigaa zu Ɓaɓilɔne, é zo kona unnaanigɔi ma, é li undɔzitai (400-600) ʋɔ pelei, aisa Yesu Kilista ʋa zɔlɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Levi Nuiti Ta-Zɛʋɛi lɔɔzeizuʋɛ, zalaɠai ma zii mɔinmɔin ma vaa wogɛ ná, niiti GALA ge ti-ma levei veeni zalaɠa ɠula nuiti zea ga ti ɗa ti ɠula. Zalaɠai naa tanigaa ti ɠɛni ga nuiti ta-ɠotoiti ma vaa. Zalaɠai taɠiligaa ta zoo ɠulazu ga nui ta yiima vaa, é zoloo nɛɛbɛi ma, é ma nu yiimaʋɛ, é lo GALA ba. Kɛlɛ naa pɛ su, nii é ɠɛni ga faa ɓiigi, naa ɠɛni ga zalaɠai maanɛɛni ga nu kula, kɛni é ɠɛ ga anii gola vizɔgai, nɛɛʋuzu nɔpɛ ge mina ɠɛ ba. Naa ɠa é ɠɛni GALA ná-ɲadedai lɛɛzu, é kole fo. Sɛʋɛi ɠaaɓelasuʋɛ ɠa naa lɛɛzu, ʋelei Izilayɛle nuiti ta zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ta la kɛɛ la, ti yɛ ɲadedai zu, ɓaa nii ta kɛɛ, ti ɲade. Sɛʋɛi nii ma woo ungi ɠa ga GALA ɲadegɛ, ta ni Izilayɛle nuiti ta ʋilɛna tɔgi niiti polu ti sɛʋɛi nii zu, ta zoo eteai ziɛzu GALA gaazu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Unsosuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Kalagiti é lo zalaɠai ma zii ɠilagilagiti kula ʋelei ʋa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 1:1-7:38">1:1—7:38</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Zeelobai wo pelei ga Aalɔn ta ná-doun zunuiti ga ti ɠɛ ga zalaɠa ɠula nuiti (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 8:1-10:20">8:1—10:20</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Deveiti ti logai daamiani ɲadegaiti ba, ta niiti ti la ɲadeni, naa ʋɛɛ seeɓɛiti ba (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 11:1-16:34">11:1—16:34</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Deve ɠiligaa é lo ɠɔnɔ faiti ba, fɛti vaiti, ta nu luʋa ʋele ʋagɔi, naa ʋɛɛ dooɠo konagiti ba (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 17:1-27:34">17:1—27:34</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LEV 1"/>
  <para style="ms1">Tɔgiti É Ʋilɛ Zalaɠaiti Ba</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="LEV 1:1-7:38">1:1—7:38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Gala zalaɠai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 1:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI Moize lolini, é ɓɔɛ pɔ GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LEV 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 1:2"/>«Ɓɔɛ Izilayɛle nuiti pɔ, è ɠɛ ti ma: Siɛgi zu nui ta vebɛanii veezu la Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, toɠa seɠe toganii ma wolaiti ɓaa ma goiti saama. <verse eid="LEV 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 1:3"/>Ni ná-vebɛanii ɠa ga togani wolai, é ga gala zalaɠai, toɠa ma zinɛi ta ve, nɛɛʋuzu mina ɠɛ ba. Toɠa kula GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ, ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI daazo. <verse eid="LEV 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 1:4"/>Toɠa yeeʋɛɛ gala zalaɠa loganii unmaʋɛ, naa ɠa nɛɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, ga é ɠɛ tɔun bɛ ga koto gba vai. <verse eid="LEV 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 1:5"/>Toɠa nikɛ zinɛi ɠɔdaaleʋe Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. Zalaɠa ɠula nuiti, Aalɔn ná-doun zunuiti, ta ma ɲamai lɛ ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ti pili zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma, é ɠaku ma kpoloo, é GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 1:6"/>Toɠa gala zalaɠa loganii ɠɔlɔɔ, é teʋeleʋe, é kpulukpulu. <verse eid="LEV 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 1:7"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui Aalɔn ná-doun zunuiti ta abui la zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ, ti koʋii ʋu abui ɠa. <verse eid="LEV 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 1:8"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nuiti, Aalɔn ná-doun zunuiti, ta ma ɓulukpulugiti, ta ma ungi, ta ma wulɔiti da koʋii maazu, zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ abui ɠa. <verse eid="LEV 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 1:9"/>Toɠa koozu zɔɔlaiti ta kɔɠɔiti gba ga ziɛi. Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa ti kpein gala zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ. Gala zalaɠai ʋe, nii abui galazu, makugi nɛai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ.<verse eid="LEV 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 1:10"/>«Ni ná-vebɛanii a ɠɛna ga gala zalaɠai, é ga togani goi, baala ziʋoiti ɓaa boli yiʋoiti, toɠa ma zinɛi ɠula ga zalaɠai, nɛɛʋuzu mina ɠɛ ba. <verse eid="LEV 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 1:11"/>Toɠa kɔdaaleʋe zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɠɔʋɛzuʋɛ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. Zalaɠa ɠula nuiti, Aalɔn ná-doun zunuiti, ta ma ɲamai ʋili zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma, é ɠaku ma kpoloo. <verse eid="LEV 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 1:12"/>Toɠa teʋeleʋe, é kpulukpulu, ta ma ungi, ta ma wulɔi. Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa ti la koʋii maazu, puai abui ɠa, zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 1:13"/>Toɠa koozu zɔɔlaiti, ta ma ɠɔɠɔiti gba ga ziɛi. Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa ti kpein kula ga zalaɠai, é gala, zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ. Gala zalaɠai ʋe, nii abui galazu, makugi nɛai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ.<verse eid="LEV 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 1:14"/>«Ni ná-vebɛanii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, a ɠɛna ga gala zalaɠai, é ga wɔnii, toɠa ʋa ga kpumagoi ɓaa poopo kpokpagi. <verse eid="LEV 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 1:15"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa ʋa ga wɔnii zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ. Toɠa nɔungi volo ba, é gala, zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ. Toɠa ma ɲamai leda zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ laamaʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 1:16"/>Toɠa ma ɠɔzɔgi ta su aniiti kula su, é ti ʋili ya zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɠobaʋɛ, folo ɠulazu ʋelei, zuʋu ʋilisuʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 1:17"/>Toɠa wɔni laaʋali koʋegiti zɔɠɔzuʋɛ, kɛlɛ é mina teʋe su. Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa wɔni ɠala zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ, koʋii maazu, puai abui ɠa. Gala zalaɠai ʋe, nii abui galazu, makugi nɛai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ.<verse eid="LEV 1:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LEV 2"/>
  <para style="s">Vebɛ zalaɠai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 2:1"/>«Siɛgi zu nui ta vebɛ zalaɠa veezu la Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, ná-vebɛanii ɠa ɠɛ ga ani vukɔ ʋagɔi. Toɠa gulɔi ʋu ma, é ansansegi ɓɔ ba. <verse eid="LEV 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 2:2"/>Toɠa ʋaa la zalaɠa ɠula nuiti pɔ, Aalɔn ná-doun zunuiti. Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa zeeɲɛ gila seɠe ani vukɔi zu, nii gulɔi ʋuai ma, é ɓɔ ansansegi kpein ba, é gala, zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ga ɠizɛsui. Zalaɠai ʋe, nii abui galazu, makugi nɛai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 2:3"/>Nii é yɛsu vebɛ zalaɠai ʋolu, naa ɠa ɠɛ ga Aalɔn ta ná-doun zunuiti tɔnɔ. Toɠa ga anii ɲadega wola zalaɠa aniiti saama, ti ɠalazu abui ɠa, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ.<verse eid="LEV 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 2:4"/>«Ni vebɛ zalaɠa ʋe, nii é mɔsu sulugi zu, é ɠɛ ga ɓulu ʋɛlɛʋɛlɛgiti lɛʋɛ la su, é kpɛtɛ ga ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi, gaayɔgai ga gulɔi, ɓaa ɓulu lɛɛvɛiti lɛʋɛ la su, gulɔi ʋuai ma.<verse eid="LEV 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 2:5"/>«Ni vebɛ zalaɠa ʋe, nii é ɠeesu kɔlui maazu, toɠa ɠɛ ga ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi lɛʋɛ la su, gaayɔgai ga gulɔi. <verse eid="LEV 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 2:6"/>Toɠa ɠaleɠale, é ɓulukpulu, gulɔi ʋu maazu. Toɠa ga vebɛ zalaɠai.<verse eid="LEV 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 2:7"/>«Ni vebɛ zalaɠa ʋe, nii é ɠeesu kɔlu liɠii ma, toɠa ɠɛ ga ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi, gaayɔgai ga gulɔi.<verse eid="LEV 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 2:8"/>«Ta ʋa ga vebɛ zalaɠai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɔ, nii kpɛtɛai ga naama aniiti. Toɠa ve zalaɠa ɠula nui ya, é ʋaa la zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 2:9"/>Nii maanɛai, é ɠula ga ɠizɛsui, zalaɠa ɠula nui naa zeɠe ba, é gala, zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ. Zalaɠai ʋe, nii abui galazu, makugi nɛai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 2:10"/>Nii é yɛsu vebɛ zalaɠai ʋolu, naa ɠa ɠɛ ga Aalɔn ta ná-doun zunuiti tɔnɔ. Toɠa ga anii ɲadega wola zalaɠa aniiti saama, ti ɠalazu abui ɠa, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ.<verse eid="LEV 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 2:11"/>«Vebɛ zalaɠai tanɔpɛ wo ɠɛɛzu feezu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, ta la ɓɛtɛa ga lɛʋɛi, mazɔlɔɔ wo la ani nɔpɛ gala, nii lɛʋɛi a ɠɛ su, ɓaa kɔin gulɔi, vebɛaniiti saama, ti ɠalazu abui ɠa, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 2:12"/>Wa zoo wo ta ɠula Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, ga zooi ʋaalɔnɔ mɔungiti ma vebɛanii, kɛlɛ é mina ɠala zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ, eɠɛ vebɛanii makugi nɛai.<verse eid="LEV 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 2:13"/>«Wa kpoloi ʋu wa-vebɛ zalaɠaiti kpein ba. Kpoloi mina ʋala wa-vebɛ zalaɠai zu, wa-ƓALAGI ná-minazeɠegi ma ʋoogi ʋe. Kɛni kpoloi ʋu wa-vebɛaniiti kpein ba.<verse eid="LEV 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 2:14"/>«Ni wa zooi ʋaalɔnɔ mɔungiti ma vebɛ zalaɠai veena Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, wa ani ɠɔpɔ niinɛiti gee dɛ, naa ʋolu wo ti wolowolo, ma vukɔi ɠula. <verse eid="LEV 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 2:15"/>Wa gulɔi ʋu ma, ta ansansegi. Vebɛ zalaɠai ʋe. <verse eid="LEV 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 2:16"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa ma vukɔi ɠilazuʋɛ ɠala, ta gulɔi, é ʋɛɛ ansansegi kpein ba, é ɠɛ ga ɠizɛsui. Zalaɠai ʋe, nii abui galazu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ.<verse eid="LEV 2:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LEV 3"/>
  <para style="s">Ziilɛi zalaɠai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 3:1"/>«Ni nui ta ná-vebɛanii a ɠɛna ga ziilɛi zalaɠai, ni toɠa ga togani wolai, toɠa ma zinɛi ɓaa ma zaai ɠula, nɛɛʋuzu mina ɠɛ ba, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. <verse eid="LEV 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 3:2"/>Toɠa yeeʋɛɛ zalaɠa loganii unmaʋɛ, é kɔdaaleʋe GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ. Zalaɠa ɠula nuiti, Aalɔn ná-doun zunuiti, ta ma ɲamai ʋili zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma, é ɠaku ma kpoloo. <verse eid="LEV 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 3:3"/>Naama yiilɛi zalaɠai zu, nii a kula ba ga zalaɠai, é ɠalazu abui ɠa, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, naa ɠa é ga: ma wulɔi felevelegai koozu zɔɔlaiti ma, ta nii kpein giliai ba, <verse eid="LEV 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 3:4"/>ta ma lɔɠɔ felegɔiti, ta ma wulɔi felevelegai ti ma, é ʋɛɛzu ma zaamalɔkaeiti ma, ta ma mɔɔin ʋasuʋɛ, a kula ma lɔɠɔiti kobaʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 3:5"/>Aalɔn ná-doun zunuiti ta naa ʋɛɛ gala zalaɠai ʋa, nii a ɠɛ koʋii maazu, ti gala zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ. Zalaɠai ʋe, nii abui galazu, makugi nɛai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ.<verse eid="LEV 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 3:6"/>«Ni toɠa ziilɛi zalaɠai ɠulazu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, ga togani goi ta, toɠa ma zinɛi ɓaa ma zaai ɠula, nɛɛʋuzu mina ɠɛ ba. <verse eid="LEV 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 3:7"/>Ni baala ziʋoi ɠa a kula ga zalaɠai, toɠa ʋaa la Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. <verse eid="LEV 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 3:8"/>Toɠa yeeʋɛɛ zalaɠa loganii unmaʋɛ, é kɔdaaleʋe GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ. Aalɔn ná-doun zunuiti ta ma ɲamai ʋili zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma, é ɠaku ma kpoloo. <verse eid="LEV 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 3:9"/>Naama yiilɛi zalaɠai zu, nii a kula ba ga zalaɠai, é ɠalazu abui ɠa, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, naa ɠa é ga: ma wulɔi, ta wɔɔngi kpein, a kula saamalɔkaei ʋa, ta ma wulɔi felevelegai koozu zɔɔlaiti ma, ta nii kpein giliai ba, <verse eid="LEV 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 3:10"/>ta ma lɔɠɔ felegɔiti, ta ma wulɔi felevelegai ti ma, é ʋɛɛzu ma zaamalɔkaeiti ma, ta ma mɔɔin ʋasuʋɛ, a kula ma lɔɠɔiti kobaʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 3:11"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa naa ɠala zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ. Daamiani zalaɠai ʋe, nii abui galazu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ.<verse eid="LEV 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 3:12"/>«Ni ná-vebɛanii a ɠɛna ga bolii, toɠa kula Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. <verse eid="LEV 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 3:13"/>Toɠa yeeʋɛɛ zalaɠa loganii unmaʋɛ, é kɔdaaleʋe GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ. Aalɔn ná-doun zunuiti ta ma ɲamai ʋili zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma, é ɠaku ma kpoloo. <verse eid="LEV 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 3:14"/>Nii a kula ba ga zalaɠai, é ɠalazu abui ɠa, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, naa ɠa é ga: ma wulɔi felevelegai koozu zɔɔlaiti ma, ta nii kpein giliai ba, <verse eid="LEV 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 3:15"/>ta ma lɔɠɔ felegɔiti, ta ma wulɔi felevelegai ti ma, é ʋɛɛzu ma zaamalɔkaeiti ma, ta ma mɔɔin ʋasuʋɛ, a kula ma lɔɠɔiti kobaʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 3:16"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa naa ɠala zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ. Daamiani zalaɠai ʋe, nii abui galazu, makugi nɛai. Ma wulɔi kpein ka ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nɔnɔi.<verse eid="LEV 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 3:17"/>«Nii ɠa ga ɠɔoɠɔ tɔgi wo-mavofodaiti kpein bɛ, ʋɛ nɔpɛ wa zei ná: Wo la sua wulɔi ta ɲamai mia pɛ.»<verse eid="LEV 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LEV 4"/>
  <para style="s">Koto gba zalaɠai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 4:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LEV 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 4:2"/>«Ɓɔɛ Izilayɛle nuiti pɔ, è ɠɛ ti ma: Siɛgi zu nui ta kotoi ɠɛɛzu la, é la kɛɛni ga gaaɠilimai, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-devei ta laalɔɠɔma, é fai ta ɠɛ, nii maa la nɛɛni ga é ʋa ɠɛ, <verse eid="LEV 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 4:3"/>ni zalaɠa ɠula nui ʋe, gulɔ ɲadegai ziaai ma, é nuɓusɛiti kɛ ga sɔba nu, ná-kotoi é kɛai naa maaʋele ma, toɠa nikɛ zinɛ ɓokpagi ɠula ga zalaɠai, nii nɛɛʋuzu la ba, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, é ɠɛ ga koto gba zalaɠai. <verse eid="LEV 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 4:4"/>Toɠa ʋa ga nikɛ zinɛi GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, é yeeʋɛɛ nikɛ zinɛi unmaʋɛ, é kɔdaaleʋe Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. <verse eid="LEV 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 4:5"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui gulɔi ziaai ma, naa ɠa nikɛ zinɛi ma ɲamai ta zeɠe, é lii la GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu, <verse eid="LEV 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 4:6"/>toɠa yeeɓeɠai lɔ ɲamai wu, é ɲamai vaza daa ɠɛ lɔfela, seizu ɲadegai ma ɠwɛpele seɠezuɠoozagi letemaʋɛ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. <verse eid="LEV 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 4:7"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa ɲamai ta ziɛ ansansegiti ma zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma minɛiti ma, nii é Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu. Toɠa nikɛ zinɛi ma ɲamai mɔtai ʋu ya gala zalaɠaiti kulazuʋɛ ɠɔɠɔaʋɛ, nii é GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 4:8"/>Toɠa koto gba nikɛ zinɛi ma wulɔi kpein kula: ma wulɔi felevelegai koozu zɔɔlaiti ma, ta nii kpein giliai ba, <verse eid="LEV 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 4:9"/>ta ma lɔɠɔ felegɔiti, ta ma wulɔi felevelegai ti ma, é ʋɛɛzu ma zaamalɔkaeiti ma, ta ma mɔɔin ʋasuʋɛ, a kula ma lɔɠɔiti kobaʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 4:10"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa tobazuʋɛ naati kula, eɠɛʋelei ti ɠulazu la ziilɛi zalaɠa nikɛ zinɛi ʋa, é ti ɠala, gala zalaɠaiti kulazuʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 4:11"/>Kɛlɛ nikɛ zinɛi ma ɠɔlɔi, ta ma zuai kpein, é ʋɛɛ nɔungi ʋa, ta kɔɠɔiti, ta ma ɠoozu zɔɔlaiti, ta ma ɓooiti, <verse eid="LEV 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 4:12"/>woo zuɓuɠa su, nii kpein zɛgai ʋoluzu nikɛ zinɛi ʋa, toɠa li ga naa ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ ʋoluʋɛ, ada ɲadegai ta, zuʋu ʋilisuʋɛ, é gala abui ɠa, koʋii maazu. Toɠa gala zuʋu ʋilisuʋɛ.<verse eid="LEV 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 4:13"/>«Ni Izilayɛle ʋɛbɛi kpein ka é kotoi ɠɛa, ti la gaaɠilini ma, ti la suɠwɛɛni, ti naa ɠɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-tɔgi taɠila daalɔɠɔma, fai nii ti maa la nɛɛni ga ti ʋa kɛ ɲɛgɛlɛin, ti ɓɔɠɔ ɠɛ ɠana ga sɔba nu, <verse eid="LEV 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 4:14"/>kotoi ti kɛai, naa a ɠulana kɛlɛ zu, bɛbɛi ɠa nikɛ zinɛ ɓokpa gila kula ga koto gba zalaɠai, ta ʋaa la GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 4:15"/>Izilayɛle ɠɛwolaiti ta yeeʋɛɛ nikɛ zinɛi unmaʋɛ, ti kɔdaaleʋe Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. <verse eid="LEV 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 4:16"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui nii gulɔi ziaai ma, naa ɠa li ga nikɛ zinɛi ma ɲamai ta GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu, <verse eid="LEV 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 4:17"/>toɠa yeeɓeɠai lɔ ɲamai wu, é faza, ná zeizu ɠɛ lɔfela Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, kwɛpele seɠezuɠoozagi letemaʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 4:18"/>Toɠa ɲamai ta ziɛ zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma minɛiti su, nii é Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu, ta toɠa ɲamai mɔtai ʋu ya gala zalaɠaiti kulazuʋɛ ɠɔɠɔaʋɛ, nii é GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 4:19"/>Toɠa nikɛ zinɛi ma wulɔi kpein kula, é gala, zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 4:20"/>Toɠa nikɛ zinɛi naa ɠɛ, eɠɛʋelei nɔ koto gba nikɛ zinɛi ɠɛɛzu la. Toɠa kɛ ɠana nɔ. Zekana zalaɠa ɠula nui a koto gba vai ɠɛ la ti ʋɛ, suvaa ɠa yɛ ti ʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 4:21"/>Toɠa li ga nikɛ zinɛi ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ ʋoluʋɛ, é gala, eɠɛʋelei é nikɛ zinɛ mɔungi ɠalani la. Koto gba zalaɠai ɠana bɛbɛi ná-faa zu.<verse eid="LEV 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 4:22"/>«Siɛgi zu kundiɠii ta a kotoi ɠɛɛna la, é la gaaɠilini ma, é kɛ ná-GALAGI, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-devei ta laalɔɠɔma, é fai ta ɠɛ, nii maa la nɛɛni ga é ʋa ɠɛ, é ɓɔɠɔ ɠɛ ɠana ga sɔba nu, <verse eid="LEV 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 4:23"/>a ná-kotoi ɠwɛɛna, nii é kɛai, toɠa boli zinɛi ɠula ga zalaɠai, nii nɛɛʋuzu la ba. <verse eid="LEV 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 4:24"/>Toɠa yeeʋɛɛ boli zinɛi unmaʋɛ, é kɔdaaleʋe, gala zalaɠa loganiiti kɔdaaleʋezuʋɛ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. Koto gba zalaɠai ʋe. <verse eid="LEV 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 4:25"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa koto gba zalaɠai ma ɲamai ta zeɠe ga yeeɓeɠai, é ta ziɛ gala zalaɠaiti kulazuʋɛ ma minɛiti ma, toɠa ɲamai mɔtai ʋu ya gala zalaɠaiti kulazuʋɛ ɠɔɠɔaʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 4:26"/>Toɠa ma wulɔi kpein gala zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ, eɠɛʋelei ziilɛi zalaɠai ma wulɔi la. Zekana zalaɠa ɠula nui a koto gba vai ɠɛ la kundiɠii naa ʋɛ, ná-kotoi vaa zu, suvaa ɠa yɛ bɛ.<verse eid="LEV 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 4:27"/>«Ni nui ta ʋe, nuɓusɛiti saama, é kotoi ɠɛai, é la gaaɠilini ma, é naa ɠɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-tɔgiti ta laalɔɠɔma, é fai ta ɠɛ, nii maa la nɛɛni ga é ʋa ɠɛ ɲɛgɛlɛin, é ɓɔɠɔ ɠɛ ga sɔba nu ɠana, <verse eid="LEV 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 4:28"/>a ná-kotoi ɠwɛɛna, é kɛai, toɠa boli zaai ɠula ga zalaɠai, nii nɛɛʋuzu la ba, kotoi vaa zu nii é kɛai. <verse eid="LEV 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 4:29"/>Toɠa yeeʋɛɛ koto gba loganii unmaʋɛ, é kɔdaaleʋe, gala zalaɠa loganiiti kɔdaaleʋezuʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 4:30"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa suai ma ɲamai ta zeɠe ga yeeɓeɠai, é ta ziɛ gala zalaɠaiti kulazuʋɛ ma minɛiti ma, é ɲamai mɔtai ʋu ya zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɠɔɠɔaʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 4:31"/>Toɠa ma wulɔi kpein kula, eɠɛʋelei ziilɛi zalaɠai ma wulɔi ɠulazu la, é gala, zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ, makugi nɛai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. Zekana zalaɠa ɠula nui a koto gba vai ɠɛ la bɛ, suvaa ɠa yɛ bɛ.<verse eid="LEV 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 4:32"/>«Ni sɔba nui a ʋaana ga baalagi ga koto gba zalaɠai, toɠa ɠɛ ga ma zaai, nii nɛɛʋuzu la ba. <verse eid="LEV 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 4:33"/>Toɠa yeeʋɛɛ koto gba zalaɠa loganii unmaʋɛ, é kɔdaaleʋe, gala zalaɠa loganiiti kɔdaaleʋezuʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 4:34"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa suai ma ɲamai ta zeɠe ga yeeɓeɠai, é ta ziɛ gala zalaɠaiti kulazuʋɛ ma minɛiti ma, é ɲamai mɔtai ʋu ya zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɠɔɠɔaʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 4:35"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa ma wulɔi kpein kula, eɠɛʋelei ziilɛi zalaɠa ʋaala gulɔi ɠulazu la, é gala, zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ, naa ʋɛɛ gala zalaɠai zɔiti ba, ti ɠalazu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. Zekana zalaɠa ɠula nui a koto gba vai ɠɛ la zunui naa ʋɛ, ná-kotoi vaa zu é kɛai, suvaa ɠa yɛ bɛ.<verse eid="LEV 4:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LEV 5"/>
  <para style="s">Kotoi niiti ti zuvaayɛsu <optbreak/> ga koto gba zalaɠai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 5:1"/>«Ni nui ta a faa ɠaana, ɓaa é faa mɛni, naa ʋolu é toligi mɛni ga zeeleiti ti ʋa, kɛlɛ é la kɛɛni, nii é kwɛɛ, é ʋa naama zeele wooi wo, ná-faaɠaaza golai ma ɠasɔi ɠa la unma.<verse eid="LEV 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 5:2"/>«Siɛgi zu nui ta vɔɔɠuzu la kɔzɔba anii ta ʋa, é la suɠwɛɛ, kɔzɔba zuai ta ma ʋoomai, é ɠɛni ga dɔɓɔ zua, ɓaa toganii ta, ɓaa kpokpo ganii, tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ɠa ɠɔzɔ, é ɠɛ ga sɔba nu.<verse eid="LEV 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 5:3"/>«Ni a vɔɔɠuna nui ta ma zii nɔpɛ ba, kɔzɔai, nii a zoo tɔ ɓalaa kɔzɔzu, a suɠwɛɛna nɔ feya, toɠa ɠɛ ga sɔba nu názu.<verse eid="LEV 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 5:4"/>«Ni nui ta a ɓɔɛna soleyai zu, é ɠona ga toɠa faa ɲɔu ɠɛɛzu ɓaa faa ʋagɔi, é la ɠidaani bu, a suɠwɛɛna nɔ feya, toɠa ɠɛ ga sɔba nu názu.<verse eid="LEV 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 5:5"/>«Deɠɛmu, zɔi é ɠɛɛzu ga sɔba nu niima vaiti gila su, toɠa laa zɔ ga ga ná-kotoi. <verse eid="LEV 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 5:6"/>Naa ʋoluma ná-kotoi vaa zu é kɛai, toɠa ʋa ga baala saa ɠila ɓaa boli zaa ɠila, é ɠɛ ga koto gba zalaɠai, faazuɓɛtɛ vai zu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI letema. Zekana zalaɠa ɠula nui a koto gba vai ɠɛ la bɛ, ná-kotoi vaa zu.<verse eid="LEV 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bala nuiti ta-zalaɠai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 5:7"/>«Ni ani la nu ya, a baala saai zɔlɔɔ da, ɓaa boli zaai, ná-kotoi vaa zu é kɛai, toɠa ʋa ga kpumago felegɔ, ɓaa poopo kpokpa felegɔ, faazuɓɛtɛ vai zu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI letema. Gilagi ɠɛ ga koto gba zalaɠai, zɔi ɠɛ ga gala zalaɠai. <verse eid="LEV 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 5:8"/>Toɠa ʋa ga tiye zalaɠa ɠula nui ʋɔ, naa ɠa naa ɠula ga zalaɠai mɔunpa, nii maanɛai é ɠɛ ga koto gba zalaɠai. Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa kɔgi ʋee ga, kɛlɛ é mina nɔungi ɠula ga. <verse eid="LEV 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 5:9"/>Toɠa ma ɲamai ta vaza zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ laamaʋɛ, é ɲamai mɔtai leda zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɠɔɠɔaʋɛ. Koto gba zalaɠai ʋe. <verse eid="LEV 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 5:10"/>Toɠa zɔɔma wɔni ɠɛ ga gala zalaɠai, eɠɛʋelei deveai la tɔgi zu. Zekana zalaɠa ɠula nui a koto gba vai ɠɛ la zunui naa ʋɛ, ná-kotoi vaa zu é kɛai, suvaa ɠa yɛ bɛ.<verse eid="LEV 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 5:11"/>«Ni ani la nu ya, nii a kpumago felegɔ zɔlɔɔ da, ɓaa poopo kpokpa felegɔ, toɠa ʋa ga vebɛanii ná-kotoi ma vaa zu, ga kilo saʋagɔ ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi zu. É mina gulɔ ʋu ma ɲɛgɛlɛin, ta é mina ansanse pɛɛ ba ɓalaa, mazɔlɔɔ toɠa ga koto gba zalaɠai. <verse eid="LEV 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 5:12"/>Toɠa ʋaa la zalaɠa ɠula nui ʋɔ. Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa zeeɲɛ gila seɠe ga ɠizɛsui, é gala, zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ, naa ʋɛɛ zalaɠai zɔiti ba, ti ɠalazu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. Koto gba zalaɠai ʋe. <verse eid="LEV 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 5:13"/>Zekana zalaɠa ɠula nui a koto gba vai ɠɛ la zunui naa ʋɛ, ná-kotoi vaa zu é kɛai, é lo naama vaiti taɠila ba, suvaa ɠa yɛ bɛ. Nii a yɛ ʋoluzu, naa ɠa ɠɛ ga zalaɠa ɠula nui nɔnɔ, eɠɛʋelei a ɗa ɠɛ la ga vebɛ zalaɠai.»<verse eid="LEV 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Faazuɓɛtɛ zalaɠai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 5:14"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LEV 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 5:15"/>«Siɛgi zu nui ta ɠɛɛzu la ga ladalala nu, é kotoi ɠɛ, é la gaaɠilini ma, é makɛ aniiti ba ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ, niiti ti veai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, toɠa baala sinɛi zeɠe, nii nɛɛʋuzu la ba, é kula ga faazuɓɛtɛ zalaɠai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, ná-kotoi vaa zu, eɠɛʋelei sɔngɔi la, é lo seizu ɲadegai ma wali vaiti kɛʋelei ʋa. Faazuɓɛtɛ zalaɠai ʋe. <verse eid="LEV 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 5:16"/>Toɠa fe zalaɠa ɠula nui ya, é pɛɛ anii ná zeizu lɔɔlugɔi ɠilazuʋɛ ʋa, nii feai GALA bɛ. Zekana zalaɠa ɠula nui a koto gba vai ɠɛ la bɛ ga baala sinɛi, nii kulaai ga faazuɓɛtɛ zalaɠai, suvaa ɠa yɛ bɛ.<verse eid="LEV 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 5:17"/>«Ni nui ta a koto ɠɛɛna, é la suɠwɛɛ, é naa ɠɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-devei gila daalɔɠɔma, fai niiti maa la nɛɛni, ti ʋa ɠɛ ɲɛgɛlɛin, toɠa ɓɔɠɔ ɠɛ ga sɔba nu, ná-faaɠaaza golai ma ɠasɔi ɠa la unma. <verse eid="LEV 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 5:18"/>Toɠa ʋa ga baala sinɛi, nii nɛɛʋuzu la ba, é fe zalaɠa ɠula nu ya, ga faazuɓɛtɛ zalaɠai, é seɠe togani ɓulugi zaama, eɠɛʋelei sɔngɔi la. Zekana zalaɠa ɠula nui a koto gba vai ɠɛ la bɛ, ná-kotoi vaa zu é kɛai, é la suɠwɛɛ, suvaa ɠa yɛ bɛ. <verse eid="LEV 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 5:19"/>Faazuɓɛtɛ zalaɠai ʋe, zunui naa ɓɔɠɔ ɠɛɛni ɠiteɠite su ga sɔba nu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI letemazu.»<verse eid="LEV 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 5:20"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LEV 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 5:21"/>«Siɛgi zu nui ta koto ɠɛɛzu la, é ɠɛ ga ladalala nu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI letemazu, é zɛɛi wo seiɲɔɠɔi ma, kaliva ma vaa zu, anii é kalivaai ma ga é makɛ, anii unmaai, ɓaa ta ɠulaai su ga yaavai, <verse eid="LEV 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 5:22"/>ɓaa é laamaɓa ga tooya anii ɠaa vai, ɓaa é zɛɛ ɠonai wo, é lo kotoi tanɔpɛ ba, nuɓusɛi a zoo kɛɛzu, <verse eid="LEV 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 5:23"/>siɛgi zu a kotoi ɠɛɛna la ɠana, é ɓɔɠɔ ɠɛ ga sɔba nu, anii nii é unma, ɓaa é ta ɠula su ga yaavai, toɠa naa ʋotogi ve, ɓaa anii é ɠalivaani ma, ɓaa anii toai ya, é ka, <verse eid="LEV 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 5:24"/>ɓaa anii-yo-anii nii é zɛɛ ɠonai wosu, é lo ba. Toɠa gaavɔnigai ve, é seizu lɔɔlusiɛi ɠilazuʋɛ ɠila pɛɛ ba, é teʋe anii kɛɛ nui ʋɔ, naama voloi nɔ ma, yeei é ná-faa zuɓɛtɛ zalaɠai ɠulazu la. <verse eid="LEV 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 5:25"/>Toɠa ʋa zalaɠa ɠula nui ʋɔ ga ná-faa zuɓɛtɛ zalaɠai, ná-kotoi vaa zu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, ga baala sinɛi nii nɛɛʋuzu la ba, é ɠula togani ɓulugi zu, eɠɛʋelei sɔngɔi la. <verse eid="LEV 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 5:26"/>Zekana zalaɠa ɠula nui a koto gba vai ɠɛ la bɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, suvaa ɠa yɛ bɛ, é ɠɛni ga faaɠaazagi ma zii nɔpɛ, é ɓɔɠɔ ɠɛai su ga sɔba nu.»<verse eid="LEV 5:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LEV 6"/>
  <para style="s">Gala zalaɠaiti <optbreak/> ta vebɛaniiti ma lɔgiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 6:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LEV 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 6:2"/>«Niima levei ve Aalɔn ta ná-doun zunuiti zea, è ɠɛ ti ma: Gala zalaɠai ma lɔgi ɠaa: Gala zalaɠai ɠa yɛ zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma lutui zu, kpidii ɲɛgɛlɛin eyɛsu sobui, zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma abui ɠa yɛ sosu. <verse eid="LEV 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 6:3"/>Sobui, zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa ná-seɠei loo ɠɔba, é ʋɛlɛ kpuɠagi lɛ ɓɔɠɔ ma, niiti ti ga gezei. Toɠa zuʋui ɠula, nii abui kulaai gala zalaɠai ɠalazuʋɛ, toɠa sei zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɠoba. <verse eid="LEV 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 6:4"/>Naa ʋoluma toɠa ná-seɠeiti pu, é taɠiligaa loo, ga é li ga zuʋui ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ ʋoluʋɛ, ada ɲadegai ta zu. <verse eid="LEV 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 6:5"/>Abui ɠa yɛ sosu zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ, é mina za ɲɛgɛlɛin. Sobu-o-sobu, zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa abui lo koʋii ʋa, é gala zalaɠai ɓɛtɛ, é ziilɛi zalaɠaiti ma wulɔi ɠala. <verse eid="LEV 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 6:6"/>Abui ɠa yɛ sosu ɠɔ zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ, é mina za.<verse eid="LEV 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 6:7"/>«Vebɛ zalaɠai ma lɔgi ɠaa: Aalɔn ná-doun zunuiti ta kula Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɠakalaʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 6:8"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa zeeɲɛ gila seɠe ani vukɔi zu, nii gulɔi ʋuai ma, é pɛɛ ansansegi kpein ba. Toɠa naa ɠala zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ga ɠizɛsui, makugi nɛai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 6:9"/>Aalɔn ta ná-doun zunuiti ta vebɛanii mɔtai mi. Ta mi ada ɲadegai ta, GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi ma ɠoizuʋɛ, kɛlɛ lɛʋɛ mina ɠɛ ba. <verse eid="LEV 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 6:10"/>Nu mina lɛʋɛ ʋu ma, é ʋa mɔ da. Tɔnɔi ɠana gè feai ti ʋɛ nà-vebɛaniiti su, ti ɠalazu abui ɠa. Ani ʋe gola ɲadegai, eɠɛ koto gba zalaɠai ɓaa faazuɓɛtɛ zalaɠai. <verse eid="LEV 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 6:11"/>Zunui kpein ka ta mi, Aalɔn ná-doun zunuiti saama. Tɔgi ɠana wo-mavofodaiti kpein bɛ eyɛsu ɠɔ, é lo vebɛaniiti ba, ti ɠalazu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. Nu-o-nu a vɔɔɠu ba, naa ɠa ɲade.»<verse eid="LEV 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 6:12"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LEV 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 6:13"/>«Wɛlɛ vebɛanii ʋa, Aalɔn ta ná-doun zunuiti ta fe Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, foloi ta gulɔ ɲadegai ziɛna la ti ma: kilo saʋagɔ ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi zu, gilazuʋɛ sobui, gilazuʋɛ kpɔkɔi, eɠɛ folo-o-folo vebɛ zalaɠai. <verse eid="LEV 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 6:14"/>Ɓulu vukɔi ɠa ɠaayɔ ga gulɔi, é la gee kɔlui maazu. Ɗa geegai ta teʋeleʋeai ɠula ga vebɛ zalaɠai, makugi nɛai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 6:15"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui niigi, Aalɔn ná-doun zunuiti saama, gulɔ ɲadegai a ziɛ ma ga é zei potogi zu, naa ɓalaa ɠa vebɛanii naa ɠula. Ɠɔoɠɔ tɔgi ʋe. Toɠa ɠala ɲɛgɛlɛin Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. <verse eid="LEV 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 6:16"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ná-vebɛ zalaɠai kpein ka ɠala ɲɛgɛlɛin, tanɔpɛ ge la mia.»<verse eid="LEV 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Koto gba zalaɠai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 6:17"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LEV 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 6:18"/>«Ɓɔɛ Aalɔn ʋɔ ta ná-doun zunuiti, è ɠɛ ti ma: Koto gba zalaɠai ma lɔgi ʋɛtɛ. Adaʋɛ gala zalaɠai ɠɔdaaleʋezu ná, miná ɠa koto gba zalaɠa zuai ɠɔdaaleʋezu ná, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. Ani ʋe gola ɲadegai. <verse eid="LEV 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 6:19"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui é koto gba zalaɠai ɠulazu, naa ɠa mi. Toɠa mi ada ɲadegai ta, GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi ma ɠoizuʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 6:20"/>Nu-o-nu a vɔɔɠu ma zuai ʋa, naa ɠa ɲade. Ni ma ɲamai a vazana seɠe ma, ʋɛ fazagai ná ma, miná ɠa gba ada ɲadegai ta. <verse eid="LEV 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 6:21"/>Pɔlɔ liɠii a ɠili su, naa ɠa wolo. Ni kɔlu ɓɔi diɠii ɠa a ɠili su, su ɠa ɓale, é gba ziɛi wu. <verse eid="LEV 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 6:22"/>Zunui kpein é ga zalaɠa ɠula nui, naa pɛ ka ta mi. Ani ʋe gola ɲadegai. <verse eid="LEV 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 6:23"/>Kɛlɛ nu la zalaɠa zua nɔpɛ mia, nii ma ɲamai a ʋa GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu, ga koto gba vai ʋa ɠɛ ada ɲadegai. Ma zuai ɠa ɠala.<verse eid="LEV 6:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LEV 7"/>
  <para style="s">Faazuɓɛtɛ zalaɠai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 7:1"/>«Wɛlɛ faazuɓɛtɛ zalaɠa lɔgi ʋa: Ani ʋe gola ɲadegai. <verse eid="LEV 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 7:2"/>Adaʋɛ ti gala zalaɠai ɠɔdaaleʋezu ná, miná ɠa faazuɓɛtɛ zalaɠa zuai ɠɔdaaleʋezu ná. Ma ɲamai ɠa ʋili zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma, é ɠaku ma kpoloo. <verse eid="LEV 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 7:3"/>Ta ma wulɔi kpein kula: ma wɔɔngi, ta ma wulɔi felevelegai koozu zɔɔlaiti ma, <verse eid="LEV 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 7:4"/>ta ma lɔɠɔ felegɔiti, ta ma wulɔi felevelegai ti ma, é ʋɛɛzu ma zaamalɔkaeiti ma, ta ma mɔɔin ʋasuʋɛ, a kula ma lɔɠɔiti kobaʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 7:5"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa naa ɠala zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ. Faazuɓɛtɛ zalaɠai ʋe, nii abui galazu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 7:6"/>Zunuiti kpein ti wo zaama ga zalaɠa ɠula nuiti, naati ta ta mi, é mi ada ɲadegai ta. Ani ʋe gola ɲadegai.<verse eid="LEV 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 7:7"/>«Toɠa ɠɛ ɠana faazuɓɛtɛ zalaɠai vaa zu, eɠɛʋelei nɔ é la koto gba zalaɠai vaa zu. Tɔgi naa ɠa ga faa ɠila nɔ zalaɠa felegɔi naati faa zu, ma zuai ɠa ɠɛ ga zalaɠa ɠula nui nɔnɔ, nii é kotoi gbazu. <verse eid="LEV 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 7:8"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui é ʋaazu gala zalaɠai ɠulazu, nui ta ʋɛ, nɔnɔi ɠa ɠɛ ga gala zalaɠai ma ɠɔlɔgi, nii é kulaai ga zalaɠai. <verse eid="LEV 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 7:9"/>Vebɛ zalaɠai kpein mɔgai sulugi zu, ɓaa anii ɠee kɔlu liɠii ma, ɓaa anii ɠee kɔlui maazu, naa ɠa ɠɛ ga zalaɠa ɠula nui nɔnɔ, nii é kulaai. <verse eid="LEV 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 7:10"/>Vebɛ zalaɠai kpein gaayɔgai ga gulɔi, ɓaa ma vɔɔi, naa ɠa ɠɛ ga Aalɔn ná-doun zunuiti kpein tɔnɔ, ti ɠilagilagi pɛ.<verse eid="LEV 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ziilɛi zalaɠai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 7:11"/>«Ziilɛi zalaɠai ma lɔgi ʋɛtɛ, nii nu a kula Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ: <verse eid="LEV 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 7:12"/>Ni nui ta a ziilɛi zalaɠai ɠulana ga mama fee zalaɠai, toɠa kula ga ɓulu ʋɛlɛʋɛlɛgiti lɛʋɛ la su, gaayɔgai ga gulɔi, é ʋɛɛ ɓulu lɛɛvɛi ʋa, nii lɛʋɛ la su, gulɔi ʋuai ma, ta ɓulu ʋɛlɛʋɛlɛgiti, kpɛtɛai ga ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi, gaayɔgai ga gulɔi. <verse eid="LEV 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 7:13"/>Toɠa ɓului ɠula ɓalaa, nii lɛʋɛi su, é pɛɛ ná-ziilɛi zalaɠai ʋa, mama fee vai zu. <verse eid="LEV 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 7:14"/>Vebɛani ɠilagilagi tago ɠa ɠula ma Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. Naa ʋolu ta ɠɛ ga zalaɠa ɠula nui nɔnɔ, nii é ziilɛi zalaɠai ma ɲamai ʋiligai. <verse eid="LEV 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 7:15"/>Ziilɛi zalaɠa zuai ɠa mi, naama voloi nɔ é ɠulazu la mama fee vai zu. Nu mina tanɔpɛ zɛ sobu ʋa zeeli.<verse eid="LEV 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 7:16"/>«Ni nui ta a zalaɠa ɠulana minazeɠe daazeeli vaa zu, ɓaa vebɛanii vaa zu é daai ɠisu, ma zuai ɠa mi, naama voloi nɔ é kulazu la, nii a yɛ ʋoluzu, naa ɠa mi poluma zobui. <verse eid="LEV 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 7:17"/>Nii é yɛsu ga zalaɠa zuai mɔtai foloi zaʋasiɛi, naa ɠa ɠala. <verse eid="LEV 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 7:18"/>Ni nu a naama yiilɛi zalaɠa zuai ta miina foloi zaʋasiɛi, zalaɠai laa la mɔ zoga, é la faa ʋaa naa ma, nii é kula. Toɠa ɠɛ ga anii kɔzɔai, nu-o-nu a ta miina, ná-faaɠaaza golai ma ɠasɔi ɠa la unma.<verse eid="LEV 7:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 7:19"/>«Ma zuai fɔɔɠuai kɔzɔba anii ta ʋa, nu mina naa mi ɲɛgɛlɛin. Ma zuai ɠa ɠala.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 7:19">«Nui niiti kpein ti la ɠɔzɔni tɔgi letemazu, naati ta zoo ti ziilɛi zalaɠa zuai ta mi. <verse eid="LEV 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 7:20"/>Kɛlɛ nui nii kɔzɔai tɔgi letemazu, naa a ziilɛi zalaɠa zuai ta miina, é ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nɔnɔi, naama nui ɓe ka leʋe ná-nuɓusɛiti ba. <verse eid="LEV 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 7:21"/>Zɔi a vɔɔɠuna anii ta ʋa, nii kɔzɔai, nuɓusɛi kɔzɔai, ɓaa suai kɔzɔai, ɓaa ani nɔpɛ é ga kɔzɔba anii, é ziilɛi zalaɠa zuai mi, é ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nɔnɔi, naama nui ɓe ka leʋe ná-nuɓusɛiti ba.»<verse eid="LEV 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tɔgi é lo sua wulɔi <optbreak/> ta ɲamai mii vai ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 7:22"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LEV 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 7:23"/>«Ɓɔɛ Izilayɛle nuiti pɔ, è ɠɛ ti ma: À mina nikɛ, ɓaa baala, ɓaa boli wulɔi mi ɲɛgɛlɛin. <verse eid="LEV 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 7:24"/>Suai saai ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ, ɓaa dɔɓɔ zuai ta paai, naama wulɔi ɠa zoo é ɠɛ ga wo-maavai ta ɠɛɛ anii nɔ, kɛlɛ wo la mia ɲɛgɛlɛin. <verse eid="LEV 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 7:25"/>Zɔi a suai ma wulɔi ta mi, é ɠulazu ga zalaɠai, é ɠalazu abui ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, naama nui ɓe ka leʋe ná-nuɓusɛiti ba. <verse eid="LEV 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 7:26"/>Ʋɛ nɔpɛ wa ɠɛ ná, à mina ɲamai mi, wɔnii nɔnɔi, ɓaa suai nɔnɔi. <verse eid="LEV 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 7:27"/>Zɔi nɔpɛ a ɲamai mi, ma zii nɔpɛ, naama nui ɓe ka leʋe ná-nuɓusɛiti ba.»<verse eid="LEV 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ti-laamiizuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 7:28"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LEV 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 7:29"/>«Ɓɔɛ Izilayɛle nuiti pɔ, è ɠɛ ti ma: Zɔi a ná-ziilɛi zalaɠai ɠula Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, toɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nɔnɔi zeɠe ba. <verse eid="LEV 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 7:30"/>Zalaɠai nii maanɛai é ɠala abui ɠa, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, toɠa ʋa ga naa ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ, ma wulɔi, ta ma ɠekegi, é ti latɛɠɛ vai ma ʋoogi ɠɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. <verse eid="LEV 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 7:31"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa ma wulɔi ɠala zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ. Ma ɠekegi ɠa ɠɛ ga Aalɔn ta ná-doun zunuiti tɔnɔ. <verse eid="LEV 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 7:32"/>Wa-yiilɛi zalaɠaiti ka, wa ma yeezazu ɓalai ve zalaɠa ɠula nui ya. <verse eid="LEV 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 7:33"/>Aalɔn ná-doun zunuiti su, zɔi a ziilɛi zalaɠai ma ɲamai ta ma wulɔi ɠulana, naa ɠa ma yeezazu ɓalai zɔlɔɔ, é ɠɛ ga nɔnɔ. <verse eid="LEV 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 7:34"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ziilɛi zalaɠaiti su, nii Izilayɛle nuiti ti kulazu, ma ɠekegi ta ma ɓalai niiti ta ɗa ɠula ga datɛɠɛ vai ma ʋoogi, nà ti zeɠe, gè ti ve zalaɠa ɠula nui Aalɔn ya ta ná-doun zunuiti zea, ga ɠɔoɠɔ tɔgi Izilayɛle nuiti ta so.»<verse eid="LEV 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 7:35"/>Daamiizuʋɛ ɠana, Aalɔn ta ná-doun zunuiti ti sɔlɔɔsu, zalaɠaiti su ti ɠalaai abui ɠa, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, é zo naama voloi ma, yeei ti lɛɛzu la ga ti zalaɠa ɠula wotii ɠɛ. <verse eid="LEV 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 7:36"/>Naa ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI Izilayɛle nuiti devezu la, ga é ve ti ya, é zo naama voloi ma, yeei gulɔ ɲadegai ziaa la ti ma. Toɠa ɠɛ ga ɠɔoɠɔ tɔgi ti-mavofodaiti kpein bɛ.<verse eid="LEV 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 7:37"/>Gala zalaɠai ma lɔgiti kana, ta vebɛ zalaɠai, ta koto gba zalaɠai, ta faazuɓɛtɛ zalaɠai, ta nu zei vai ma zalaɠai, ta ziilɛi zalaɠai. <verse eid="LEV 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 7:38"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma leveiti feeni Moize ya, Sinayi gizei ma, voloi é devei veeni la Izilayɛle nuiti zea, ga ti ta-vebɛanii ve Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ Sinayi teʋebai zu.<verse eid="LEV 7:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LEV 8"/>
  <para style="ms1">Zalaɠa Ɠula Nu Mɔungiti <optbreak/> Fee Vai GALA Bɛ</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="LEV 8:1-10:20">8:1—10:20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Aalɔn ta ná-doun zunuiti <optbreak/> fee vai GALA bɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 29:1-37">Ɛgezɔde 29:1-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 8:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LEV 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 8:2"/>«Aalɔn zeɠe ta ná-doun zunuiti ʋɔɔma, ta zalaɠa ɠula zeɠeiti, ta siɛma wulɔ ɲadegai, ta koto gba nikɛ zinɛi, ta baala sinɛ felegɔiti, ta ɓului lɛʋɛ la su, naama ɓɔlɔgi. <verse eid="LEV 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 8:3"/>Bɛbɛi kpein toli GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ.» <verse eid="LEV 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 8:4"/>Moize naa ɠɛɛni, nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI deveni ga é kɛ. É bɛbɛi ɠaalɛɛni ba GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ.<verse eid="LEV 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 8:5"/>Moize ɠɛni bɛbɛi ma: «À pɛtɛ, nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI deveai ga é ɠɛ.» <verse eid="LEV 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 8:6"/>Moize ʋaani ga Aalɔn ta ná-doun zunuiti, é ti maagba ga ziɛi. <verse eid="LEV 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 8:7"/>É seɠewuzeɠei looni Aalɔn ɠɔba, é saamaɠili ga saamaɠiligi. É tookɔba wolai looni kɔba, é zalaɠa ɠula zeɠei loo maazu, é gili ga zalaɠa ɠula zeɠei ma lokoi. <verse eid="LEV 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 8:8"/>É kakazu zeɠei ʋilini kɔbu, é wuulimegi ta tumimegi ʋu kakazu zeɠei zu. <verse eid="LEV 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 8:9"/>É bɔɔlɔgi lɔɔni nɔungi ʋa, é zanu sɛʋɛ goi ɠili kakalaʋɛ, nii é ga fee vai ma ʋoogi GALA bɛ, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma levei veeni la Moize ya.<verse eid="LEV 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 8:10"/>Moize siɛma wulɔ ɲadegai zeɠeni, é siɛ seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai ma, ta aniiti kpein ti ɠɛni ná, ʋele ɠana é ti veeni la GALA bɛ. <verse eid="LEV 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 8:11"/>É faza daa ɠɛɛni lɔfela zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma. É gulɔi ziɛni zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma, ta ná-sɔɔlaiti kpein, ta maagba aniɲakai ta ná-seiga anii, naa ɠa a kɛ é ti ve GALA bɛ. <verse eid="LEV 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 8:12"/>É siɛma wulɔ ɲadegai ʋuuni Aalɔn nɔungi zu, é ta ziɛ ma, nii a kɛ é fe GALA bɛ. <verse eid="LEV 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 8:13"/>Moize ʋaani ga Aalɔn ná-doun zunuiti, é ti maaɠili ga seɠewuzeɠeiti, é ti zaamaɠili ga saamaɠiligiti, é bɔɔlɔgiti dɔ ti unba, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma levei veeni la zea.<verse eid="LEV 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 8:14"/>É ʋaani ga koto gba nikɛ zinɛi. Aalɔn ta ná-doun zunuiti ti yeeiti pɛɛni koto gba nikɛ zinɛi unmaʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 8:15"/>Moize kɔdaaleʋeni, é ɲamai zeɠe, é ta ziɛ ga yeeɓeɠai zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma minɛiti ma, é zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɲade. É ɲamai mɔtai ʋuuni ya, zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɠɔɠɔaʋɛ, é ɲade ga koto gba vai ɗa ɠɛ ná. <verse eid="LEV 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 8:16"/>É ma wulɔi kpein seɠeni, nii felevelegai koozu zɔɔlaiti ma, ta ma mɔɔin ʋasuʋɛ, ta ma lɔɠɔ felegɔiti, é ɓɔ ti-ma wulɔiti ba, é naa ɠalani zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 8:17"/>Kɛlɛ é nikɛ zinɛi mɔtai ɠalani ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ ʋoluʋɛ, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma levei veeni la zea: ma zuai, ta ma ɠɔlɔi, naa ʋɛɛ ma ɓooiti ba.<verse eid="LEV 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 8:18"/>É ʋaani ga gala zalaɠai ma ʋaala sinɛi. Aalɔn ta ná-doun zunuiti ti yeeiti pɛɛni baala sinɛi unmaʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 8:19"/>Moize kɔdaaleʋeni, é ma ɲamai ʋili zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma, é ɠaku ma kpoloo. <verse eid="LEV 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 8:20"/>É baala sinɛi leʋeleʋeni, é kpulukpulu. É ma ungi ɠalani, ta ma ɓulukpulugiti, naa ʋɛɛ ma wulɔi ʋa. <verse eid="LEV 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 8:21"/>É koozu zɔɔlaiti gbani ga ziɛi, ta kɔɠɔiti. É baala sinɛi pɛ galani zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ. Gala zalaɠai ɠɛni de, zalaɠai nii abui galaai, makugi nɛai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma levei veeni la Moize ya.<verse eid="LEV 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 8:22"/>É ʋaani ga zɔɔma ʋaala sinɛi, ti zei vai ma ʋaala sinɛi. Aalɔn ta ná-doun zunuiti ti yeeiti pɛɛni baala sinɛi unmaʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 8:23"/>Moize baala sinɛi ɠɔdaaleʋeni, é ma ɲamai ta zeɠe, é siɛ Aalɔn yeezazu ʋele woi yɔkpɔgi ma, ta zeezazu yeezinɛkpotogi ma, ta zeezazu ɠɔɠɔzinɛkpotogi ma. <verse eid="LEV 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 8:24"/>É ʋaani ga Aalɔn ná-doun zunuiti, é ɲamai ziɛ ti-yeezazu ʋelei woi yɔkpɔgiti ma, ta ti-yeezazu yeezinɛkpotogiti, ta ti-yeezazu ɠɔɠɔzinɛkpotogiti. É ɲamai mɔtai ʋilini zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma, é ɠaku ma kpoloo. <verse eid="LEV 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 8:25"/>É ma wulɔi zeɠeni, ta ma wɔɔngi, ta ma wulɔi kpein felevelegai koozu zɔɔlaiti ma, ta ma mɔɔin ʋasuʋɛ, ta ma lɔɠɔ felegɔiti, é ɓɔ ti-ma wulɔi ʋa, ta zeezazu ɓalai. <verse eid="LEV 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 8:26"/>Ɓului lɛʋɛ la su, naama ɓɔlɔgi, nii seiɗai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠakala, é ɓulu ɠila seɠeni naama ɓɔlɔgi zu, ta ɓulu ʋɛlɛʋɛlɛ gila gulɔi ba, ta ɓulu lɛɛvɛ ɠila, é ti ʋuuni zalaɠa zuai ma wulɔi ma, ta ma yeezazu ɓalai ma. <verse eid="LEV 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 8:27"/>É naama aniiti kpein puuni Aalɔn ta ná-doun zunuiti zea waa, ga ti ti latɛɠɛ vai ma ʋoogi ɠɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. <verse eid="LEV 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 8:28"/>Naa ʋolu, Moize ti ɠulani ti ya, é ti ɠala, zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ, gala zalaɠai maazu. Ti zei vai ma zalaɠai ɠɛni de, zalaɠai nii abui galaai, makugi nɛai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ.<verse eid="LEV 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 8:29"/>Moize ti zei vai ma ʋaala sinɛi ma ɠekegi zeɠeni, é datɛɠɛ vai ma ʋoogi ɠɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. Moize nɔnɔi ɠɛni ga naa, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma levei veeni la zea.<verse eid="LEV 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 8:30"/>Moize siɛma wulɔ ɲadegai ta zeɠeni, ta ɲamai ta, nii é ɠɛni zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ. É ti vaza Aalɔn ta ná-seɠeiti ma, naa ʋɛɛ Aalɔn ná-doun zunuiti ta ta-zeɠeiti ba. É Aalɔn veeni GALA bɛ, ta ná-seɠeiti, naa ʋɛɛ ná-doun zunuiti ta ta-zeɠeiti ba.<verse eid="LEV 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 8:31"/>Moize ɠɛni Aalɔn ta ná-doun zunuiti ma: «À suai ɠili GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ. Miná ɠa wa mi ná, é ʋɛɛ ɓului ʋa, nii é wo zei vai ma ɓɔlɔgi zu, eɠɛʋelei gè deveni la, gè ɠɛ ma: ‹Aalɔn ta ná-doun zunuiti ta mi.› <verse eid="LEV 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 8:32"/>Suai ta ɓului mɔtai é yɛsu, wa naa ɠala. <verse eid="LEV 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 8:33"/>Wa yɛ GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ eyɛsu folo lɔfela, wo mina zeɠe ná, eyɛsu wo zei voloi liegɔi laazeeli, mazɔlɔɔ folo lɔfela ɠa é ɠɛɛzu ga wo zei voloi. <verse eid="LEV 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 8:34"/>Nii kɛai za, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI deveʋɛ ga naa ɠɛ wo ʋɛ ga koto gba vai. <verse eid="LEV 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 8:35"/>Wa yɛsu deɠɛmu GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ folo lɔfela, folo ʋɛɛ kpidi ʋa, wa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-deveiti so, naa ɠa a kɛ wo mina za, mazɔlɔɔ naa ɠa ma levei veeni zèa.» <verse eid="LEV 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 8:36"/>Aalɔn ta ná-doun zunuiti ti naama vaiti kpein kɛɛni, nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma levei veeni ga Moize maaʋele.<verse eid="LEV 8:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LEV 9"/>
  <para style="s">Aalɔn ta ná-doun zunuiti <optbreak/> ti lɔɔ vai botii zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 9:1"/>Foloi lɔsaʋasiɛi ma, Moize Aalɔn ta ná-doun zunuiti tolini, ta Izilayɛle ɠɛwolaiti, <verse eid="LEV 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 9:2"/>é ɠɛ Aalɔn ma: «Nikɛ yiʋo zinɛ ɠila seɠe koto gba zalaɠa vai zu, ta baala sinɛ ɠila gala zalaɠa vai zu, nɛɛʋuzu mina ɠɛ tanɔpɛ ba, è ti lo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. <verse eid="LEV 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 9:3"/>Ɗa ɓɔɛ Izilayɛle nuiti pɔ, è ɠɛ ti ma: ‹À boli zinɛ ɠila seɠe koto gba zalaɠai vaa zu, ta nikɛ yiʋo ɠila, ta baala ziʋo ɠila, kona gila keleiti, nɛɛʋuzu mina ɠɛ ti ʋa, gala zalaɠai vaa zu, <verse eid="LEV 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 9:4"/>ta nikɛ zinɛ ɠila, ta baala sinɛ ɠila ziilɛi zalaɠai vaa zu, naa ɠa a kɛ, ti ɠula ga zalaɠai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, ta vebɛ zalaɠai, nii é ga ani vukɔi, gaayɔgai ga gulɔi. Mazɔlɔɔ za Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa ɠulazu kɛlɛma wo ʋɛ.› »<verse eid="LEV 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 9:5"/>Nii Moize deveni, ti ʋaani ga naa GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ. Bɛbɛi kpein ge maaɓuɠani ná ʋa, ti lo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. <verse eid="LEV 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 9:6"/>Moize ɠɛni ma: «Wa naa ɠɛ, nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI deveai, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-lɛbiyai ɠa ʋaazu ɠulazu kɛlɛma wo ʋɛ.» <verse eid="LEV 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 9:7"/>Moize ɠɛni Aalɔn ma: «Maaɓuɠa zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ʋa. Ɗa-ɠotoi gba zalaɠai ɠula, ta ɗa-ɠala zalaɠai, è koto gba vai ɠɛ ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ, ta nuɓusɛiti bɛ. Nuɓusɛiti ta-vebɛanii ɠula, è koto gba vai ɠɛ ti ʋɛ, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI deveni la.»<verse eid="LEV 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 9:8"/>Aalɔn maaɓuɠani zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ʋa, é nikɛ yiʋoi ɠɔdaaleʋe tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ná-kotoi gba vai zu. <verse eid="LEV 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 9:9"/>Aalɔn ná-doun zunuiti ti ɲamai veeni zea. É yeeɓeɠai lɔɔni ɲamai wu, é ta ziɛ zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma minɛiti ma. É ɲamai mɔtai ʋuuni ya zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɠɔɠɔaʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 9:10"/>É ma wulɔi ɠalani zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ, ta ma lɔɠɔiti, ta koto gba zalaɠa zuai ma mɔɔin ʋasuʋɛ, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma levei veeni la Moize ya. <verse eid="LEV 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 9:11"/>Kɛlɛ é ma zuai ta ma ɠɔlɔgi ɠalani abui ɠa, ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ ʋoluʋɛ.<verse eid="LEV 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 9:12"/>Aalɔn gala zalaɠa loganii ɠɔdaaleʋeni. Ná-doun zunuiti ti ɲamai veeni zea, é pili zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma, é ɠaku ma kpoloo. <verse eid="LEV 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 9:13"/>Ti gala zalaɠai veeni zea, teʋeleʋeai, é ɓulukpulu, é ʋɛɛ ma ungi ʋa, é ti ɠala zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 9:14"/>É koozu zɔɔlaiti ta kɔɠɔiti gbani, é ti ɠala zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ, gala zalaɠai maazu.<verse eid="LEV 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 9:15"/>Naa ʋolu, é nuɓusɛiti ta-zalaɠai ɠulani. É boli zinɛi zeɠeni nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠoto gba zalaɠai, é kɔdaaleʋe, é kula koto gba vai zu, eɠɛʋelei zalaɠa zua mɔungi ɠɛni la. <verse eid="LEV 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 9:16"/>É gala zalaɠai ɠulani, eɠɛʋelei deveai la tɔgi zu. <verse eid="LEV 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 9:17"/>É vebɛ zalaɠai ɠulani, é zeeɲɛ gila seɠe su, é naa ɠala zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ. Naa la ɓɔni gala zalaɠai ʋa, nii kulaai sobui.<verse eid="LEV 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 9:18"/>É nikɛ zinɛi ɠɔdaaleʋeni, ta baala sinɛi ga ziilɛi zalaɠai, nuɓusɛiti faa zu. Aalɔn ná-doun zunuiti ti ɲamai veeni zea, é pili zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma, é ɠaku ma kpoloo. <verse eid="LEV 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 9:19"/>Ti nikɛ zinɛi ta baala sinɛi ma wulɔi veeni zea: ma wɔɔngi, ta ma wulɔi é koozu zɔɔlaiti maavelevelegai, ta ma lɔɠɔiti, ta ma mɔɔin ʋasuʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 9:20"/>Ti ma wulɔiti puuni ma ɠekegiti su, é ma wulɔi ɠala zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 9:21"/>Aalɔn ma ɠekegiti ta zeezazu ɓalai zeɠeni, é ti latɛɠɛ vai ma ʋoogi ɠɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, eɠɛʋelei Moize ma levei veeni la.<verse eid="LEV 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 9:22"/>Aalɔn yeeiti tɛɛni geezu nuɓusɛiti pɔ pelei, é tuya loo ti ʋɛ. Kpegai ma ga koto gba zalaɠai ɠula, ta gala zalaɠai, naa ʋɛɛ ziilɛi zalaɠai ʋa, é zeɠeni zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ, é yei. <verse eid="LEV 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 9:23"/>Moize ta Aalɔn ti lɛɛni GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu. Siɛgi zu ti ɠulani la ná, ti tuya looni nuɓusɛiti bɛ. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-lɛbiyai ɠulani kɛlɛma nuɓusɛiti kpein bɛ. <verse eid="LEV 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 9:24"/>Abui ɠulani Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɔ bɛ, é gala zalaɠai ɠala, ta ma wulɔiti, niiti ti ɠɛni zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ. Nuɓusɛiti kpein ti kaani. Ti kpeeiti tooni ga koozunɛɛi, ti nɔkɔ.<verse eid="LEV 9:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LEV 10"/>
  <para style="s">Aalɔn ná-doun zunu felegɔiti <optbreak/> saa vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 10:1"/>Aalɔn ná-doun zunuiti Nadaɓe ta Aɓiyu ti ta-ansanse gala liɠiiti seɠeni, ti abulekaiti pu ti zu, ti ansansegi ʋu maazu. Naazu ti ʋaani ga abu ɠiligi Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, niigi GALA ge la ɠɛni ma leve veeni. <verse eid="LEV 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 10:2"/>Gaamago nɔ, abui ɠulani Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɔ bɛ, é ti ɠala. Ti zaani Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠakala.<verse eid="LEV 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 10:3"/>Moize ɠɛni Aalɔn ma: «Naa ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI boni, siɛgi zu é ɠɛni la: ‹Niiti ti maaɓuɠazu bà, kɛni ti unfe nà-ɲadedai ma. Nà lɛbiyai zɔlɔɔ nuɓusɛiti kpein gaazu.› » Aalɔn maaɠɛni kpɔ.<verse eid="LEV 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 10:4"/>Moize Misayɛle lolini ta Ɛlɛsafan, Uziyɛle ná-doun zunuiti, nii é ga Aalɔn kɛɛɠɛ kɛɛɠɛloin, é ɠɛ ti ma: «À maaɓuɠa bà, wo wo-ɠɛɛlointi seɠe, wo li ga tiye ade-ʋuuzuʋɛ ʋoluʋɛ, wo ti maaɠooza seizu ɲadegai ʋa.» <verse eid="LEV 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 10:5"/>Ti maaɓuɠani ba, ti ti zeɠe ta-zeɠewuzeɠeiti su, ti li ga tiye ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ ʋoluʋɛ, eɠɛʋelei Moize boni la.<verse eid="LEV 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 10:6"/>Moize ɠɛni Aalɔn ma, ta Eleazaal, ta Itamaal, Aalɔn ná-doun zunuiti: «À mina wɔundeɠaiti zɛ yaɠaba, wo mina wa-zeɠeiti bali ga, saa wɔlɔ vai zu, naa ɠa a kɛ, wo mina za, wo ʋa GALA ná-ziiɠaawanai maaloli bɛbɛi kpein ma. À wo-ɠɛɛlointi Izilayɛle ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti kpein zɛ ná, ti wɔlɔ naati ta-vaa zu, niiti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ti ɠalaai ga abui, nii é gaazogai. <verse eid="LEV 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 10:7"/>À mina zeɠe GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ, naa ɠa a kɛ wo mina za, mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-siɛma wulɔ ɲadegai ɠa wo ma.» Ti naa ɠɛɛni, nii Moize bogai.<verse eid="LEV 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Devei tanigaani, <optbreak/> é lo zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 10:8"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Aalɔn ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LEV 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 10:9"/>«Mina dɔɔ ɓɔle, ɓaa kpɔleɓɔle ani nɔpɛ, nii a nu ɠaazulati, ɗa-o, è-loun zunuiti-yo, siɛgi zu wa ɠɛ lɛɛzu la GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu, naa ɠa a kɛ wo mina za. Naa ɠa ɠɛ ga ɠɔoɠɔ tɔgi wo-mavofodaiti kpein bɛ. <verse eid="LEV 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 10:10"/>Mazɔlɔɔ kɛni wo zoo zeeɠaaɠwɛɛzu ɠwɛɛsu ani ɲadegai ta ɲadetala gelei ʋa, ta nii kɔzɔai ta nii é la ɠɔzɔni. <verse eid="LEV 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 10:11"/>À Izilayɛle nuiti kala ga tɔgi kpein, nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI feeni ti ya ga Moize maaʋele.»<verse eid="LEV 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 10:12"/>Moize ɠɛni Aalɔn ma, ta doun zunu felegɔiti ti yɛni zea, Eleazaal ta Itamaal: «À vebɛ zalaɠai mɔtai zeɠe, nii é la ɠalani abui ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. À mi zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɠobaʋɛ, lɛʋɛ mina ɠɛ ba, mazɔlɔɔ ani ʋe ɲadegai. <verse eid="LEV 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 10:13"/>Wa mi ada ɲadegai ta, naa ɠa é ga wo-laamiizuʋɛ, wa è-loun zunuiti, zalaɠa aniiti saama, ti ɠalazu abui ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, mazɔlɔɔ devei ɠa naa, é veeni zèa. <verse eid="LEV 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 10:14"/>Ma ɠekegi ta ma ɓalai niiti ti ɠula ga datɛɠɛ vai ma ʋoogi, wa naati mi ada ɲadegai ta, ɗa-o, è-loun zunuiti-yo, ta è-loun anzanuiti ti è ʋɔ bɛ, mazɔlɔɔ ti veeʋɛ wo ʋɛ, ga é leve ɗɔun è ʋɛ, wa è-loun zunuiti, Izilayɛle nuiti ta-yiilɛi zalaɠaiti su. <verse eid="LEV 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 10:15"/>É ɠula gulɔiti polu, ti maanɛai ti ɠala, Izilayɛle nuiti ta ʋa ga ma ɠekegi ta ma ɓalai. Ti ɠulaai ma ga datɛɠɛ vai ma ʋoogi, ta ɠɛ ga ɗɔnɔ, wa è-loun zunuiti, ti è ʋa, ɠɔoɠɔ tɔgi ɠa ɠɛ ga ná, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI deveni la.»<verse eid="LEV 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 10:16"/>Moize koto gba woli zinɛi ɠaiziɛni, kɛlɛ galaa ɠɛni de niina. É yiiɠaawanani naazu Eleazaal ma, ta Itamaal, Aalɔn ná-doun zunuiti ti yɛni ná, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LEV 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 10:17"/>«Leeni vaa zu wo la koto gba zalaɠa zuai miini ada ɲadegai ta? Toɠa ga anii gola ɲadegai, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI feai wo ʋɛ, naa ɠa a kɛ wo bɛbɛi ná-faaɠaazagi zeɠe, naa ɠa a kɛ wo ná-kotoi gba bɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. <verse eid="LEV 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 10:18"/>Wɛlɛ, wo la liini ga zalaɠa zuai ma ɲamai seizu ɲadegai ɠoozuʋɛ. Wo maanɛɛni, wo zalaɠai ma zuai mi ada ɲadegai ta, eɠɛʋelei gè ma levei veai la.» <verse eid="LEV 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 10:19"/>Aalɔn ɠɛni Moize ma: «Wɛlɛ, ti ta-ɠoto gba zalaɠai ɠulaa za, ta ta-ɠala zalaɠai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. È suɠwɛɛni sɔ, nii kɛai ga ze. Ni za gè ɠɛa koto gba zalaɠai miini, naa a la ɠɛ ga faa ʋagɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu ɓaa?» <verse eid="LEV 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 10:20"/>Moize naama wooiti mɛnini, é yeezei ti wu.<verse eid="LEV 10:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LEV 11"/>
  <para style="ms1">Kɔzɔba Vai <optbreak/> Ta Ɲade Faiti</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="LEV 11:1-16:34">11:1—16:34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Sua ɲadegaiti <optbreak/> ta kɔzɔba geleiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 14:3-21">Tɔ Sɛʋɛi Velesiɛi 14:3-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 11:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ ta Aalɔn, é ɠɛ ti ma: <verse eid="LEV 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 11:2"/>«À ɓɔɛ Izilayɛle nuiti pɔ, wo ɠɛ ti ma: Suaiti kpein saama, niiti ti eteai zu, wɛlɛ niiti ka wa zoo wo ti mi. <verse eid="LEV 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 11:3"/>Wa zoo wo suai ma zii pɛ mi, nii polokagi ɠaaʋaliai, é miizu, é ɗa tɛ ʋolu. <verse eid="LEV 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 11:4"/>Kɛlɛ niiti wo la ti mia, anɛɛ ni ti-ʋolokagi ɠaaʋaliʋɛ, ɓaa ti miizu, ti ɗa tɛ ʋolu, naati ta ga niiti: ɲɔmɛi, anɛɛ ni toɠa miizu, é ɗa tɛ ʋolu, kɛlɛ polokagi ɠaa la ʋalini. Wa deve ga kɔzɔʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 11:5"/>Foevoegoi ɓalaa ɠa miizu, é ɗa tɛ ʋolu, kɛlɛ polokagi ɠaa la ʋalini, wa deve ga kɔzɔʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 11:6"/>Zaɓei ɓalaa ɠa miizu, é ɗa tɛ ʋolu, kɛlɛ polokagi ɠaa la ʋalini, wa deve ga kɔzɔʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 11:7"/>Boigi ɓalaa, polokagi ɠaaʋaliʋɛ, kɛlɛ é la miizu, é ʋa ɗa tɛ ʋolu, wa deve ga kɔzɔʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 11:8"/>À mina ti-ma zuai ta mi, wo mina vɔɔɠu ti-ma ʋoomai ta ʋa. Wa ti leve ga ti ɠɔzɔʋɛ.<verse eid="LEV 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 11:9"/>«Ziɛ wu zuaiti kpein su, wɛlɛ niiti ka wa zoo wo ti mi: niiti ma woekegi ti ʋa, ta maaɠalai ti ma, ti ziɛiti bu, é ɠɛni ga kpoloɗɛiti ɓaa ziɛ wolaiti. <verse eid="LEV 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 11:10"/>Kɛlɛ wa naati deve ga ti ɠɔzɔʋɛ, niiti kpein ma woeke ge la ti ʋa, ɓaa maaɠala la ti ma, ti kpein saama, ti yɛnvuzu ziɛi wu, é ɠɛni ga kpoloɗɛiti ɓaa ziɛ wolaiti. <verse eid="LEV 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 11:11"/>Wa ti leve ga ti ɠɔzɔʋɛ. À mina ti-ma zuai ta mi, wa ti-ma ʋoomai leve ga ti ɠɔzɔʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 11:12"/>Wa naati kpein deve ga ti ɠɔzɔʋɛ wo ɠaazu, niiti ti ziɛiti bu, ma woeke ge la ti ʋa, maaɠala la ti ma.<verse eid="LEV 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 11:13"/>«Wɔniiti saama, wɛlɛ niiti ka wa ti leve ga ti ɠɔzɔʋɛ, nu la ti mia: ɗuai ma zii pɛ, koɠɛi ma zii pɛ, <verse eid="LEV 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 11:14"/>seeʋei ma zii pɛ, <verse eid="LEV 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 11:15"/>kalawɔnii ma zii pɛ, <verse eid="LEV 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 11:16"/>sizigoi ma zii pɛ, buungi ma zii pɛ, <verse eid="LEV 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 11:17"/>kpoloɗɛ laaʋɛ wɔnii ma zii tanigaa, <verse eid="LEV 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 11:18"/>ziɛ wɔnii ma zii tanigaa, <verse eid="LEV 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 11:19"/>ta zɛgbɛlutugi, ta dɛvɛi.<verse eid="LEV 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 11:20"/>«Fuluani goi kpein koʋegi ba, é ɗa ziɛ ɠɔɠɔiti ga, wa naati deve ga ti ɠɔzɔʋɛ wo ɠaazu. <verse eid="LEV 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 11:21"/>Kɛlɛ fuluaniiti kpein saama, ti ɠoʋesu, ti ɗa ziɛ ɠɔɠɔiti ga, wa zoo wo naati mi, niiti ti-ɓeɠaiti ti ti-ɠɔɠɔzapalagiti maazuʋɛ, ti ɗa ʋili zooi ma. <verse eid="LEV 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 11:22"/>Pɛtɛ nii wa zoo wo mi: kotogi ta kpazinɛgi, ta ti-ma ziiti. <verse eid="LEV 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 11:23"/>Wa fuluani zɔiti deve ga ti ɠɔzɔʋɛ, niiti ti ɠoʋesu, ta kɔɠɔi ti ʋa.<verse eid="LEV 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 11:24"/>«Suai tanigaa ta ná, ta zoo ti wo ɠɔzɔ, nu-o-nu a vɔɔɠu ti-ma ʋoomai ta ʋa, naa ɠa ɠɔzɔ eyɛsu kpɔkɔi zeeli. <verse eid="LEV 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 11:25"/>Nu-o-nu a ti-ma ʋoomai ta zeɠe, kɛni é ná-seɠeiti gba. Kɔzɔai ɠa yɛ de, eyɛsu kpɔkɔi. <verse eid="LEV 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 11:26"/>Wa suai naa kpein deve ga kɔzɔʋɛ, nii polokagi ba kɛlɛ kɔɠɔi ɠaa la ʋalini, ɓaa é la miizu, é ʋa ɗa tɛ. Nu-o-nu a vɔɔɠu ta ʋa, toɠa ɠɔzɔ. <verse eid="LEV 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 11:27"/>Wa naati kpein deve ga ti ɠɔzɔʋɛ, niiti ti-ɠɔɠɔi naani, ti ziɛzu ti-ɠɔɠɔzapalagiti ga. Nu-o-nu a vɔɔɠu ti-ma ʋoomai ta ʋa, toɠa ɠɔzɔ eyɛsu kpɔkɔi zeeli. <verse eid="LEV 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 11:28"/>Nu-o-nu a ti-ma ʋoomai ta zeɠe, kɛni é ná-seɠeiti gba. Kɔzɔai ɠa yɛ de, eyɛsu kpɔkɔi. Wa ti leve ga ti ɠɔzɔʋɛ.<verse eid="LEV 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 11:29"/>«Pɛtɛ, sua goiti saama, ti ɓokposu zooi ma, niiti wa ti leve ga ti ɠɔzɔʋɛ, naati ta ga: inɛgi ma zii pɛ, <verse eid="LEV 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 11:30"/>ta zeegoi, ta kooloi ma zii pɛ. <verse eid="LEV 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 11:31"/>Wa ti leve ga ti ɠɔzɔʋɛ, sua goiti saama. Nu-o-nu a vɔɔɠu ti-ma ʋoomai ta ʋa, toɠa ɠɔzɔ eyɛsu kpɔkɔi zeeli. <verse eid="LEV 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 11:32"/>Sɔɔla kpein, ti-ma ʋoomai ta a vɔɔɠu ba, naa ɠa ɠɔzɔ: gulu aniɲakai, ɓaa seɠei, ɓaa kɔlɔ, ɓaa ɓɔlɔ, ɓaa aniɲaka kpein nu a ɓɛdɛ ɠula su. Kɛni é gba ga ziɛi, kɛlɛ kɔzɔai ɠa yɛ de eyɛsu kpɔkɔi zeeli, naa ʋolu toɠa ɲade niina. <verse eid="LEV 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 11:33"/>Ni ti-ma ʋoomai a loona pɔlɔ liɠii zu, su anii ɠa ɠɔzɔ, wa aniɲakai naa wolo. <verse eid="LEV 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 11:34"/>Daamiani kpein a ɠɛ ga nu mi, ni pɔlɔ liɠii naa zu ɗɛi ta a ʋuuna ma, naa ɠa ɠɔzɔ. Ni ti-ma ʋoomai a loona aniɲakai nɔpɛ su, kpɔɔle ani kpein, nii a ɠɛ su, naa ɠa ɠɔzɔ. <verse eid="LEV 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 11:35"/>Sɔɔla kpein, ti-ma ʋoomai ta a vɔɔɠu ba, naa ɠa ɠɔzɔ. Ni a ɠɛna ga sulugi ɓaa abu laazuʋɛti, wa ti ɠoloɠolo. Ti ɠɔzɔʋɛ, wa ti leve ga ti ɠɔzɔʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 11:36"/>Ni a ɠɛna ga ziɛungi ɓaa ziɛ makɛsuʋɛti, naati ti la ɠɔzɔa, ti ɲadegai ɠa yɛ de, kɛlɛ zɔi nɔpɛ a vɔɔɠu ti-ma ʋoomai ta ʋa, naa ɠa ɠɔzɔ. <verse eid="LEV 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 11:37"/>Ti-ma ʋoomai ta a loona ani zuwu ma, nii é vazasu, naa ɲadegai ɠa yɛ de. <verse eid="LEV 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 11:38"/>Kɛlɛ ni nu a ziɛi ʋuuna ani zuwui ma, ta ti-ma ʋoomai ta loo ani zuwui naa ma, wa deve ga kɔzɔʋɛ.<verse eid="LEV 11:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 11:39"/>«Suaiti ti ɠɛɛzu wo ʋɛ ga daamianigi, naa ta a zaana, zɔi a vɔɔɠu ma ʋoomai ʋa, toɠa ɠɔzɔ eyɛsu kpɔkɔi zeeli. <verse eid="LEV 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 11:40"/>Zɔi a ma zua ʋoomai ta mi, kɛni é ná-seɠeiti gba. Kɔzɔai ɠa yɛ de, eyɛsu kpɔkɔi. Zɔi a ma ʋoomai zeɠe, kɛni é ná-seɠeiti gba. Kɔzɔai ɠa yɛ de, eyɛsu kpɔkɔi.<verse eid="LEV 11:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 11:41"/>«Wa sua goi naati kpein deve ga ti ɠɔzɔʋɛ, niiti ti ɓokposu zooi ma. Nu mina ta mi ɲɛgɛlɛin. <verse eid="LEV 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 11:42"/>À mina sua goi naa tanɔpɛ mi ɲɛgɛlɛin, niiti ti ɓokposu zooi ma, anɛɛ niiti ti ɓokposu ɠogi ma, anɛɛ niiti ti ziɛzu ɠɔɠɔ naanigɔiti ga, ɓaa ɠɔɠɔ mɔinmɔingiti ga, mazɔlɔɔ wa ti leve ga ti ɠɔzɔʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 11:43"/>À mina ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔ ga naama zuaiti ti ɓokposu. À mina ɓɔɠɔ ɠɛ ga ɲadetala nu ga ti maaʋele. <verse eid="LEV 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 11:44"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, wa-ƓALAGI. À ɓɔɠɔ ɲade, wa ɲade, mazɔlɔɔ nɔ̀un ɲàdegɛ. À mina ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔ ga naama zua goiti, ti ɓokposu zooi ma. <verse eid="LEV 11:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 11:45"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nii é wo ɠula Ezipete yooi ʋa, ga gè ɠɛ ga wa-ƓALAGI. À ɲade, mazɔlɔɔ nɔ̀un ɲàdegɛ.»<verse eid="LEV 11:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 11:46"/>Tɔgi ɠana, é ʋilɛ suaiti ta-vai ʋa, ta wɔniiti, ta fuluaniiti kpein ti vulua, ti yɛnvuzu ziɛiti bu, ta fuluaniiti ti ɓokposu zooi ma, <verse eid="LEV 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 11:47"/>naa ɠa a kɛ wo zɔɠɔzu ɠwɛɛ ani ɲadegaiti ba, ta niiti ti ɠɔzɔai, suai nu a mi, ta suai nu la mia.<verse eid="LEV 11:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LEV 12"/>
  <para style="s">Anzanui a doin zɔlɔɔna, <optbreak/> naa ɲade fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 12:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LEV 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 12:2"/>«Ɓɔɛ Izilayɛle nuiti pɔ, è ɠɛ ti ma: Siɛgi zu anzanui a kogi zeɠena la, é doun zunu zɔlɔɔ, toɠa ɠɔzɔ folo lɔfela laawu. Toɠa ɠɔzɔ eɠɛ ná-alu kaa ziɛgi ma yeeɠɛɠalai. <verse eid="LEV 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 12:3"/>Foloi lɔsaʋasiɛi ma, doungoi ɠa lati pɛlɛʋolu. <verse eid="LEV 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 12:4"/>Toɠa yɛ dɛ mɔnɔ ɓɔɠɔ ɲadesu folo ʋuusaʋagɔ maazu saʋagɔ (33) laawu ɲamai vaa zu, é mina vɔɔɠu ani ɲadega ɠila kpalaa ba, é mina li seizu ɲadegai, eyɛsu ná-ɲade foloiti daazeeli.<verse eid="LEV 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 12:5"/>«Ni a anzanu loun zɔlɔɔna, kɔzɔai ɠa yɛ de dɔɔɠɔ felegɔ laawu, eɠɛ ná-alu kaa ziɛgi ma yeeɠɛɠalai. Toɠa yɛ ɓɔɠɔ ɲadesu folo ʋuulɔzita maazu lɔzita (66) laawu.<verse eid="LEV 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 12:6"/>«Siɛgi zu ná-ɲade foloiti daazeelizu la, zunu loin ná-faa zu, ɓaa anzanu loin ná-faa zu, toɠa ʋa ga kona gila baala ziʋoi zalaɠa ɠula nui ʋɔ, GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ, ga é kɛ ga gala zalaɠai, ta poopo kpokpa gila, ɓaa kpumago ɠila, é kɛ ga koto gba zalaɠai. <verse eid="LEV 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 12:7"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa ti ɠula Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, é koto gba vai ɠɛ bɛ. Toɠa ɲade naama ɲama ɠula ba vai ma kɛai la. Tɔgi ɠana anzanui ná-faa zu, nii é zunu loin zɔlɔɔsu, ɓaa anzanu loin. <verse eid="LEV 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 12:8"/>Ni ani la nu ya, a baala ziʋoi zɔlɔɔ da, toɠa kpumago felegɔ zeɠe, ɓaa poopo kpokpa felegɔ, gilagi ɠa ɠɛ ga gala zalaɠai, zɔi ɠɛ ga koto gba zalaɠai. Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa koto gba vai ɠɛ bɛ, toɠa ɲade.»<verse eid="LEV 12:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LEV 13"/>
  <para style="s">Tɔgiti é lo kulama zeeɓɛiti ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 13:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ta Aalɔn ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ti ma: <verse eid="LEV 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 13:2"/>«Siɛgi zu nui ta ɠɔlɔgi maaɓokolosu da, ɓaa poʋoɠulɔi ɠɛ ma, ɓaa gɛlɛɠɛlɛgi, nii é ɠɛɛzu ga kulama zeeɓɛi kɔlɔgi ma, ta lii la zalaɠa ɠula nui Aalɔn ʋɔ, ɓaa ná-doun zunui taɠila pɔ. <verse eid="LEV 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 13:3"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa seeɓɛi ɠɛʋele ʋɛtɛ, nii kulaai kɔlɔgi ma. Ni ma leɠai ɠoleʋɛ su, é yei, suɠooza kɔlɔgi ʋa, toɠa ga kulama zeeɓɛi ma zii ta. Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa kɛʋele ʋɛtɛ, é dɛɛ ga nui naa ɠɔzɔʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 13:4"/>Ni ani ɠolekolegi é kɔlɔgi ma, é la yeini, su ʋa ɠooza kɔlɔgi ʋa, ma leɠai la ɠoleni, zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa naama nui lɛ pɛlɛi wu, é daaɠulu ma, é yɛ ná folo lɔfela laawu. <verse eid="LEV 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 13:5"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa kɛʋele ʋɛtɛ foloi lɔfelasiɛi ma. Ni seeɓɛi la ɠɛ liini luɠɔma, ta é la vazani kɔlɔgi ma, zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa tɛ pɛlɛi wu mɔnɔ ná zeizu velesiɛi, é daaɠulu ma folo lɔfela laawu. <verse eid="LEV 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 13:6"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa kɛʋele ʋɛtɛ, ná zeizu velesiɛi foloi lɔfelasiɛi ma. Ni tago zuzasaga, é la vazani kɔlɔgi ma, zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa dɛɛ ga nui naa ɲadegɛ, poʋoɠulɔi ʋe. Toɠa ná-seɠeiti gba, toɠa ɲade. <verse eid="LEV 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 13:7"/>Kɛlɛ ni poʋoɠulɔi a vazana kɔlɔgi ma, é ɓɔɠɔ lɛa ʋoluma ga zalaɠa ɠula nui, naa dɛɛ ga ɲadegɛ, toɠa ɓɔɠɔ lɛ ga zalaɠa ɠula nui ná zeizu velesiɛi. <verse eid="LEV 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 13:8"/>Naa ɠa kɛʋele ʋɛtɛ. Ni poʋoɠulɔi vazagɛ kɔlɔgi ma, zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa dɛɛ ga kɔzɔʋɛ. Kulama zeeɓɛi ma zii ta ʋe.<verse eid="LEV 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 13:9"/>«Siɛgi zu kulama zeeɓɛi ma zii ta ɠɛɛzu la nui ta ʋa, ta lii la zalaɠa ɠula nui ʋɔ. <verse eid="LEV 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 13:10"/>Naa ɠa kɛʋele ʋɛtɛ. Ni kɔlɔgi maaɓokologɛ, é ɠole, ta maaɓokolosuʋɛ ma leɠai ɠole, ta ma zua lɛtɛgi ɓokolo su, <verse eid="LEV 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 13:11"/>kulama zeeɓɛi ʋe é naama nui ɠɔlɔgi wu. Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa dɛɛ ga kɔzɔʋɛ, é la tɛa pɛlɛ wu, é ʋa daaɠulu ma, mazɔlɔɔ kɔzɔʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 13:12"/>Ni kulama zeeɓɛi a ɠulana ma, é kɔlɔgi maazeɠe, é zo nɔungi ma, eyɛsu é zeeli kɔɠɔiti ma, ʋɛti zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠaazulosu naati ba, <verse eid="LEV 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 13:13"/>naa ɠa kɛʋele ʋɛtɛ. Ni a kaana ga kulama zeeɓɛi kɔlɔgi maaʋɛ pɛ seɠea, toɠa dɛɛ ga nui nii seeɓɛi ba, ɲadegɛ, tɔɔzei maaʋɛ ɠolea ɲɛgɛlɛin, ɲadegɛ. <verse eid="LEV 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 13:14"/>Kɛlɛ voloi ta ma zua lɛtɛgi ɠaa la tɔun ba, toɠa ɠɔzɔ. <verse eid="LEV 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 13:15"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa kɛʋele ʋɛtɛ. Ni a ma zua lɛtɛgi ɠaana, toɠa dɛɛ ga kɔzɔʋɛ. Ma zua lɛtɛgi ɠɔzɔʋɛ, kulama zeeɓɛi ma zii ta ʋe. <verse eid="LEV 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 13:16"/>Ni ma zua lɛtɛgi a valibona, é ɠole, toɠa li zalaɠa ɠula nui ʋɔ bɛ. <verse eid="LEV 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 13:17"/>Naa ɠa kɛʋele ʋɛtɛ. Ni kɔlɔgi maaɠolea, zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa dɛɛ ga nui nii seeɓɛi ba, ɲadegɛ.<verse eid="LEV 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 13:18"/>«Siɛgi zu divologi losu la nui ta ʋa, divologi zeɠe ba, é ɠɛdɛ, <verse eid="LEV 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 13:19"/>ʋɛ divologi ɠɛni ná, ani ɓudɔ ɠole ga ɠulana ná, ɓaa ani ɠolegi maaɓɔikpɔigai, naama nui ɠa ɓɔɠɔ lɛ ga zalaɠa ɠula nui. <verse eid="LEV 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 13:20"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa kɛʋele ʋɛtɛ. Ni seeɓɛi yeiʋɛ, suɠooza kɔlɔgi ʋa, ta ma leɠai ɠole, zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa dɛɛ ga kɔzɔʋɛ. Kulama zeeɓɛi ma zii ta ʋe, nii kulaai divologi zu. <verse eid="LEV 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 13:21"/>Kɛlɛ ni zalaɠa ɠula nui a kaana ga seeɓɛi zuzasagɛ, é la yeini, su ʋa ɠooza kɔlɔgi ʋa, ma leɠai ʋa ɠole, toɠa nui naa lɛ pɛlɛi wu, é daaɠulu ma folo lɔfela laawu. <verse eid="LEV 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 13:22"/>Ni seeɓɛi a vazana kɔlɔgi ma, zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa dɛɛ ga kɔzɔʋɛ. Kulama zeeɓɛi ma zii ta ʋe. <verse eid="LEV 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 13:23"/>Kɛlɛ ni seeɓɛi a yɛna ada ɠilagi nɔ, é la vazani maaʋɛ, toɠa ga divologi ma ʋilii. Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa dɛɛ ga ɲadegɛ.<verse eid="LEV 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 13:24"/>«Siɛgi zu abui nui ta maaɠalazu la, gɛlɛɠɛlɛ kolegi ɠula galazuʋɛ ʋogi zu, ɓaa koleai maaɓɔikpɔi, <verse eid="LEV 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 13:25"/>zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa kɛʋele ʋɛtɛ. Ni ma leɠai a ɠolena gɛlɛɠɛlɛgi zu, é yei suɠooza kɔlɔgi ʋa, kulama zeeɓɛi ʋe, nii kulaai gala ʋilii zu. Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa dɛɛ ga nui naa ɠɔzɔʋɛ. Kulama zeeɓɛi ma zii ta ʋe. <verse eid="LEV 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 13:26"/>Kɛlɛ ni zalaɠa ɠula nui a kaana ga seeɓɛi zuzasagɛ, é la yeini, su ʋa ɠooza kɔlɔgi ʋa, ma leɠai ʋa ɠole, toɠa nui naa lɛ pɛlɛi wu, é daaɠulu ma folo lɔfela laawu. <verse eid="LEV 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 13:27"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa kɛʋele ʋɛtɛ foloi lɔfelasiɛi ma. Ni seeɓɛi vazaga kɔlɔgi ma, zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa dɛɛ ga kɔzɔʋɛ. Kulama zeeɓɛi ma zii ta ʋe. <verse eid="LEV 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 13:28"/>Kɛlɛ ni seeɓɛi a yɛna ada ɠilagi nɔ, é la vazani kɔlɔgi ma, suzasaga, gala ʋilii maaɓokologi nɔ ʋe, zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa dɛɛ ga ɲadegɛ, mazɔlɔɔ gala ʋilii ʋe.<verse eid="LEV 13:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 13:29"/>«Siɛgi zu seeɓɛi ɠɛɛzu la zunui ta ɓaa anzanui ta nɔungi zu, ɓaa nɛkpɛi ʋa, <verse eid="LEV 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 13:30"/>zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa seeɓɛi ɠɛʋele ʋɛtɛ. Ni zeiʋɛ, suɠooza kɔlɔgi ʋa, ma leɠai ma ɓɔikpɔigi ɠa su, pɛlɛʋɛlɛgai, zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa dɛɛ ga nui naa ɠɔzɔʋɛ. Gɛlɛɠɛlɛgi ʋe, kulama zeeɓɛi ma zii ta ʋe é nɔungi zu, ɓaa é nɛkpɛi ʋa. <verse eid="LEV 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 13:31"/>Ni zalaɠa ɠula nui a kaana ga seeɓɛi la yeini, su ʋa ɠooza kɔlɔgi ʋa, ma leɠa ʋagɔ la ná, toɠa tɛ pɛlɛi wu, é daaɠulu ma folo lɔfela laawu. <verse eid="LEV 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 13:32"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa seeɓɛi ɠɛʋele ʋɛtɛ foloi lɔfelasiɛi ma. Ni ma leɠai ma ɓɔikpɔi ge la su ɲɛgɛlɛin, seeɓɛi la vazani ma, é ʋa yei, su ʋa ɠooza kɔlɔgi ʋa, <verse eid="LEV 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 13:33"/>zɔi seeɓɛi ma, naa ɠa nɔungi wo ta kpɛlɛi, kɛlɛ é la miná woga, ʋɛ seeɓɛi ná. Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa tɛ pɛlɛi wu mɔnɔ ná zeizu velesiɛi, é daaɠulu ma folo lɔfela laawu. <verse eid="LEV 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 13:34"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa seeɓɛi ɠɛʋele ʋɛtɛ foloi lɔfelasiɛi ma. Ni seeɓɛi la vazani ma, é ʋa yei, su ʋa ɠooza kɔlɔgi ʋa, zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa dɛɛ ga ɲadegɛ. Toɠa ná-seɠeiti gba, toɠa ɲade. <verse eid="LEV 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 13:35"/>Kɛlɛ ni seeɓɛi a vazana kɔlɔgi ma, dɛai ʋoluma ga ɲadegɛ, <verse eid="LEV 13:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 13:36"/>zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa kɛʋele ʋɛtɛ. Ni seeɓɛi vazagɛ kɔlɔgi ma, zalaɠa ɠula nui la mɔ wɛlɛa ga ma leɠa ɓɔikpɔi faa, kɔzɔʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 13:37"/>Ni seeɓɛi la liini luɠɔma gaazu, ma leɠa ʋagɔiti ti ʋɔnɔga, seeɓɛi ɠɛdɛga, é ɲadega. Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa dɛɛ ga ɲadegɛ.<verse eid="LEV 13:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 13:38"/>«Siɛgi zu gɛlɛɠɛlɛ kolegiti ti ɠulazu la zunui ta ɓaa anzanui ta maaʋɛ, <verse eid="LEV 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 13:39"/>zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa kɛʋele ʋɛtɛ. Ni gɛlɛɠɛlɛgi ɠaaɠolekolegɛ, seeɓɛi ʋe, é la ɲɔuni, nui naa ɲadegɛ.<verse eid="LEV 13:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 13:40"/>«Siɛgi zu zunui ta ɠɛɛzu ná la, undeɠa la unma, toɠa ga kpaana nui, ɲadegɛ. <verse eid="LEV 13:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 13:41"/>Ni undeɠa la unma tosaamaʋɛ, é ʋa toʋala ʋelei, kpaana nui ʋe kakala ʋelei, ɲadegɛ. <verse eid="LEV 13:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 13:42"/>Kɛlɛ ni seeɓɛi koleai maaɓɔikpɔi naa ɠa kpaanagi zu, kakala ʋelei ɓaa poluʋelei, kulama zeeɓɛi ɠana, kulaai kpaanagi zu. <verse eid="LEV 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 13:43"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa kɛʋele ʋɛtɛ. Ni seeɓɛi ɓokologɛ, é ɠole, maaɓɔikpɔi kpaanagi zu, poluʋelei ɓaa kakala ʋelei, kulaai ga kulama zeeɓɛi kɔlɔgi ma, <verse eid="LEV 13:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 13:44"/>kulama zeeɓɛi ma zii ta ʋe, kɔzɔʋɛ. Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa dɛɛ ga kɔzɔʋɛ. Nɔungi zu ɠa seeɓɛi ná.<verse eid="LEV 13:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 13:45"/>«Seeɓɛ nui ɠa ná-seɠei ʋali ga, é too ɠɔba, é nɔundeɠaiti zɛ yaɠaba, é daaʋɛ maalɔɔɠu, é ɗa kpeei loo, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: ‹Kɔ̀zɔʋɛ! Kɔ̀zɔʋɛ!› <verse eid="LEV 13:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 13:46"/>Eyɛsu seeɓɛi ɓe ba, toɠa yɛ kɔzɔyai zu. Tɔɔzei kɔzɔʋɛ, tɔ ɠila ka a zei yɛ, seizuʋɛ ɠa ɠɛ ga ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ ʋoluʋɛ.<verse eid="LEV 13:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fuinfuingiti <optbreak/> maaɠili zɔɔlaiti ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 13:47"/>«Siɛgi zu fuinfuingi ʋogi a ɠɛna la seɠei zu, baala deɠa zeɠei zu, ɓaa geze zeɠei zu, <verse eid="LEV 13:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 13:48"/>ɓaa fɛlɛ zeɠei zu, ɓaa kɔlɔ zeɠei ta ʋa, ɓaa kɔlɔ zɔɔlai tanɔpɛ ba, <verse eid="LEV 13:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 13:49"/>ni fuinfuingi ʋogi a ɓiinkpiinna ɓaa é ɓɔikpɔi seɠei zu, ɓaa kɔlɔi zu, fuinfuingi ʋe, maanɛai é lɛ ga zalaɠa ɠula nui. <verse eid="LEV 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 13:50"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa kɛʋele ʋɛtɛ. Toɠa naama anii lɛ pɛlɛi wu, é daaɠulu ma folo lɔfela laawu. <verse eid="LEV 13:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 13:51"/>Toɠa kɛʋele ʋɛtɛ foloi lɔfelasiɛi ma. Ni fuinfuingi ʋogi a vazana seɠei zu, ɓaa kɔlɔi ma, toɠa ga fuinfuingi, é sumiizu, anii naa ɠɔzɔʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 13:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 13:52"/>Toɠa seɠei ɠala, ɓaa kɔlɔi, niigi fuinfuingi ʋogi ba, mazɔlɔɔ fuinfuingi ʋe, é sumiizu. Toɠa ɠala.<verse eid="LEV 13:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 13:53"/>«Kɛlɛ ni zalaɠa ɠula nui a kaana ga fuinfuingi ʋogi la vazani seɠei zu, ɓaa kɔlɔi, <verse eid="LEV 13:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 13:54"/>zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa devei ve ga ti naa gba, nii fuinfuingi ʋɛai ba. Toɠa tɛ pɛlɛi wu, é daaɠulu ma ná zeizu velesiɛi folo lɔfela laawu. <verse eid="LEV 13:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 13:55"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa fuinfuingi naa ʋɛtɛ, anii naa gbaai ʋoluma. Ni fuinfuingi ʋogi la zeɠeni ɠɛʋele ma, anɛɛ ni é la vazani, anii naa ɠɔzɔʋɛ. Toɠa ɠala, anɛɛ ni fuinfuingi ɠa gaazu ʋagɔi ɓaa gaazu ɲɔi ma. <verse eid="LEV 13:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LEV 13:56"/>Ni a kaana ga fuinfuingi ʋogi ɠaazasaga, anii naa gbaai ʋoluma, toɠa ná leʋe seɠei ʋa, ɓaa kɔlɔi. <verse eid="LEV 13:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LEV 13:57"/>Ni fuinfuingi ʋogi a ɠulana mɔnɔ kɛlɛma seɠei ma, ɓaa kɔlɔi, fuinfuingi ʋe, é sumiizu. Nii fuinfuingi ʋɛai ba, naa ɠa ɠala. <verse eid="LEV 13:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LEV 13:58"/>Seɠei ɓaa kɔlɔi nii gbaai, fuinfuingi ʋogi zeɠe ba, naa ɠa gba ʋolu ná zeizu velesiɛi, toɠa ɲade.»<verse eid="LEV 13:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LEV 13:59"/>Tɔgi ɠana, é ʋilɛ ani nɔpɛ ba, nii maaʋɛ vuinfuinsu, é ɠɛni ga baala deɠa zeɠei, ɓaa geze zeɠei, ɓaa fɛlɛ zeɠei, ɓaa kɔlɔ zeɠei, ɓaa kɔlɔ zɔɔlai tanɔpɛ, pelegi a ɠwɛɛ da ni ɲadegɛ, ɓaa ni kɔzɔʋɛ.<verse eid="LEV 13:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LEV 14"/>
  <para style="s">Tɔgi é lo kulama zeeɓɛi <optbreak/> ma ɲade fai ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 14:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LEV 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 14:2"/>«Wɛlɛ pelegi tɔgi a ɠɛ la, é ʋilɛ kulama zeeɓɛ nui ʋa, ná-ɲade foloi vaa zu. Ta ʋaa la zalaɠa ɠula nui ʋɔ. <verse eid="LEV 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 14:3"/>Toɠa ɠula ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ ʋa, é kulama zeeɓɛ nui ɠɛʋele ʋɛtɛ. Ni kulama zeeɓɛ nui ɠɛdɛga, <verse eid="LEV 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 14:4"/>zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa devei ve ga ti wɔni felegɔ zeɠe, ti vulua, ti ɲadegai, ta sɛdele gulu ɓuɠai, ta geze ɓɔi sɔsɔgi, ta ɠizɔɔpe tufa ɓifɔgi, ná-ɲade fai zu. <verse eid="LEV 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 14:5"/>Toɠa devei ve ga ti wɔnii gila kɔdaaleʋe pɔlɔ liɠii maazu, daavegai ga ziɛungi zu ɗɛi. <verse eid="LEV 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 14:6"/>Toɠa wɔni vului zeɠe, ta sɛdele gulu ɓuɠai, ta geze ɓɔi sɔsɔgi, ta ɠizɔɔpe tufa ɓifɔgi, é ti lɔ wɔnii ɠɔdaaleʋeai ma ɲamai wu. <verse eid="LEV 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 14:7"/>Toɠa faza daa ɠɛ lɔfela naa ma, nii kulama zeeɓɛi ɠɛa ma, maanɛai ga é ɲade. Naa ʋolu toɠa dɛɛ ga ɲadegɛ, é yeeɓe wɔni vului ʋa, é li dɔɓɔi zu.<verse eid="LEV 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 14:8"/>«Zɔi é ɓɔɠɔ ɲadesu, naa ɠa ná-seɠeiti gba, é ɓɔɠɔ maaleɠai kpein bo, a maagbana ziɛi wu, toɠa ɲade. Naa ʋolu toɠa zoo é lɛ ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ, kɛlɛ é la zeiɗa ná-seɠe ɠotai wu, eyɛsu folo lɔfela leʋe. <verse eid="LEV 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 14:9"/>Folo lɔfelasiɛi, toɠa maaleɠai kpein bo mɔnɔ, nɔungi ta kpɛlɛi, ta gaazu ɠɔ poluʋɛti. Toɠa ná-seɠeiti gba, é ɓusɛi maagba ga ziɛi, toɠa ɲade niina.<verse eid="LEV 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 14:10"/>«Foloi lɔsaʋasiɛi, toɠa baala ziʋo zinɛ felegɔiti seɠe, niiti nɛɛʋuzu la ti ʋa, ta kona gila baala saai, nii nɛɛʋuzu la ba, ta ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi kilo taaʋuugɔ, nii gaayɔgai ga gulɔi, ta gulɔi litɛlɛ ɠaaɠwɛsui, é ɠɛ ga vebɛ zalaɠai. <verse eid="LEV 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 14:11"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui nii é ɲade fai ɠɛɛzu, naa ɠa zunui ɠula kɛlɛma, nii é ɓɔɠɔ ɲadesu, ta naama aniiti kpein Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 14:12"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa baala ziʋo zinɛiti gila seɠe, é kula ga faazuɓɛtɛ zalaɠai, é ʋɛɛ gulɔi litɛlɛ lukpɛgi ʋa. Toɠa ti latɛɠɛ vai ma ʋoogi ɠɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. <verse eid="LEV 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 14:13"/>Toɠa baala ziʋoi ɠɔdaaleʋe, ʋɛ ta ɗa koto gba zalaɠa zuaiti kɔdaaleʋe ná, ta gala zalaɠaiti, ada ɲadegai ta, mazɔlɔɔ faazuɓɛtɛ zalaɠai ma zuai ɠa ga zalaɠa ɠula nui nɔnɔ, eɠɛʋelei koto gba zalaɠai ma zuai la, ani ʋe gola ɲadegai. <verse eid="LEV 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 14:14"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa faazuɓɛtɛ zalaɠa zuai ma ɲamai ta zeɠe, é siɛ naa yeezazu woi yɔkpɔgi ma, nii é ɓɔɠɔ ɲadesu, ta zeezazu yeezinɛkpotogi ma, naa ʋɛɛ zeezazu ɠɔɠɔzinɛkpotogi ʋa. <verse eid="LEV 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 14:15"/>Toɠa gulɔi naa ta zeɠe, é pu ɠɔʋɛzu yeei ɠa. <verse eid="LEV 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 14:16"/>Toɠa yeeɓeɠai lɔ gulɔi wu, nii é kɔʋɛzu yeei ɠa, é gulɔi vaza daa ɠɛ lɔfela ga yeeɓeɠai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. <verse eid="LEV 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 14:17"/>Toɠa gulɔi ta zeɠe, nii é kɔʋɛzu yeei ɠa, é siɛ naa yeezazu woi yɔkpɔgi ma, nii é ɓɔɠɔ ɲadesu, ta zeezazu yeezinɛkpotogi ma, naa ʋɛɛ zeezazu ɠɔɠɔzinɛkpotogi ʋa, ʋɛ faazuɓɛtɛ zalaɠa zuai ma ɲamai ziaai ná. <verse eid="LEV 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 14:18"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa gulɔi mɔtai zeɠe, zɛgai zea, é siɛ naa nɔungi ma, nii é ɓɔɠɔ ɲadesu, naa ɠa a kɛ é koto gba vai ɠɛ tɔun bɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. <verse eid="LEV 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 14:19"/>Naa ʋoluma, toɠa koto gba zalaɠai ɠula, é koto gba vai ɠɛ naa ʋɛ, nii é ɓɔɠɔ ɲadesu ná-kɔzɔba vai ma. Naa ʋolu toɠa gala zalaɠa loganii ɠɔdaaleʋe. <verse eid="LEV 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 14:20"/>Toɠa gala zalaɠai ta vebɛ zalaɠai ɠula zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ. Toɠa koto gba vai ɠɛ zunui naa ʋɛ, naa ɠa ɲade.<verse eid="LEV 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɲadedai é lo bala nui ʋa, <optbreak/> nii kulama zeeɓɛi ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 14:21"/>«Ni toɠa ga bala nui, ná-sɔlɔɔgiti ti la kula ɠɛa su, toɠa baala ziʋo zinɛ ɠila nɔ zeɠe, nii a ɠula ga faazuɓɛtɛ zalaɠai, é datɛɠɛ vai ma ʋoogi ɠɛ, koto gba vai ɠɛ la tɔun bɛ. Toɠa ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi kilo saʋagɔ zeɠe, gaayɔgai ga gulɔi, ta gulɔi litɛlɛ ɠaaɠwɛsui, é ɠɛ ga vebɛ zalaɠai. <verse eid="LEV 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 14:22"/>Toɠa kpumago felegɔ zeɠe ɓalaa, ɓaa poopo kpokpa felegɔ, eɠɛʋelei ná-sɔlɔɔgiti ti la. Gilagi ɠɛ ga koto gba zalaɠai, zɔi ɠɛ ga gala zalaɠai. <verse eid="LEV 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 14:23"/>Folo lɔsaʋasiɛi, toɠa ʋa ga naama aniiti kpein zalaɠa ɠula nui ʋɔ, GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, ná-ɲade fai zu. <verse eid="LEV 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 14:24"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa faazuɓɛtɛ zalaɠai ma ʋaala ziʋoi zeɠe ta gulɔi. Toɠa ti latɛɠɛ vai ma ʋoogi ɠɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. <verse eid="LEV 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 14:25"/>Toɠa faazuɓɛtɛ zalaɠai ma ʋaala ziʋoi ɠɔdaaleʋe. Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa faazuɓɛtɛ zalaɠa zuai ma ɲamai ta zeɠe, é siɛ naa yeezazu woi yɔkpɔgi ma, nii é ɓɔɠɔ ɲadesu, ta zeezazu yeezinɛkpotogi ma, naa ʋɛɛ zeezazu ɠɔɠɔzinɛkpotogi ʋa. <verse eid="LEV 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 14:26"/>Toɠa gulɔi ta ʋu ɠɔʋɛzu yeei ɠa. <verse eid="LEV 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 14:27"/>Toɠa yeeɓeɠai lɔ gulɔi ɠa, nii é kɔʋɛzu yeei ɠa, é gulɔi vaza daa ɠɛ lɔfela ga yeeɓeɠai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. <verse eid="LEV 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 14:28"/>Toɠa gulɔi ta zeɠe, nii é kɔʋɛzu yeei ɠa, é siɛ naa yeezazu woi yɔkpɔgi ma, nii é ɓɔɠɔ ɲadesu, ta zeezazu yeezinɛkpotogi ma, naa ʋɛɛ zeezazu ɠɔɠɔzinɛkpotogi ʋa, ʋɛ faazuɓɛtɛ zalaɠa zuai ma ɲamai ziaai ná. <verse eid="LEV 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 14:29"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa gulɔi mɔtai zeɠe, zɛgai zea, é siɛ naa nɔungi ma, nii é ɓɔɠɔ ɲadesu, naa ɠa a kɛ é koto gba vai ɠɛ tɔun bɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. <verse eid="LEV 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 14:30"/>Naa ʋolu toɠa kpumagoiti gila kula ga zalaɠai, ɓaa poopo kpokpagiti gila, nii é zooga é sɔlɔɔ, <verse eid="LEV 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 14:31"/>gilagi ɠa ɠɛ ga koto gba zalaɠai, zɔi ɠɛ ga gala zalaɠai, é ʋɛɛ vebɛ zalaɠai ʋa. Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa koto gba vai ɠɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, naama nui ʋɛ, nii é ɓɔɠɔ ɲadesu.»<verse eid="LEV 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 14:32"/>Ɲadedai ma lɔgi ɠana, naama nui vaa zu, nii kulama zeeɓɛi ba, tama sɔlɔɔgiti ti la kula ɠɛa su.<verse eid="LEV 14:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fuinfuin pɛlɛi ɲade fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 14:33"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ ta Aalɔn, é ɠɛ ti ma: <verse eid="LEV 14:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 14:34"/>«Siɛgi zu wo lɔɔzu la Kanaan yooi zu, nii gè feezu wo ya ga wɔnɔ, ni nà fuinfuingi ʋɛɛna pɛlɛi ta ʋa, zooi zu wo sɔlɔɔsu, <verse eid="LEV 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 14:35"/>zɔi nɔnɔ ga pɛlɛi, naa ɠa li, é daazeeli zalaɠa ɠula nui ma, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Nà fuinfuingi ʋogi ʋɛtɛsu nà-pɛlɛi ʋa.› <verse eid="LEV 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 14:36"/>Aisa zalaɠa ɠula nui ʋa lɛ, é ʋa ná ɠɛʋele ʋɛtɛ, toɠa devei ve ga ti pɛlɛi zuwo, naa ɠa a kɛ, bu anii pɛ ge mina leve ga ti ɠɔzɔʋɛ. Naa ʋoluma zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa lɛ pɛlɛi wu, é ná ɠɛʋele ʋɛtɛ.<verse eid="LEV 14:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 14:37"/>«Toɠa fuinfuingi ʋogi ɠɛʋele ʋɛtɛ. Ni a kaana ga naa ʋogi ɠa pɛlɛi ʋa ga zeɠezeɠegiti suɓeingai, ɓaa ti maaɓɔikpɔigai, ti wɔai pɛlɛi zu suɠooza, <verse eid="LEV 14:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 14:38"/>toɠa ɠula pɛlɛi wu, é lo daaʋɛ, é daaɠulu, é kɛ ga folo lɔfela. <verse eid="LEV 14:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 14:39"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa ɠale ma ná, foloi lɔfelasiɛi ma. Ni a kaana ga fuinfuingi ʋogi vazagɛ pɛlɛi ma, <verse eid="LEV 14:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 14:40"/>toɠa deve ga ti kɔtui naati kula ná, niiti ti vuinfuingai, ti ti ʋili ya ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ ʋoluʋɛ, ada ɠɔzɔai ta. <verse eid="LEV 14:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 14:41"/>Toɠa pɛlɛ ɠoozuʋɛ kpein fɔin, fufiligi kpein ti kpalesu, ta naa ʋili ya ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ ʋoluʋɛ, ada ɠɔzɔai ta. <verse eid="LEV 14:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 14:42"/>Ta kɔtuiti maaleʋe ga ma niinɛ ɠiligaa, ti pɔlɔi zeɠe, ti pɛlɛi ziɛ.<verse eid="LEV 14:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 14:43"/>«Ni fuinfuingi ʋogi a ɠaaɠalena ma, é ɠula pɛlɛ ɠoozuʋɛ ma, kɔtuiti kulaa ʋoluma ná, maavɔin, ta pɛlɛi ziɛ ʋolu, <verse eid="LEV 14:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 14:44"/>zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa ɠale ma ná ʋolu. Ni a kaana ga fuinfuingi ʋogi vazagɛ pɛlɛ ɠoozuʋɛ, fuinfuingi ʋe, é sumiizu. Pɛlɛi ɠɔzɔʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 14:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 14:45"/>Ta pɛlɛi wolo, ti ma ɠɔtuiti seɠe, ta guluiti, ta siɛ ʋɔlɔiti kpein, ti li ga tiye ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ ʋoluʋɛ, ada ɠɔzɔai ta. <verse eid="LEV 14:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 14:46"/>Zɔi a lɛ pɛlɛi wu, siɛgi kpein su daaɠulugai la, naa ɠa ɠɔzɔ eyɛsu kpɔkɔi. <verse eid="LEV 14:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 14:47"/>Zɔi a ɠɛ laani pɛlɛi naa wu, naa ɠa ná-seɠeiti gba. Zɔi a laamiina pɛlɛi naa wu, naa ɓalaa ɠa ná-seɠeiti gba.<verse eid="LEV 14:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 14:48"/>«Ni zalaɠa ɠula nui nii é ɠalegai ma pɛlɛi wu, naa a kaana ga fuinfuingi ʋogi la vazani, pɛlɛi ziaa ʋoluma, toɠa dɛɛ ga pɛlɛi ɲadegɛ, mazɔlɔɔ fuinfuingi ɓega. <verse eid="LEV 14:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 14:49"/>Pɛlɛi ɲade fai zu, toɠa wɔni felegɔ zeɠe, ta sɛdele gulu ɓuɠai, ta geze ɓɔi sɔsɔgi ta ɠizɔɔpe tufa ɓifɔgi. <verse eid="LEV 14:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 14:50"/>Toɠa wɔni gila kɔdaaleʋe pɔlɔ liɠii maazu, daavegai ga ziɛungi zu ɗɛi. <verse eid="LEV 14:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 14:51"/>Toɠa sɛdele gulu ɓuɠai zeɠe, ta ɠizɔɔpe tufa ɓifɔgi, ta geze ɓɔi sɔsɔgi, ta wɔni vului, é ti lɔ wɔni ɠɔdaaleʋeai ma ɲamai wu, é faza daa ɠɛ lɔfela pɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="LEV 14:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 14:52"/>Zekana a pɛlɛi ɲade da, ga wɔnii ma ɲamai, é ʋɛɛ ziɛungi zu ɗɛi ʋa, ta wɔni vului, naa ʋɛɛ sɛdele gulu ɓuɠai ta ɠizɔɔpe tufa ɓifɔgi ʋa, ta geze ɓɔi sɔsɔgi. <verse eid="LEV 14:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 14:53"/>Toɠa yeeɓe wɔni vului ʋa, é li ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ ʋoluʋɛ, dɔɓɔi zu. Zekana a koto gba vai ɠɛ la pɛlɛi ʋɛ. Pɛlɛi ɠa ɲade.»<verse eid="LEV 14:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 14:54"/>Tɔgi ɠana kulama zeeɓɛi kpein faa zu, ta gɛlɛɠɛlɛ faiti, <verse eid="LEV 14:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 14:55"/>ta fuinfuingi é ɠulazu seɠeiti su, ɓaa pɛlɛiti ma, <verse eid="LEV 14:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LEV 14:56"/>ta ada ɓokolo ba vaiti, ta poʋoɠulɔiti, ta gɛlɛɠɛlɛgiti, <verse eid="LEV 14:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LEV 14:57"/>é kalagi wo, siɛgi zu anii ɠɔzɔai la, ta siɛgi zu ɲadegai la. Tɔgi ɠana kulama zeeɓɛi vaa zu.<verse eid="LEV 14:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LEV 15"/>
  <para style="s">Zunui ná-ɲadetala vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 15:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ta Aalɔn ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ti ma: <verse eid="LEV 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 15:2"/>«À ɓɔɛ Izilayɛle nuiti pɔ, wo ɠɛ ti ma: Zunu nɔpɛ kalaɲa kolegi ba, kɔzɔʋɛ naa maaʋele ma. <verse eid="LEV 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 15:3"/>Ná-kalaɲa kolegi maaʋele ɠa kɔzɔai la, é ɠɛni ɠulazu kpusɛi ʋa, ɓaa suzo pa de, kɔzɔʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 15:4"/>Bete nɔpɛ a la su, naa ɠɔzɔʋɛ, ta ani nɔpɛ a zei ma, naa ɠa ɠɔzɔ. <verse eid="LEV 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 15:5"/>Zɔi a vɔɔɠu ná-betei ʋa, kɛni naa ná-seɠeiti gba, é maagba. Kɔzɔai ɠa yɛ de, eyɛsu kpɔkɔi. <verse eid="LEV 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 15:6"/>Zɔi a zeina ani ma, niigi é ɠɛa zeini ma, kɛni naa ná-seɠeiti gba, é maagba. Kɔzɔai ɠa yɛ de, eyɛsu kpɔkɔi. <verse eid="LEV 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 15:7"/>Zɔi a vɔɔɠu kpusɛi ʋa, kɛni naa ná-seɠeiti gba, é maagba. Kɔzɔai ɠa yɛ de, eyɛsu kpɔkɔi. <verse eid="LEV 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 15:8"/>A laaɗɛi ʋuuna nu ma, nii ɲadegai, kɛni naa ná-seɠeiti gba, é maagba. Kɔzɔai ɠa yɛ de, eyɛsu kpɔkɔi. <verse eid="LEV 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 15:9"/>Seima ani nɔpɛ a zei ma togani ɠɔma, naa ɠa ɠɔzɔ. <verse eid="LEV 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 15:10"/>Zɔi a vɔɔɠu ani nɔpɛ ba, nii é ɠɛa tɔun bu, naa ɠɔzɔai ɠa yɛ de, eyɛsu kpɔkɔi. Zɔi a naama anii ta zeɠena, kɛni é ná-seɠeiti gba, é maagba. Kɔzɔai ɠa yɛ de, eyɛsu kpɔkɔi. <verse eid="LEV 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 15:11"/>Nu-o-nu nii kalaɲa kolegi ba, é la yeagbani, a vɔɔɠuna nu ʋa, kɛni naama nui ná-seɠeiti gba, é maagba. Kɔzɔai ɠa yɛ de, eyɛsu kpɔkɔi. <verse eid="LEV 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 15:12"/>Pɔlɔ liɠii kpein tɔun ka vɔɔɠuna ba, kɛni naa wolo, gulu aniɲakai kpein ka gba ziɛi wu.<verse eid="LEV 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 15:13"/>«Siɛgi zu ná-kalaɲa kolegi a ɓena la, toɠa folo lɔfela ɠaalu ná-ɲade fai zu, é ná-seɠeiti gba, é maagba ga ziɛungi zu ɗɛi. Naa ʋolu toɠa ɲade. <verse eid="LEV 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 15:14"/>Folo lɔsaʋasiɛi ma, toɠa kpumago felegɔ zeɠe, ɓaa poopo kpokpa felegɔ, é li Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠakala, GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ, é ti ve zalaɠa ɠula nui ya. <verse eid="LEV 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 15:15"/>Naa ɠa gilagi ɠɛ ga koto gba zalaɠai, é zɔi ɠɛ ga gala zalaɠai, é koto gba vai ɠɛ tɔun bɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, ná-kalaɲa kolegi vaa zu.<verse eid="LEV 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 15:16"/>«Zunui nii maaɠoloɠolosu, kɛni é ɓusɛi kpein gba. Kɔzɔai ɠa yɛ de, eyɛsu kpɔkɔi. <verse eid="LEV 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 15:17"/>Seɠei kpein, ta kɔlɔi kpein a ʋu ti ma, naati ta gba ziɛi wu. Ti ɠɔzɔai ɠa yɛ de, eyɛsu kpɔkɔi.<verse eid="LEV 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 15:18"/>«Ni zunui ta anzanui ta laana, ta maagba ti ɠilagilagi. Ti ɠɔzɔai ɠa yɛ de, eyɛsu kpɔkɔi.<verse eid="LEV 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Anzanui ná-ɲadetala vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 15:19"/>«Anzanui nii ɲamai ɠulazu ba, tɔɔzei ná-alugi ɠa é kaazu, toɠa yɛ ná-ɲadetalai zu folo lɔfela laawu. Nu-o-nu a vɔɔɠu ba, naa ɠɔzɔai ɠa yɛ de, eyɛsu kpɔkɔi. <verse eid="LEV 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 15:20"/>Bete nɔpɛ a la su ná-ɲadetala ziɛgi zu, naa ɠa ɠɔzɔ. Ani nɔpɛ a zei ma, naa ɠa ɠɔzɔ. <verse eid="LEV 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 15:21"/>Nu-o-nu nii a vɔɔɠu ná-betei ʋa, kɛni naa ná-seɠeiti gba, é maagba. Kɔzɔai ɠa yɛ de, eyɛsu kpɔkɔi. <verse eid="LEV 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 15:22"/>Nu-o-nu nii a vɔɔɠu anii ta ʋa, nii é ɠɛa zeini ma, kɛni naa ná-seɠeiti gba, é maagba. Kɔzɔai ɠa yɛ de, eyɛsu kpɔkɔi. <verse eid="LEV 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 15:23"/>Ni anii ɠa betei ɠa, ɓaa ʋɛ seiɗai ná, zɔi a vɔɔɠu ba, kɔzɔai ɠa yɛ de, eyɛsu kpɔkɔi. <verse eid="LEV 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 15:24"/>Ni zunu a laana ga anzanui naa, ná-kɔzɔi ʋɛa tɔun ba. Kɔzɔai ɠa yɛ de, folo lɔfela laawu. Bete nɔpɛ a la su, naa ɠa ɠɔzɔ.<verse eid="LEV 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 15:25"/>«Anzanui nii ɲamai a yɛ ɠulazu ba folo mɔinmɔin daawu, é ɠula ná-alu kaa yeeɠɛɠala zoloogaiti polu, ɓaa ɲamai lɛbi ɠulazu ba, é leʋe pɔlɔmai ʋa, kɔzɔai ɠa yɛ de, ná-ɲama ʋuu ziɛgi kpein su, eɠɛʋelei nɔ ná-alu kaa yeeɠɛɠalai la. <verse eid="LEV 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 15:26"/>Bete nɔpɛ a la su, naama ɲama ɠula ziɛgi laawu, naa ɠa ɠɔzɔ eɠɛ ná-alu kaa ʋetei, ani nɔpɛ nii a zeina ma, naa ɠa ɠɔzɔ, eɠɛ ná-alu kaa ziɛgi zu nɔ. <verse eid="LEV 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 15:27"/>Nu-o-nu a vɔɔɠu ba, naa ɠa ɠɔzɔ, kɛni é ná-seɠeiti gba, é maagba. Kɔzɔai ɠa yɛ de, eyɛsu kpɔkɔi.<verse eid="LEV 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 15:28"/>«Siɛgi zu é ɲadesu la ná-ɲama ʋui ma, toɠa foloi ɠaalu ga dɔfela. Naati poluma, toɠa ɲade. <verse eid="LEV 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 15:29"/>Foloi lɔsaʋasiɛi ma, toɠa kpumago felegɔ zeɠe, ɓaa poopo kpokpa felegɔ, é li ga tiye zalaɠa ɠula nui ʋɔ, GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 15:30"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa gilagi ɠula ga koto gba zalaɠai, é zɔi ɠɛ ga gala zalaɠai. Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa koto gba vai ɠɛ bɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, ɲama ʋui ma vaa zu, nii é ɠɛa kɔzɔzu.<verse eid="LEV 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 15:31"/>«Wa Izilayɛle nuiti maaɠooza faiti kpein ba, ta ti ɠɔzɔ, naa ɠa a kɛ ti mina za ta-ɠɔzɔ vaiti su, ni ta nà-seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai ɠɔzɔna, nii é ti zaama.»<verse eid="LEV 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 15:32"/>Tɔgi ɠana naama zunui ʋɛ, nii kalaɲa kolegi ba, ɓaa maaɠoloɠologai, é ɠɔzɔ, <verse eid="LEV 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 15:33"/>ɓaa anzanui, nii kɔzɔai ga ná-alu kaa ɲamai, ɓaa zunui, ɓaa anzanui, nii ɲamai ɠulazu ba, ɓaa zunui, nii é laazu anzanui ɠoba, kɔzɔai.<verse eid="LEV 15:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LEV 16"/>
  <para style="s">Tɔgi é lo koto gba vai ʋa <optbreak/> konagi zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 16:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, Aalɔn ná-doun zunu felegɔiti saa ʋoluma, niiti ti ɓɔɠɔ lɛɛni ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI. <verse eid="LEV 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 16:2"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Moize ma: «Ɓɔɛ è-liɛ Aalɔn ʋɔ, naa ɠa a kɛ, é mina ɗa lɛ yeenɔpɛ ada ɲadega wolai, kwɛpele seɠezuɠoozagi ʋoluʋɛ, kesui lakulugi ɠakalaʋɛ, nii é minazeɠe kesui la, naa ɠa a kɛ é mina za, mazɔlɔɔ nà ɠulazu kɛlɛma tonaɓiingi zu kesui lakulugi maazuʋɛ.<verse eid="LEV 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 16:3"/>«Pɛtɛ ʋelegi Aalɔn a zoo lɛɛzu la ada ɲadega wolai: Toɠa nikɛ zinɛ ɓokpa gila seɠe ga koto gba zalaɠai, ta baala sinɛ ɠila ga gala zalaɠai. <verse eid="LEV 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 16:4"/>Toɠa seɠewuzeɠe ɲadegai loo ɠɔba, é ga gezei, é ma ʋɛlɛ kpuɠagi lɛ ɓɔɠɔ ma, é zaamaɠili ga geze zaamaɠiligi, é ma wɔɔlɔgi lɔ unba. Zalaɠa ɠula zeɠeiti kana, niiti a ɓɔɠɔ maaɠili ga tiye, é maagba ʋoluma. <verse eid="LEV 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 16:5"/>Toɠa boli zinɛ felegɔ ɠula Izilayɛle ʋɛbɛi ya ga koto gba zalaɠai, ta baala sinɛ ɠila ga gala zalaɠai.<verse eid="LEV 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 16:6"/>«Aalɔn ɠa koto gba vai ɠɛ ga ná-nikɛ zinɛi, toɠa ná-kotoi gba ta ná-pɛlɛyeɠei. <verse eid="LEV 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 16:7"/>Toɠa boli zinɛ felegɔiti seɠe, é ʋa ga tiye Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠakala, GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 16:8"/>Aalɔn ɠa kpakutoomai ɠɛ ga boli zinɛ felegɔiti, gilagi ɠɛ ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nɔnɔi, gilagi ɠɛ ga nii kotoi yɛsu da, é lii la. <verse eid="LEV 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 16:9"/>Aalɔn ɠa boli zinɛi maaɓuɠa ʋa, niigi kpakui loozu ma Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, é naa ɠula ga koto gba zalaɠai. <verse eid="LEV 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 16:10"/>Boli zinɛi niigi kpakui loozu ma, ga kotoi yɛ da, é lii la, naa ma vului ɠa ʋilɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠakala, naa ɠa a kɛ, é koto gba vai ɠɛ, ta yeeɓe ba, é li teʋebai zu, kotoi yɛ da.<verse eid="LEV 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 16:11"/>«Aalɔn ɠa koto gba vai ɠɛ ga ná-nikɛ zinɛi. Toɠa koto gba vai ɠɛ tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ʋɛ, ta ná-pɛlɛyeɠei. Toɠa ná-koto gba nikɛ zinɛi ɠɔdaaleʋe. <verse eid="LEV 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 16:12"/>Toɠa ansanse gala liɠii ta zeɠe, daavegai ga abulekaiti, seɠeai zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, ta é zeeɲɛ felegɔ zeɠe ansansegi ma vukɔi zu. Toɠa li ga naama aniiti kwɛpele seɠezuɠoozagi ʋoluʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 16:13"/>Toɠa ansansegi ʋu abui ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, naa ɠa a kɛ ansansegi ma luului kesui lakulugi maalɔɔɠu, nii é zeele woo ɠesui maazu, naazu é la mɔ za pɛ. <verse eid="LEV 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 16:14"/>Toɠa nikɛ zinɛi ma ɲamai zeɠe, é faza ga yeeɓeɠai kesui lakulugi ɠakala ʋelei, folo ɠulazu ʋelei, é ɲamai vaza ga yeeɓeɠai, ná zeizu ɠɛ lɔfela, kesui lakulugi ɠakala ʋelei. <verse eid="LEV 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 16:15"/>Toɠa koto gba woli zinɛi ɠɔdaaleʋe nuɓusɛiti bɛ, é li ga ma ɲamai kwɛpele seɠezuɠoozagi ʋoluʋelei. Ʋelei nɔ é kɛai la ga nikɛ zinɛi ma ɲamai, zekana nɔ a kɛɛ la ga naa ma ɲamai, toɠa faza kesui lakulugi ma ta kakala ʋelei.<verse eid="LEV 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 16:16"/>«Ʋele ɠana a koto gba vai ɠɛ la ada ɲadega wolai ʋɛ Izilayɛle nuiti ta-ɠɔzɔba vaiti faa zu, ta ta-lɔ koloɠologiti kpein maaʋele zu, ti kotoi ɠɛai ga ti maaʋele. Toɠa kɛ ɠana nɔ GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi ʋɛ, mazɔlɔɔ toɠa kɔzɔba nuɓusɛiti saama. <verse eid="LEV 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 16:17"/>Nu nɔpɛ ge la yɛga GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu, siɛgi zu é lɛɛzu la ga é koto gba vai ɠɛ ada ɲadega wolai, eyɛsu é ɠula ná. Toɠa koto gba vai ɠɛ tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ʋɛ, ta ná-pɛlɛyeɠei, ta Izilayɛle ʋɛbɛi kpein bɛ.<verse eid="LEV 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 16:18"/>«A ɠɛna ɠulaa, toɠa li zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ, nii é Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠakala, é koto gba vai ɠɛ, zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ʋɛ, é nikɛ zinɛi ta boli zinɛi ma ɲamai zeɠe, é siɛ zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ minɛiti ma, maaɠoolii pɛ su. <verse eid="LEV 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 16:19"/>Toɠa ɲamai vaza ga zeeɓeɠai, ná zeizu ɠɛ lɔfela, zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma. Toɠa kole, é ɲade, Izilayɛle nuiti ta-ɠɔzɔba vaiti faa zu.<verse eid="LEV 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 16:20"/>«Siɛgi zu é ɓesu da ga koto gba vai ɠɛ ada ɲadega wolai ʋɛ, ta GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi ʋɛ, ta zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ʋɛ, toɠa boli zinɛi ma vului maaɓuɠa ʋa. <verse eid="LEV 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 16:21"/>Aalɔn ɠa yee felegɔiti pɛɛ boli zinɛi ma vului unmaʋɛ, é laa zɔ ga maazu ga Izilayɛle nuiti ta-vaa ɲɔiti kpein, ta ta-lɔ koloɠologiti kpein, niiti ti kotoi ɠɛa ga ti maaʋele. Toɠa ti la boli zinɛi unma, naa ʋolu, é kpɛ, é li teʋebai zu, zunu ɠila ge ɓɔ ba, nii kɛʋele ɓɛtɛai. <verse eid="LEV 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 16:22"/>Ta-vaa ɲɔiti ta yɛ boli zinɛi ʋa, ti kpɛ, é li teʋebai zu, é li zooi naa zu, ʋɛ ná ɲakai.<verse eid="LEV 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 16:23"/>«Aalɔn ɠa lɛ GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu, é geze zeɠeiti kula, niiti é ɠɛa ti looni tɛɛzuʋɛ ada ɲadega wolai. Toɠa ti la ná. <verse eid="LEV 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 16:24"/>Toɠa maagba ada ɲadegai ta, é ná-seɠeiti seɠe ʋolu. Naa ʋolu toɠa ɠula, é ná-gala zalaɠai ɠula, ta nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠala zalaɠai, é koto gba vai ɠɛ ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ, ta nuɓusɛiti bɛ. <verse eid="LEV 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 16:25"/>Toɠa koto gba zuai ma wulɔi ɠala zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ.<verse eid="LEV 16:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 16:26"/>«Zɔi a bolii ɓɛ, nii kotoi yɛgai da, naa ɠa ná-seɠeiti gba, é maagba, naa ʋoluma toɠa lɛ niina ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 16:27"/>Koto gba zalaɠai ma nikɛ zinɛi ta koto gba woli zinɛi niiti ti ti-ma ɲamai zeɠeai, ti ʋaa la ada ɲadega wolai koto gba vai zu, ta li ga tiye ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ ʋoluʋɛ, ti ma ɠɔlɔiti gala abui ɠa, ta ma zuai, ta ma ɓooiti. <verse eid="LEV 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 16:28"/>Zɔi a gala, naa ɠa ná-seɠeiti gba, é maagba. Naa ʋolu toɠa lɛ niina ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ.<verse eid="LEV 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 16:29"/>«Nii ɠa ɠɛ wo ʋɛ ga ɠɔoɠɔ tɔgi, alugi lɔfelasiɛi ma volo puugɔi ma, wa zugi zo, wo la boti nɔpɛ kɛa, é ɠɛni ga zou loun, ɓaa wɛɛin nii é ga seikɔɠɔma nui wo zaama. <verse eid="LEV 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 16:30"/>Mazɔlɔɔ naama volo ná, ta koto gba vai ɠɛ wo ʋɛ, naa ɠa a kɛ wo ɲade. Wa ɲade wa-ɠotoiti kpein faa zu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. <verse eid="LEV 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 16:31"/>Toɠa ɠɛ wo ʋɛ ga dooɠo folo wolai, wa zugi zo. Toɠa ɠɛ wo ʋɛ ga ɠɔoɠɔ tɔgi.<verse eid="LEV 16:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 16:32"/>«Koto gba vai ɠa ɠɛ zalaɠa ɠula nui ya, nii gulɔi ziaai ma, feai bɛ̀ ga é ʋilɛ kɛɛɠɛ ʋotogi zu zalaɠa ɠula vai zu. Toɠa ɓɔɠɔ maaɠili ga zalaɠa ɠula zeɠeiti, ti ga gezei. <verse eid="LEV 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 16:33"/>Toɠa koto gba vai ɠɛ ada ɲadega wolai ʋɛ, ta GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi ʋɛ, ta zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ʋɛ. Toɠa koto gba vai ɠɛ ɓalaa zalaɠa ɠula nuiti bɛ, ta nuɓusɛiti kpein bɛ.<verse eid="LEV 16:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 16:34"/>«Toɠa ɠɛ wo ʋɛ ga ɠɔoɠɔ tɔgi, koto gba vai ɠa ɠɛ, ná ɠɛ ɠila kona-o-kona, Izilayɛle nuiti ta-ɠotoiti kpein faa zu.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LEV 16:34">Naa ɠɛɛni, nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma levei veeni Moize ya.<verse eid="LEV 16:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LEV 17"/>
  <para style="ms1">Izilayɛle Nuiti Ta-Ɲadedai</para>
  <para style="mr">(<ref loc="LEV 17:1-27:34">17:1—27:34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="s">Zalaɠa ɠulazu ɠila kpegi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 17:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LEV 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 17:2"/>«Ɓɔɛ Aalɔn ʋɔ, ta ná-doun zunuiti, ta Izilayɛle nuiti kpein, è ɠɛ ti ma: Wɛlɛ, nii ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI deveai:<verse eid="LEV 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 17:3"/>«Ni Izilayɛle nui ta a nikɛi ɓaa baalagi, ɓaa bolii ɠɔdaaleʋena ga zalaɠai ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ, ɓaa ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ ʋoluʋɛ, <verse eid="LEV 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 17:4"/>é la liini la GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ, é ʋa kɛ ga vebɛanii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ ná-seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai ɠakalaʋɛ, naama nui ɠa ɠɛ ga sɔba nu, tɔɔzei é ɲamai ʋua. Kpe ka leʋe ná-nuɓusɛiti ba, é ɠula ti zaama. <verse eid="LEV 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 17:5"/>Naa ɠa a kɛ, Izilayɛle nuiti ti mina mɔ ta-zalaɠa aniiti kula dɔɓɔiti su, kɛlɛ ti ɗa ʋa ga tiye zalaɠa ɠula nui ʋɔ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠakala GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ, é ti ɠula ga zalaɠai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, ga ziilɛi zalaɠaiti. <verse eid="LEV 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 17:6"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa ma ɲamai vaza Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma, GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ, é ma wulɔi ɠala, nii makugi a nɛɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 17:7"/>Ti la mɔ ta-zalaɠaiti kulaa zɛɛ ɠalagiti bɛ, niiti ti-ʋaaɠulabaiti ti ga boli zinɛiti, niiti ti ɠɛa ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔzu ga tiye. Toɠa ɠɛ ga ɠɔoɠɔ tɔgi ti ʋɛ, ta ti-mavofodaiti kpein.<verse eid="LEV 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 17:8"/>«Ɗa ɠɛ ti ma mɔnɔ: Ni Izilayɛle nui ta, ɓaa seikɔɠɔma nui ta, é ti zaama, a gala zalaɠai ɠulana, ɓaa zalaɠai taɠili, <verse eid="LEV 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 17:9"/>é la liini la GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ, é ʋa kula ga zalaɠai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, naama nui ɓe ka leʋe ná-nuɓusɛiti ba.<verse eid="LEV 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tɔgi é lo ɲama mii vai ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 17:10"/>«Ni Izilayɛle nui ta, ɓaa seikɔɠɔma nui ta, é ti zaama, a ɲamai ma zii tanɔpɛ miina, nà ʋoluave naama nui ʋa, nii é ɲamai miizu, nà naama nui ɓeteʋe ɓalaa ná-nuɓusɛiti ba, é ɠula ti zaama. <verse eid="LEV 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 17:11"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ɲamai ɠa é ga kpɛtɛanii kpein zɛnvui. Gè feeʋɛ wo ya, ga wo koto gba vai ɠɛ la zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ, wo-yɛnvuiti faa zu, mazɔlɔɔ tɛi é ga zɛnvui ma ʋoogi, naa maaʋele ɠa ɲamai a kotoi gba la. <verse eid="LEV 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 17:12"/>Naa ɠa é ba, gè bogɛ Izilayɛle nuiti ma ga, nu nɔpɛ ge mina ɲamai mi wo zaama, anɛɛ seikɔɠɔma nui ʋe, é mina ɲamai mi. <verse eid="LEV 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 17:13"/>Ni Izilayɛle nui ta, ɓaa seikɔɠɔma nui ta, é ti zaama, a sua zona dɔɓɔ ziɛ su, ɓaa wɔnii, nii nu a mi, toɠa ma ɲamai ʋu zooi ma, é fufiligi ʋu gaazu. <verse eid="LEV 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 17:14"/>Mazɔlɔɔ kpɛtɛanii kpein, ni nɔ toɠa vulua, zɛnvui ɠa ma ɲamai zu. Naa ɠa é ba, gè bogɛ Izilayɛle nuiti ma ga, wo la kpusɛi tanɔpɛ ma ɲamai mia, mazɔlɔɔ kpɛtɛanii kpein zɛnvui ɠa ɲamai zu, nu nɔpɛ a ta miina, naa ɓe ka leʋe Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti ba.<verse eid="LEV 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 17:15"/>«Nu nɔpɛ, é ɠɛni zou loun zu, ɓaa seikɔɠɔma nuiti su, a sua miina saai ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ, ɓaa baliʋaliai ga, toɠa ná-seɠeiti gba, é maagba. Kɔzɔai ɠa yɛ de, eyɛsu kpɔkɔi. Naa ʋolu, toɠa ɲade. <verse eid="LEV 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 17:16"/>Ni é la ná-seɠeiti gbani, é ʋa maagba, ná-faaɠaaza golai ma ɠasɔi ɠa la unma.»<verse eid="LEV 17:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LEV 18"/>
  <para style="s">Dakoba vai <optbreak/> ma maaɲɛɛi tanigaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 18:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LEV 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 18:2"/>«Ɓɔɛ Izilayɛle nuiti pɔ, è ɠɛ ti ma: Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, wa-ƓALAGI. <verse eid="LEV 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 18:3"/>À mina naa ɠɛ, nii é ɠɛɛzu Ezipete yooi zu, ʋɛ wo ɠɛni zeini ná. À mina naa ɠɛ, nii é ɠɛɛzu Kanaan yooi zu, ʋɛ gè liizu ga woye ná. À mina ʋilɛ ta-lɔgiti polu. <verse eid="LEV 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 18:4"/>À ɠolo nà-deveiti bɛ, wo makɛ nà-tɔgiti ma, wo ʋilɛ ti ʋolu. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, wa-ƓALAGI. <verse eid="LEV 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 18:5"/>À ɠolo nà-tɔgiti bɛ, ta nà-deveiti, nui nii a ziɛna ga tiye, naa ɠa zɛnvui wo naa maaʋele ma. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.<verse eid="LEV 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 18:6"/>«Wo tanɔpɛ ge mina la ga anzanu, ta nii ti logai ɓɔɠɔ ʋa. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.<verse eid="LEV 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 18:7"/>«Mina la è-lee ɠoba. Toɠa ɠɛ ga è-ɠɛɛ unfe faa. Toɠa ɠɛ ɓalaa ga è-lee unfe faa, mazɔlɔɔ è-lee ʋe.<verse eid="LEV 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 18:8"/>«Mina la è-ɠɛɛ anzai taɠili koba. Toɠa ɠɛ ga è-ɠɛɛ unfe faa.<verse eid="LEV 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 18:9"/>«Mina la è-ʋaazeelai ɠoba, è-ɠɛɛ ná-doun anzanui ʋe, ɓaa è-lee ná-doun anzanui, anɛɛ ni kulaʋɛ su pɛlɛyeɠei taɠili bu.<verse eid="LEV 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 18:10"/>«Mina la ga è-loun zunui ná-doun anzanui, ɓaa è-loun anzanui ná-doun anzanui, mazɔlɔɔ ɗa-unfe faa ʋe, ɗa ɓɔɠɔi.<verse eid="LEV 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 18:11"/>«Mina la ga è-ɠɛɛ anzai taɠili ná-doun anzanui. Toɠa ga è-ɠɛɛ ná-doun anzanui. Toɠa ga è-ʋaazeelai.<verse eid="LEV 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 18:12"/>«Mina la ga è-ɠɛɛ ʋaazeelai. Toɠa ga è-ɠɛɛ ná-nu ɠiteɠitegi.<verse eid="LEV 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 18:13"/>«Mina la ga è-lee diɛ ɓaa deɠe anzanu, mazɔlɔɔ è-lee ná-nu ɠiteɠitegi ʋe.<verse eid="LEV 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 18:14"/>«Mina la ga è-ɠɛɛ diɛ ɓaa deɠe zunui anzai, mazɔlɔɔ toɠa ga è-lee.<verse eid="LEV 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 18:15"/>«Mina la ga è-loun anzai. Toɠa ɠɛ ga è-loin unfe faa.<verse eid="LEV 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 18:16"/>«Mina la ga è-ɠɛɛloin anzai. Toɠa ɠɛ ga è-ɠɛɛloin unfe faa.<verse eid="LEV 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 18:17"/>«Mina la ga anzanui, ta ná-doun anzanui. È la ná-doun zunui ná-doun anzanui zeɠea, ɓaa ná-doun anzanui nɔnɔ ma loun anzanui, mazɔlɔɔ ta ga ná-nu ɠiteɠitegiti, naa ɠa ga faa ɲɔu wola.<verse eid="LEV 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 18:18"/>«Ni è-anzai ɠa dɛ vulua, mina diɛ ɓaa deɠe anzanui ta zeɠe ga è-anza. Ɗa toloi lɔ ti yɔɠɔzu.<verse eid="LEV 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 18:19"/>«Mina la ga anzanui ná-alu kaa ziɛgi zu, nii é tɔun kɔzɔzu.<verse eid="LEV 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 18:20"/>«Mina la ga è-zeiɲɔɠɔi anzai, ɗa ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔ la.<verse eid="LEV 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 18:21"/>«Mina è-loin tanɔpɛ kula ga zalaɠa, é ʋa ɠala kɔɔɠɔ ganigi ʋɛ daa ga Mɔlɔke, dɛbi vaa ma, è la ɗa-ƓALAGI lɔɠɔi ɠoloɠologa. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.<verse eid="LEV 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 18:22"/>«Mina la ga zunu, eɠɛʋelei nu a laa la ga anzanui. Naa ɠa ga kɔzɔba vaa.<verse eid="LEV 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 18:23"/>«Mina la ga sua, è ʋa ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔ. Anzanu mina la sua ɠoba. Ɓaaɠulama vaa ʋe.<verse eid="LEV 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 18:24"/>«À mina ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔ ga naama ziɛ ʋelei tanɔpɛ, mazɔlɔɔ ziiti gè ti ɓɛɛzu wo luɠɔ, naati ti ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔʋɛ ga naama ziɛ ʋeleiti kpein. <verse eid="LEV 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 18:25"/>Zooi kpein ge ɠɔzɔa, gè ti maaɠolo ta-vaaɠaaza golaiti faa zu, zooi unpiliga ga ná-nuɓusɛiti.<verse eid="LEV 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 18:26"/>«Wɔun wa, wa ɠolo nà-tɔgiti bɛ, ta nà-deveiti, wo mina naama ɠɔzɔba vai tanɔpɛ kɛ, é ɠɛni ga zou loun, ɓaa seikɔɠɔma nui, nii é wo zaama. <verse eid="LEV 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 18:27"/>Mazɔlɔɔ kɔzɔba vaiti kpein kana, zooi zu nuɓusɛiti ti ɠɛni kɛɛzu, niiti ti ɠɛni zeini zooi ɠa mɔungi wo luɠɔ, zooi ɠɔzɔa. <verse eid="LEV 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 18:28"/>Naa a ɠɛɛna, zooi la mɔ unpiliga ga woye, tɔɔzei wa-ɠɔzɔba vaiti ba, eɠɛʋelei é unpilini la ga ziiti, ti ɠɛni wɔun wo luɠɔ náʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 18:29"/>Mazɔlɔɔ niiti kpein ti ʋaazu naa ɠɛɠala ɠɔzɔba vaiti ta ɠɛɛzu, ti ɓe ka leʋe ta-nuɓusɛiti ba, ti ɠula ti zaama.<verse eid="LEV 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 18:30"/>«Wa ɠolo nà-deveiti bɛ, naa ɠa a kɛ, wo la mɔ naama vaa ɲɔu wolaiti tanɔpɛ kɛa, nii é ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu wo luɠɔ, wo la ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔa ga naa ta. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, wa-ƓALAGI.»<verse eid="LEV 18:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LEV 19"/>
  <para style="s">À ɲade, mazɔlɔɔ ɲàdegɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 19:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LEV 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 19:2"/>«Ɓɔɛ Izilayɛle ʋɛbɛi kpein pɔ, è ɠɛ ti ma: À ɲade, mazɔlɔɔ ɲàdegɛ, nà, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, wa-ƓALAGI.<verse eid="LEV 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 19:3"/>«Ɛsɛ gilagilagi ɠa unfe dee ta kɛɛɠɛ ma, é nà-dooɠo foloiti maaɲɛ. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, wa-ƓALAGI.<verse eid="LEV 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 19:4"/>«À mina ɠaaʋote kɔɔɠɔ ganigiti ma. À mina galagaa ɓɛtɛ ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ ga kɔlu ɠaawuungi. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, wa-ƓALAGI.<verse eid="LEV 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 19:5"/>«Siɛgi zu wa ziilɛi zalaɠai ɠulana la Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, wa kɛ, nii a kɛ é daazo. <verse eid="LEV 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 19:6"/>Ma zuai ɠa mi foloi wo kulazu la ga zalaɠai, ɓaa poluma zobui. Nii é yɛsu ná eyɛsu foloi zaʋasiɛi, naa ɠa ɠala. <verse eid="LEV 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 19:7"/>Foloi zaʋasiɛi, ni nu a ta miina, toɠa ɠɛ ga anii kɔzɔai, zalaɠai laa la mɔ zoga. <verse eid="LEV 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 19:8"/>Zɔi a ta miina, ná-faaɠaaza golai ma ɠasɔi ɠa la unma, mazɔlɔɔ toɠa naa ɠɔzɔzu, nii feai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, naama nui ɓe ka leʋe ná-nuɓusɛiti ba.<verse eid="LEV 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 19:9"/>«Siɛgi zu wo moloi leʋezu la wa-yooi zu, wa kpala kpelamaʋɛ yɛ ná, wo mina ná leʋe, wo mina ɠale ma posuyɛʋɛi ma. <verse eid="LEV 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 19:10"/>À mina ani ɠɔpɔgiti kula ɓalaa, niiti ti yɛgai wa-leezɛn ɓelei zu. À mina ma waaiti zɛʋɛ, niiti ti loozu. Wa naa yɛ ná bala nuiti bɛ, ta seikɔɠɔma nuiti. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, wa-ƓALAGI.<verse eid="LEV 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 19:11"/>«À mina unma wo. À mina zɛɛ wo, ɓaa wo ʋa woya ɓɛtɛ, wo ɠilagilagi wo-zeiɲɔɠɔi laalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="LEV 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 19:12"/>À mina zɛɛ ɠona wo dàaseigi zu, mazɔlɔɔ wa wa-ƓALAGI lɔɠɔi ɠoloɠolo. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.<verse eid="LEV 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 19:13"/>«À mina wo-zeiɲɔɠɔi maanɔɠɔ vaa ɠɛ, wo mina unma wo. À mina ɠata nu ná-sala wali ma, é ʋa yɛsu poluma zobui. <verse eid="LEV 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 19:14"/>À mina goizuɓɔlɔ nui ɠoto, wo mina ani nɔpɛ kpesa gaazuɠole nui luɠɔ, nii a ɠɔɠɔziɠa ba, kɛlɛ wa ɠɛ ga GALA gaazuluaba nu. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.<verse eid="LEV 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 19:15"/>«À mina telebotala vaa nɔpɛ kɛ tukpɔɠaaleʋeiti su. À mina topolu ɠɛ bala nui ɓaa nu wolai ʋɛ. Kɛlɛ wa wo-zeiɲɔɠɔi lukpɔɠaaleʋe ga sɔledai. <verse eid="LEV 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 19:16"/>À mina lɔɠɔ ɲɔu vaa ʋɛɛ wa-nuɓusɛiti ta ʋa. À mina zɛɛ zeele woo wo wo-zeiɲɔɠɔi laalɔɠɔma, a ɠɛ ga saa zaɓu. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.<verse eid="LEV 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 19:17"/>«À mina wo-ɠɛɛloin wɔinzeɠe wo-yiimaʋɛ. À dama, wa ɠɛna zelii loga wo-ɠɛɛloin ma, wo mina koto la ɓɔɠɔ unma tɔun ná-faa zu. <verse eid="LEV 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 19:18"/>À mina nɔnɔ ʋotokula vaa ɠɛ, wo mina faa zei yiima wa-nuɓusɛiti ta laalɔɠɔma. Wa wo-zeiɲɔɠɔi nɛɛ ʋɛ, eɠɛ wa ɓɔɠɔi. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.<verse eid="LEV 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 19:19"/>«Wa ɠolo nà-deveiti bɛ. À mina sua ma zii felegɔ ʋu ɓɔɠɔ ma, ti ʋa pɛɛpolu wo. À mina ani zuwu zii felegɔ woli wa-ɓalagi ʋa. À mina seɠe loo ɠɔba fɛlɛai ga gezei ma zii felegɔ.<verse eid="LEV 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 19:20"/>«Siɛgi zu zunui ta a laana ga duɔ anzanui ta, nii maazogai zunu ɠili bɛ, é la unmɔɔni, é la ɓɔɠɔ yeema, ta faa zuɠoloɠologi ɓɛtɛ, kɛlɛ ti la ti ʋaa, mazɔlɔɔ anzanui naa la ɓɔɠɔ yeema. <verse eid="LEV 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 19:21"/>Zunui ɠa ʋa ga baala sinɛ ɠila, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɔ, ga ná-faa zuɓɛtɛ zalaɠai GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 19:22"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa koto gba vai ɠɛ tɔun bɛ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠakala, ná-kotoi vaa zu é kɛai, é kɛ ga baala sinɛi, é kulazu ga faazuɓɛtɛ zalaɠai, kotoi naa é kɛai, suvaa ɠa yɛ bɛ.<verse eid="LEV 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 19:23"/>«Siɛgi zu wo liizu la zooi ná zu, wa ɓena ga gwaa wului ma zii pɛ sin, wa ti-ma waaiti pɛtɛ kona saʋagɔ laawu ga ti ɠɔzɔʋɛ, à mina ta mi ɲɛgɛlɛin. <verse eid="LEV 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 19:24"/>Konagi naanisiɛi ma, wa ti-ma waaiti kpein fe Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-maamusɛ vaa zu. <verse eid="LEV 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 19:25"/>Konagi lɔɔlusiɛi ma, wa zoo wo ma waaiti ta mi. Ni wa naa ɠɛɛna, wa-ɠulanumai ɠa li ga wɔɔlɔa. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, wa-ƓALAGI.<verse eid="LEV 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 19:26"/>«À mina sua nɔpɛ mi, nii ɲamai su. À mina ɓɔɠɔ lɔ ungaiziɛ vaa zu, ta adɔɓɛɛ vaa nɔpɛ. <verse eid="LEV 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 19:27"/>À mina wɔungiti buuwo, wo mina wo-ɓakalagiti bo. <verse eid="LEV 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 19:28"/>À mina wɛn dɔ wo-ɠɔlɔgi ma gɔvɛ ʋɛ, wo mina pɔlɔpalɛ lɔ ɓɔɠɔ ma. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.<verse eid="LEV 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 19:29"/>«À mina wo-loun anzanui ɠaazu unfe seɠe ga wo ʋa dɔ koloɠologi zu, galagi tanɔpɛ dɛbi vaa ma, naa ɠa a kɛ zooi zu nuɓusɛiti ti mina lɔ koloɠologi zu, ná zulaa a ʋa ve ga kɔzɔba vai. <verse eid="LEV 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 19:30"/>Wa nà-dooɠo foloiti maaɲɛ, wo unfe sèizu ɲadegai ma. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.<verse eid="LEV 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 19:31"/>«À mina li, wo ʋa gɔvɛ laawooleʋe nuiti gaazaɠa, ɓaa niiti gɔvɛiti ti ʋelela ʋele vaiti bosu ti ma. À mina ti ɠaiziɛ, wo mina ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔ ga tiye. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, wa-ƓALAGI.<verse eid="LEV 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 19:32"/>«Wa wuzeɠe un kolegiti kpein bɛ, wo kɛwola wɔlɔi lɛbi. Wa lua wa-ƓALAGI ʋa. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.<verse eid="LEV 19:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 19:33"/>«Ni seikɔɠɔma nui ta a ʋaana wo zaama wa-yooi zu, à mina suziɠa. <verse eid="LEV 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 19:34"/>Wa seikɔɠɔma nui zo ga pagɔ, eɠɛ pelegi wo zou loin zosu da. Wa nɛɛ ʋɛ eɠɛ wa ɓɔɠɔi. Mazɔlɔɔ wo ɠɛni ga seikɔɠɔma nuiti Ezipete yooi zu. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, wa-ƓALAGI.<verse eid="LEV 19:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 19:35"/>«À mina telebotala vaa ɠɛ, tukpɔɠaaleʋeiti su, anɛɛ kɔɠɔgiti su, ɓaa aniiti sɔligiti su, ɓaa aniiti buɲɛgiti su. <verse eid="LEV 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 19:36"/>Kɛni wa-ɠɔɠɔ ganiiti ti zɔle, bui ʋelei zoloo. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, wa-ƓALAGI, nii é wo ɠulani Ezipete yooi ʋa. <verse eid="LEV 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 19:37"/>Wa nà-deveiti kpein so, ta nà-tɔgiti, wo ti makɛ, wo ziɛ ga tiye. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.»<verse eid="LEV 19:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LEV 20"/>
  <para style="s">Kotoiti ma zalai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 20:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LEV 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 20:2"/>«Ɠɛ Izilayɛle nuiti ma: Nu-o-nu é ɠɛni Izilayɛle nuiti saama, ɓaa seikɔɠɔma nu, nii a ná-doin ta ɠulana ga zalaɠa salei ʋɛ, daa ga Mɔlɔke, ta naama nui ʋaa. Zooi zu nuɓusɛiti ta sɔ ga kɔtui, é za. <verse eid="LEV 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 20:3"/>Nɔ̀un nà ʋoluave naama nui ʋa, gè kpeteʋe ná-nuɓusɛiti ba, tɔɔzei ba é ná-doin ta leʋegɛ salei Mɔlɔke ʋɔ, é sèizu ɲadegai ɠɔzɔʋɛ, é dàasei ɲadegai ɠoloɠolo. <verse eid="LEV 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 20:4"/>Ni Izilayɛle nuiti ta gilina ba, ti ɠaazuʋɛɛ ma naama nui letegi, nii é ná-doin ta leʋegai salei Mɔlɔke ʋɔ, ni ti la paani, <verse eid="LEV 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 20:5"/>nɔ̀un, nà ʋoluave ma nui ʋa, ta ná-pɛlɛyeɠei, nà kpeteʋe ná-nuɓusɛiti ba, é ʋɛɛ naati kpein ba, niiti ti kɔɔɠɔ gani kɔɔ vai ɠɛɛzu, eɠɛʋelei é kɛɛzu la salei Mɔlɔke ʋɛ.<verse eid="LEV 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 20:6"/>«Ni nui ta a liina, é gɔvɛ laawooleʋe nuiti gaazaɠa, ɓaa niiti gɔvɛiti ti ʋelela ʋele vaiti bosu ti ma, nii é ga kɔɔɠɔ gani kɔɔ vai ma zii, nà ʋoluave naama nui ʋa, gè kpeteʋe ná-nuɓusɛiti ba. <verse eid="LEV 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 20:7"/>À ɓɔɠɔ ɲade, wa ɲade, mazɔlɔɔ nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, wa-ƓALAGI. <verse eid="LEV 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 20:8"/>À nà-deveiti makɛ, wo ziɛ ga tiye. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nii é wo ɲadesu.<verse eid="LEV 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 20:9"/>«Zɔi nɔpɛ é kɛɛɠɛ ɓaa dee ɠotozu, ta naama nui ʋaa, tɔɔzei é kɛɛɠɛ ɓaa dee ɠotoa, ma ɲamai ɠa la tɔ ɓɔɠɔ unma.<verse eid="LEV 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 20:10"/>«Siɛgi zu zunui ta a wɛɛnziɛ bona la ga seiɲɔɠɔi ta anza, wa wɛɛnziɛ nuiti felegɔ pɛ paa.<verse eid="LEV 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 20:11"/>«Ni zunui ta a laana ga kɛɛɠɛ anzai, é kɛɛɠɛ ɠaazu unfe seɠea, wa naama zunui ta naama anzanuiti paa. Ti-ma ɲamai ɠa la ti unma. <verse eid="LEV 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 20:12"/>Ni zunui ta a laana ga ná-doun anzai, wa ti felegɔi pɛ paa. Ti unfetala vai ɠɛa, ti-ma ɲamai ɠa la ti unma.<verse eid="LEV 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 20:13"/>«Ni zunui ta a laana ga zunui ta, ti kɔzɔba vai ɠɛa, wa ti ʋaa. Ti-ma ɲamai ɠa la ti unma.<verse eid="LEV 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 20:14"/>«Ni zunui ta a anzanui ta dee zeɠena, é ti felegɔ zei ga anza, naa ɠa ga faa ɲɔu wola. Ta ti saʋagɔ ɠala, naa ɠa a kɛ faa ɲɔu wolai naa mina yɛ wo zaama.<verse eid="LEV 20:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 20:15"/>«Ni zunui ta a laana ga suai, wa zunui naa ʋaa, wo suai ɓalaa paa. <verse eid="LEV 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 20:16"/>Ni anzanui ta a maaɓuɠana suai ta ʋa, é la koba, wa anzanui ʋaa, wo suai ʋaa. Ta ti pɛ paa, ti-ma ɲamai ɠa la ti unma.<verse eid="LEV 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 20:17"/>«Ni zunui ta a ná-seelai zeina ga anza, kɛɛɠɛ ná-doun anzanui, ɓaa dee ná-doun anzanui, é naa unfega, ta é ɓɔɠɔ unfega. Unfetala vaa wola ɠana, ti ɓe ka leʋe ta-nuɓusɛiti ba, naa ɠa ɠɛ ta-nuiti pɛ gaazu. Zunui naa é ná-seelai unfegai, ná-faaɠaaza golai ma ɠasɔi ɠa la unma.<verse eid="LEV 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 20:18"/>«Ni zunui ta a laana ga anzanui ta, é ná-alugi ɠaai, ti felegɔ pɛ ti ɓe ka leʋe ta-nuɓusɛiti ba, mazɔlɔɔ ti ná-alugi ma ɲamai ɠaa.<verse eid="LEV 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 20:19"/>«À mina la ga wo-lee diɛ ɓaa deɠe anzanui ta, ɓaa wo-ɠɛɛ ná-seelai ta. Ni zunui ta a laana ga ná-nu ɠiteɠitegi ta, ta-vaaɠaaza golai ma ɠasɔi ɠa la ti unma.<verse eid="LEV 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 20:20"/>«Zunui ta a laana ga kɛɛɠɛ diɛ ɓaa deɠe zunui ta anza, é zunui naa ɠaazu unfe seɠea. Ti felegɔ ta ta-ɠotoi ma ɠasɔi zeɠe, ta za ɠana nɔ, ti la doun zɔlɔɔga.<verse eid="LEV 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 20:21"/>«Ni zunui ta a kɛɛloin anzai zeina, kɔzɔba vaa ɠana, é kɛɛɠɛloin unfega, ti la doun zɔlɔɔga.<verse eid="LEV 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 20:22"/>«Wa makɛ nà-deveiti ma, ta nà-tɔgiti, wo ti zo kpaan, naa ɠa a kɛ zooi ʋɛ gè ʋaazu liizu ga woye ná, ga wo zei ná, é la unpiliga ga woye. <verse eid="LEV 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 20:23"/>À mina ziɛ ga zii naati ta-luʋai, niiti gè ʋaazu ti ɓɛɛzu wo luɠɔ, mazɔlɔɔ ti naama ɠɛɛwotiiti kpein kɛɛʋɛ, naa ʋɛlɛzeɠe bɛ̀. <verse eid="LEV 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 20:24"/>Gè boga wo ma: Wa ɠa wo ta-yooi zɔlɔɔsu, nà feezu wo ʋɛ ga wɔnɔ, zooi ʋe, ʋɛ nɔnɔi ta kɔin gulɔi ʋooʋaai ná. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, wa-ƓALAGI, nii é wo yeeɠaaɠwɛa, wa zɔɔma ziiti. <verse eid="LEV 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 20:25"/>Wa zɔɠɔzu ɠɛ kɔzɔba zuaiti ta sua ɲadegaiti ba, ta kɔzɔba wɔniiti ta wɔni ɲadegaiti ba, naa ɠa a kɛ wo mina ɓɔɠɔ ɠɛ ga kɔzɔba ʋea, ga suaiti, ɓaa wɔniiti, ɓaa ga naati kpein, niiti ti ɓokposu zooi ma. Gè ti yeeɠaaɠwɛa, ta suai zɔiti, nii a kɛ wo kwɛɛ ga ti ɠɔzɔʋɛ.<verse eid="LEV 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 20:26"/>«À ɲade nɔ̀un bɛ, mazɔlɔɔ ɲàdegɛ, nɔ̀un nà, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, gè wo yeeɠaaɠwɛɛʋɛ wa zɔɔma ziiti, naa ɠa a kɛ, wo ɠɛ ga nɔ̀nɔiti.<verse eid="LEV 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 20:27"/>«Zunui ɓaa anzanui nii é ga gɔvɛ laawooleʋe nui, ɓaa nii gɔvɛiti ti ʋelela ʋele vaiti bosu ma, wa sɔ ga kɔtui, é za. Ma ɲamai ɠa la unma.»<verse eid="LEV 20:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LEV 21"/>
  <para style="s">Deveiti <optbreak/> é lo zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 21:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni Moize ma: «Ɓɔɛ zalaɠa ɠula nuiti pɔ, Aalɔn ná-doun zunuiti, è ɠɛ ti ma: Zalaɠa ɠula nui la ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔa ná-nuɓusɛiti saama gɔvɛ maaʋele ma. <verse eid="LEV 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 21:2"/>É ɠula ná-nu ɠiteɠitegiti polu, dee, ɓaa kɛɛɠɛ, ɓaa ná-doun zunui, ɓaa ná-doun anzanui, ɓaa kɛɛɠɛloin, <verse eid="LEV 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 21:3"/>ɓaa ná-seelai, nii é la dɛ zeini zunu ʋɛ. Toɠa zoo é ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔ ná-seelai naa ʋɛ, tɔɔzei naa ɠa ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu, é la dɛ lɛɛni zunu ɠili ná-pɛlɛ wu. <verse eid="LEV 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 21:4"/>Toɠa ga kundiɠii ná-nuɓusɛiti saama, é la ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔa, é ʋa lɔɠɔi ɠoloɠolo.<verse eid="LEV 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 21:5"/>«Ni saa ɠa lona zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ma, ti la kpaana pɛa tɔungi zu, ti la ɓakalagiti boga, ti la pɔlɔpalɛ lɔa ɓɔɠɔ ma. <verse eid="LEV 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 21:6"/>Ta ɲade ta-ƓALAGI ʋɛ, ti mina ta-ƓALAGI lɔɠɔi ɠoloɠolo, mazɔlɔɔ ta zalaɠaiti kulazu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, ná-daamianigi ʋe é ɠalazu abui ɠa. Ti maanɛɛʋɛ, ti ɲade. <verse eid="LEV 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 21:7"/>Ti la koloɠolo anzanu zeiɗa, ɓaa nii tɔɠɔi ɠoloɠologai. Ti la anzanu zeiɗa, nii sinigi ɠɛlɛai ba, mazɔlɔɔ zalaɠa ɠula nui ɲadegɛ ná-GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 21:8"/>Wa pɛtɛ ga ɲade nu, mazɔlɔɔ tɔ ɠa é daamianigi ɠulazu ga zalaɠai wa-ƓALAGI ʋɛ. Toɠa ɠɛ ga ɲade nu wo ʋɛ, mazɔlɔɔ nɔ̀un ɲàdegɛ, nɛ̀i gè ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nii é wo ɲadesu. <verse eid="LEV 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 21:9"/>Ni zalaɠa ɠula nui ná-doun anzanui a lɔɠɔi ɠoloɠolona ga é lɔ koloɠologi zu, toɠa kɛɛɠɛ lɔɠɔi ɠoloɠolosu, ta gala, é za.<verse eid="LEV 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 21:10"/>«Zalaɠa ɠula nui nii kundiɠilai zea, kɛɛɠɛlointi maazu, nii gulɔ ɲadegai ziaai ma, ta nii zalaɠa ɠula zeɠeiti toai kɔba, é la nɔundeɠaiti zɛga yaɠaba, ta é la ná-seɠeiti balia ga. <verse eid="LEV 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 21:11"/>É la lia pooma ɠoba, é la ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔa, anɛɛ ni kɛɛɠɛ a zaana, ɓaa dee. <verse eid="LEV 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 21:12"/>É la ɠula seizu ɲadegai ʋa, naa ɠa a kɛ é mina seizu ɲadegai ɠɔzɔ, mazɔlɔɔ feeʋɛ bɛ̀ ga nà-siɛma wulɔ ɲadegai maaʋele. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.<verse eid="LEV 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 21:13"/>«Zalaɠa ɠula nui naa mina anzanu zei, nii é zunu vaa ɠwɛɛ. <verse eid="LEV 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 21:14"/>É la poanza zeiɗa, ɓaa anzanui nii sinigi ɠɛlɛai ba, ɓaa koloɠolo anzanu, ɓaa nii tɔɠɔi ɠoloɠologai, kɛlɛ anzanui a ɠɛ seizu, kɛni é ɠɛ ga ná-bolodai zu anzalopo ɓeai, é la dɛ zunu vaa ɠwɛɛ. <verse eid="LEV 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 21:15"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui naa la mavofodai lɔɠɔ ɠoloɠologa ná-bolodai zaama, mazɔlɔɔ nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nii é tɔun ɲadesu.»<verse eid="LEV 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 21:16"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LEV 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 21:17"/>«Ɓɔɛ Aalɔn ʋɔ, è ɠɛ ma: È-mavofodai zu zunui tanɔpɛ, nii nɛɛʋuzu ba, naa mina maaɓuɠa ga é ná-GALAGI ná-daamianigi ɠula ga zalaɠai. <verse eid="LEV 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 21:18"/>Zunui tanɔpɛ, nii nɛɛʋuzu a ɠɛ ba, naa la maaɓuɠaa ná ʋa: gaazuɠole nu, ɓaa dɛkpu nu, ɓaa nii sokpai maaʋegai, ɓaa baalobazuʋɛ ta zeɠeai kɛʋele ma, <verse eid="LEV 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 21:19"/>ɓaa zunui ta, nii kɔɠɔi ɠaleai, ɓaa zeei, <verse eid="LEV 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 21:20"/>ɓaa zunui ta, nii gɔgɔi polu, ɓaa é ga kutui, ɓaa gaazuwana nu, ɓaa dɔɠɔi ma, ɓaa kulama zeeɓɛi ba, ɓaa nii pɔlɔɠɛzɛɠain woloai. <verse eid="LEV 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 21:21"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui Aalɔn mavofodai zu, zunui tanɔpɛ nii nɛɛʋuzu ba, naa mina maaɓuɠa ga é ʋa zalaɠaiti kula Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, zalaɠai niiti ti ɠalazu abui ɠa. Tɛi nɛɛʋuzuʋɛ ba, é mina maaɓuɠa, é ʋa ná-GALAGI ná-daamianigi ɠula ga zalaɠai. <verse eid="LEV 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 21:22"/>Toɠa zoo é ná-GALAGI ná-daamianigi ta mi, aniiti ti wola ɲadegai, ta ani ɲadegaiti. <verse eid="LEV 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 21:23"/>Kɛlɛ é la lia kwɛpele seɠezuɠoozagi ʋɔ pelei, ta é la maaɓuɠaa zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ʋa, mazɔlɔɔ nɛɛʋuzuʋɛ ɠa ba. É la nà-ada ɲadegai ɠɔzɔa ta ma zɔɔlaiti, mazɔlɔɔ nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nii é ti ɲadesu.»<verse eid="LEV 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 21:24"/>Moize naama wooiti daazeelini Aalɔn ma ta ná-doun zunuiti, é ʋɛɛ Izilayɛle nuiti kpein ba.<verse eid="LEV 21:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LEV 22"/>
  <para style="s">Maaɲɛɛi é lo zalaɠa aniiti fai ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 22:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LEV 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 22:2"/>«Aalɔn ta ná-doun zunuiti kala ga fai niiti ta ti maaɲɛ, é lo vebɛani ɲadegaiti ba, niiti Izilayɛle nuiti ti ti ɠulazu bɛ̀, naa ɠa a kɛ ti mina dàasei ɲadegai ɠoloɠolo. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.<verse eid="LEV 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 22:3"/>«Ɠɛ ti ma: Wo-mavofodaiti saama, zunu nɔpɛ kɔzɔai a yɛ de, é maaɓuɠa vebɛani ɲadegaiti ba, niiti Izilayɛle nuiti ti ti veezu bɛ̀, naama nui ɠa ɓɛ, é zeɠe gàazu. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI. <verse eid="LEV 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 22:4"/>Nu-o-nu Aalɔn mavofodai zu, kulama zeeɓɛi a ɠɛ ba, ɓaa kalaɲa kolegi, naa la vebɛani ɲadegaiti ta mia, eyɛsu é ɓe ga ɲade. Zekana é la ga zɔi a vɔɔɠuna nui ta ʋa, kɔzɔai ga poomai, ɓaa é ɓɔɠɔ maaɠoloɠologai. <verse eid="LEV 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 22:5"/>Zɔi a vɔɔɠuna kpokpo ganii ta ʋa, é kɔzɔi maazɔlɔɔ, ɓaa nu vului ta, nii kɔzɔba anii ma zii tanɔpɛ a ʋɛɛna ba, é ɠɔzɔ ga naa, <verse eid="LEV 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 22:6"/>zɔi a vɔɔɠuna ta ʋa, naa ɠa yɛ kɔzɔyai zu eyɛsu kpɔkɔi, é la vebɛani ɲadegaiti ta mia, kɛni é maagba. <verse eid="LEV 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 22:7"/>Foloi a ɓena ga da, toɠa ɲade, naa ʋolu toɠa zoo niina é vebɛani ɲadegaiti ta mi, mazɔlɔɔ ná-daamianigi ʋe. <verse eid="LEV 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 22:8"/>É la sua ʋooma mia, ɓaa nii baliʋaliai ga, nii a kɛ é mina ɓɔɠɔ ɠɔzɔ ga naa. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.<verse eid="LEV 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 22:9"/>«Zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ta nà-deveiti makɛ, naa ɠa a kɛ ti mina koloɠolo, koto ʋa la ti unma, ti mina ʋa zaazu. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nii é ti ɲadesu.<verse eid="LEV 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 22:10"/>«Izilayɛle nu nɔpɛ ge mina vebɛani ɲadegai ta mi, ni é la ga zalaɠa ɠula nu. Anɛɛ zalaɠa ɠula nui ma wɛɛin ta ná-botiɠɛ nui, ti la vebɛani ɲadegai ta mia. <verse eid="LEV 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 22:11"/>Kɛlɛ duɔi nii zalaɠa ɠula nui geyaai, naa ɠa zoo é ta mi, ta nii ɓalaagi sɔlɔɔgai ná-pɛlɛi wu, ta ná-daamianigi ta mi. <verse eid="LEV 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 22:12"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ná-doun anzanui, sinigi la ga zalaɠa ɠula nu, naa la naa ta mia, nii seɠeai vebɛani ɲadegaiti ba. <verse eid="LEV 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 22:13"/>Kɛlɛ zalaɠa ɠula nui ná-doun anzanui, nii é ga poanzai, ɓaa nii sinigi ɠɛlɛai ba, é la doun zɔlɔɔni, ta nii é ʋaazu ɠalesu ma, é yɛ kɛɛɠɛ ná-pɛlɛi wu, eɠɛʋelei é ɠɛni ná la, ná-nu niinɛlai zu, naa ɠa zoo é kɛɛɠɛ ná-daamianigiti ta mi. Nu nɔpɛ ge la ta mia, ni é la ga zalaɠa ɠula nu.<verse eid="LEV 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 22:14"/>«Ni nui ta a vebɛani ɲadegai miina, ki ge la ba, toɠa vebɛanii liegɔi naa ve zalaɠa ɠula nui ya, é ta ʋɛɛ ba ga gaaɠwɛsu lɔɔlugɔi zeizu ɠilagi. <verse eid="LEV 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 22:15"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ti mina Izilayɛle nuiti ta-vebɛani ɲadegaiti kɔzɔ, nii naati ti seɠezu ba Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 22:16"/>Ni naati ta ta-vebɛani ɲadegaiti miina, ta ta-vaaɠaaza golai la ɓɔɠɔ unma, ti ɠɛ ga sɔba nuiti, mazɔlɔɔ nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nii é ti ɲadesu.»<verse eid="LEV 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Suai niiti ta zoo ɠulazu <optbreak/> ga zalaɠai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 22:17"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LEV 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 22:18"/>«Ɓɔɛ Aalɔn ta ná-doun zunuiti pɔ, naa ʋɛɛ Izilayɛle nuiti kpein ba, è ɠɛ ti ma: Nu kpein é ga Izilayɛle nu, ɓaa ti ga seikɔɠɔma nu Izilayɛle yooi zu, niiti ta gala zalaɠai ɠula Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, minazeɠe daazeeli vaa zu, ɓaa vebɛanii vaa zu ti daai ɠisu, <verse eid="LEV 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 22:19"/>nii a kɛ daazo, toɠa ʋa ga togani zinɛ ɠila, nii nɛɛʋuzu la ba, é kula nikɛiti saama, ɓaa baalagiti, ɓaa boliiti. <verse eid="LEV 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 22:20"/>À mina ani nɔpɛ kula ga zalaɠai, nii nɛɛʋuzu a ɠɛ ba, mazɔlɔɔ daa la zoga wo ʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 22:21"/>Ni zunui ta a toganii ma wolai ɓaa ma goi ta ɠulana ga ziilɛi zalaɠai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, é ɠɛni ga minazeɠe daazeeli vai, ɓaa é ɠɛni ga vebɛanii nii é daai ɠisu, nɛɛʋuzu mina ɠɛ zalaɠa anii ʋa, naa ɠa a kɛ daazo. Nɛɛʋuzu nɔpɛ ge mina ɠɛ ba. <verse eid="LEV 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 22:22"/>À mina sua nɔpɛ kula ga zalaɠai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, nii gaazuɠoleai, ɓaa maalɛɠɛfɛgai, ɓaa koliiti ti ba, ɓaa kaʋai ɠulaai ma, ɓaa gɛlɛɠɛlɛgi ɠulaai ma. À mina naa ɠala zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 22:23"/>Nikɛ zinɛi ɓaa baala ziʋoi nii baalobazuʋɛ ta ɠoozaai, ɓaa ta ɓuɠa, wa zoo wo naa ɠula ga zalaɠai ɓaa vebɛanii, nii wo daai ɠisu, kɛlɛ naa ɠɛɠala zuai ma zalaɠai la daazoga minazeɠe daazeeli vaa zu. <verse eid="LEV 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 22:24"/>À mina sua ɠula ga zalaɠai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, nii pɔlɔɠɛzɛɠain woloai, ɓaa kulaai su, ɓaa teʋeai ga. À mina naa ta ɠɛ ga zalaɠa wa-yooi zu. <verse eid="LEV 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 22:25"/>À mina suai naa ma zii tanɔpɛ geya wɛɛn ma, wo ʋa kula wa-ƓALAGI ʋɛ ga zalaɠai. Mazɔlɔɔ ti maalɛɠɛfɛgɛ, nɛɛʋuzuʋɛ ɠa ba, daa la zoga wo ʋɛ.»<verse eid="LEV 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 22:26"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LEV 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 22:27"/>«Siɛgi zu nikɛi a zɔlɔɔna da, ɓaa baalagi, ɓaa bolii, toɠa yɛ ma leei ʋa, é kɛ ga folo lɔfela. É zo folo lɔsaʋasiɛi ma, eyɛsu zɔɔma voloiti, a ɠulana ga zalaɠai, nii abui galazu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, daa ɠa zo. <verse eid="LEV 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 22:28"/>À mina togani leei ta ma yiʋoi ʋaa ʋɔɔma folo ɠila nɔ. <verse eid="LEV 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 22:29"/>Wa ɠɛna mama fee zalaɠai ɠulaa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, wa kula ʋele ɓɛtɛ, nii a kɛ daazo. <verse eid="LEV 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 22:30"/>Wa ti pɛ mi ma voloi nɔ ma, wo la ta yɛga ná, é ʋa yɛsu sobui ʋa zeeli. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.<verse eid="LEV 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 22:31"/>«Wa nà-deveiti so, wo ziɛ ga tiye. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.<verse eid="LEV 22:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 22:32"/>«À mina dàasei ɲadegai ɠoloɠolo, nà-ɲadedai ɠa maamusɛi zɔlɔɔ Izilayɛle nuiti saama. Nɔ̀un nà Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nii é wo ɲadesu, <verse eid="LEV 22:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 22:33"/>nɛ̀i gè wo ɠulaai Ezipete yooi ʋa, ga gè ɠɛ ga wa-ƓALAGI. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.»<verse eid="LEV 22:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LEV 23"/>
  <para style="s">Fɛti voloiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 23:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LEV 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 23:2"/>«Ɓɔɛ Izilayɛle nuiti pɔ, è ɠɛ ti ma: Fɛti voloi ɠa ga niiti, wo maanɛai wo ti ɠula dɛ̀bi vai ma, ti ga nà-fɛti voloiti. Naati ma vaa zu, wa nuɓusɛiti toli, ti gaalɛba ɲadegai wo.<verse eid="LEV 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 23:3"/>«Ɛsɛ ka ná-botii ɠɛ folo lɔzita laawu, kɛlɛ foloi lɔfelasiɛi ɠa ga dooɠo foloi, gaalɛba ɲadegai ɠa wo ma. Wo la boti nɔpɛ kɛa naama voloi. Dooɠo foloi ɠa ɠɛ de Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI lɛbi vai ma, ʋɛ nɔpɛ wa zei ná.<verse eid="LEV 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 23:4"/>«Wɛlɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-fɛti volo ɠiligi tanigaa ʋa, niiti wo maanɛai wo nuɓusɛiti toli ma, ti gaalɛba ɲadegai wo naama ɠuiti ma, ti logai.<verse eid="LEV 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pakegi ta ɓului lɛʋɛ la su, <optbreak/> naati ma vɛtii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 28:16-25">Gaalu Sɛʋɛi 28:16-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 23:5"/>«Alu mɔungi ma volo puugɔ maazu naanisiɛi (14) ma ɓɔkɔi, kpidii a ʋɛɛna, naa ɠa é ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-Pakegi. <verse eid="LEV 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 23:6"/>Alugi naa ma volo puugɔ maazu lɔɔlusiɛi (15), naa ɠa ɠɛ ga ɓului nii lɛʋɛ la su, naa ma vɛtii, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI lɛbi vai ma. Folo lɔfela laawu, wa yɛ ɓului miizu, nii lɛʋɛ la su. <verse eid="LEV 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 23:7"/>Folo mɔungi, wa gaalɛba ɲadegai wo, wo la boti nɔpɛ kɛa, eɠɛʋelei wa ɗa kɛ la. <verse eid="LEV 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 23:8"/>Folo lɔfela laawu, wa zalaɠai ɠula, nii abui galazu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. Folo lɔfelasiɛi ma, wa nuɓusɛiti toli, wo gaalɛba ɲadegai wo, wo la boti nɔpɛ kɛa, eɠɛʋelei wa ɗa kɛ la.»<verse eid="LEV 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zooi ʋaalɔnɔ mɔungiti <optbreak/> ma vɛtii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 23:9"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LEV 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 23:10"/>«Ɓɔɛ Izilayɛle nuiti pɔ, è ɠɛ ti ma: Siɛgi zu wo ʋaazu lɔɔzu la zooi zu, nii gè feezu wo ya, wa moloi leʋena, wa ʋa ga ma ɠili ɠila, zalaɠa ɠula nui ʋɔ, wa-molo leʋea mɔungi zu. <verse eid="LEV 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 23:11"/>Dooɠo foloi ʋoluma zobui, zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa molo ɠilii latɛɠɛ vai ma ʋoogi ɠɛ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠakala, naa ɠa a kɛ daazo wo ʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 23:12"/>Voloi wo ʋaazu molo ɠilii latɛɠɛ vai ma ʋoogi ɠɛɛzu la, wa kona gila baala sinɛi zo, nii nɛɛʋuzu la ba, wo kula ga gala zalaɠai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 23:13"/>Wa ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi kilo lɔzita ʋɛɛ ba, gaayɔgai ga gulɔi, eɠɛ vebɛ zalaɠai galaai abui ɠa, makugi nɛai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, ta puya zalaɠai litɛlɛ ɠila ta tukpɛ (1,5) dɔɔi zu. <verse eid="LEV 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 23:14"/>Aisa naama voloi ʋa zeeli, wo ʋaazu ma ga vebɛanii wa-ƓALAGI ʋɔ, à mina ɓulu mi, ɓaa ani ɠɔpɔ geega, ɓaa molo niinɛi. Naa ɠa ga ɠɔoɠɔ tɔgi wo-mavofodaiti kpein bɛ, ʋɛ nɔpɛ wa zei ná.<verse eid="LEV 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pantekote voloi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 28:26-31">Gaalu Sɛʋɛi 28:26-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 23:15"/>«Wa dɔɔɠɔi ɠaalu ga dɔfela, é zo dooɠo foloi ʋoluma voloi ma, yeei wo ʋaazu la ga molo ɠili, wo datɛɠɛ mà. <verse eid="LEV 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 23:16"/>É zo dooɠo foloi ma voloi ma, wa folo ʋuulɔɔlugɔ (50) ɠaalu, wo molo niinɛi ma vebɛ zalaɠa ɠili kɛʋele ɓɛtɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 23:17"/>Wa ʋa ga ɓulu felegɔ, wo zeɠe la wo-zeizuʋɛ, wo ti latɛɠɛ, ti ɠilagilagi ɠa ɓɛtɛ ga ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi kilo lɔzita, ti mɔ ga lɛʋɛi. Naati ta ga zooi ʋaalɔnɔ mɔungiti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 23:18"/>Ɓului naati poluma, wa kona gila baala ziʋo lɔfela ɠula ga zalaɠai, nɛɛʋuzu mina ɠɛ ti ʋa, ta nikɛ zinɛ ɓokpa gila ta baala sinɛ felegɔ, ti ɠula ga gala zalaɠai, é ʋɛɛ ta-vebɛ zalaɠai ʋa, ta ta-ʋuya zalaɠai. Zalaɠai ʋe, nii abui galazu, makugi nɛai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 23:19"/>Wa boli zinɛi ɠula ga koto gba zalaɠai, ta kona gila baala sinɛ felegɔ, wo kula ga ziilɛi zalaɠai. <verse eid="LEV 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 23:20"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa ti latɛɠɛ vai ma ʋoogi ɠɛ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠakala, é ʋɛɛ zooi ʋaalɔnɔ mɔungiti ma ɓului ʋa, é ʋɛɛ baala ziʋo felegɔiti ba. Ta zeɠe, ti ve Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, ti ɠɛ ga zalaɠa ɠula nui nɔnɔi. <verse eid="LEV 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 23:21"/>Naama voloi nɔ, wa nuɓusɛiti toli, ti gaalɛba ɲadegai wo. Wo la boti nɔpɛ kɛa, eɠɛʋelei wa ɗa kɛ la. Naa ɠa ɠɛ ga ɠɔoɠɔ tɔgi wo-mavofodaiti kpein bɛ, ʋɛ nɔpɛ wa zei ná.<verse eid="LEV 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 23:22"/>«Siɛgi zu wo moloi leʋezu la wa-yooi zu, wa kpala kpelamaʋɛ yɛ ná, wo mina ná leʋe, wo mina ɠale ma posuyɛʋɛi ma. Wa naa yɛ ná bala nuiti bɛ, ta seikɔɠɔma nuiti. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, wa-ƓALAGI.»<verse eid="LEV 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Puʋu fɛɛ vɛtii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 29:1-6">Gaalu Sɛʋɛi 29:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 23:23"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LEV 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 23:24"/>«Ɓɔɛ Izilayɛle nuiti pɔ, è ɠɛ ti ma: Alugi lɔfelasiɛi ma volo mɔungi ma, toɠa ɠɛ ga dooɠo folo wola wo ʋɛ, wo ɠitoo sù, wa puʋugiti fɛ, wo gaalɛba ɲadegai wo. <verse eid="LEV 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 23:25"/>Wo la boti nɔpɛ kɛa, eɠɛʋelei wa ɗa kɛ la. Wa zalaɠai ɠula, nii abui galazu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ.»<verse eid="LEV 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Koto gba voloi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 29:7-11">Gaalu Sɛʋɛi 29:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 23:26"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LEV 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 23:27"/>«Alugi lɔfelasiɛi ma volo puugɔi ma, naa ɠa ɠɛ ga koto gba voloi. Wa gaalɛba ɲadegai wo, wo zugi zo, wo zalaɠai ɠula, nii abui galazu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 23:28"/>Wo la boti nɔpɛ kɛa naama voloi, mazɔlɔɔ koto gba voloi ʋe, yeei koto gba vai maanɛai é ɠɛ la wo ʋɛ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, wa-ƓALAGI. <verse eid="LEV 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 23:29"/>Nu-o-nu nii é la zugi zoni naama voloi, naa ɓe ka leʋe ná-nuɓusɛiti ba. <verse eid="LEV 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 23:30"/>Nu nɔpɛ a boti ɠɛɛna naama voloi, nà undaaʋili ná-nuɓusɛiti saama. <verse eid="LEV 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 23:31"/>Wo la boti nɔpɛ kɛa. Naa ɠa ɠɛ ga ɠɔoɠɔ tɔgi wo-mavofodaiti kpein bɛ, ʋɛ nɔpɛ wo zeizu ná. <verse eid="LEV 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 23:32"/>Toɠa ɠɛ wo ʋɛ ga dooɠo folo wolai, wa zugi zo. É zo alugi ma voloi laaʋuusiɛi ma ɓɔkɔi ma, é li poluma zobui ma ɓɔkɔi ʋɔ, kɛni wo looɠo.»<verse eid="LEV 23:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kota vɛtii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 29:12-39">Gaalu Sɛʋɛi 29:12-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 23:33"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LEV 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 23:34"/>«Ɓɔɛ Izilayɛle nuiti pɔ, è ɠɛ ti ma: Ma alugi lɔfelasiɛi nɔ ma volo puugɔ maazu lɔɔlusiɛi (15) ma, naa ɠa ɠɛ ga kota vɛtii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, folo lɔfela laawu. <verse eid="LEV 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 23:35"/>Folo mɔungi, gaalɛba ɲadegai ɠa wo. Wo la boti nɔpɛ kɛa, eɠɛʋelei wa ɗa kɛ la. <verse eid="LEV 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 23:36"/>Folo lɔfela laawu, folo-o-folo wa gala zalaɠai gila kula, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. Foloi lɔsaʋasiɛi, wa gaalɛba ɲadegai wo, wo gala zalaɠaiti kula Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. Toɠa ɠɛ ga gaalɛba ɲadegai GALA dɛbi vai ma. Wo la boti nɔpɛ kɛa, eɠɛʋelei wa ɗa kɛ la.<verse eid="LEV 23:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 23:37"/>«Fɛti voloiti kana, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI lɛbi vai ma, niiti wo maanɛai wo nuɓusɛiti toli ti ma, ti gaalɛba ɲadegai wo. Ti zalaɠaiti kula, ti ɠalazu abui ɠa, ta vebɛ zalaɠaiti, ta zalaɠaiti, ta puya zalaɠaiti, é zoloo foloi ɠilagilagi ma leveiti ma. <verse eid="LEV 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 23:38"/>Wa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-dooɠo foloiti maaɲɛ, wo ti la wa-vebɛaniiti maazu, ta wa-minazeɠegiti, ta wa-vebɛaniiti kpein wo ti laai ɠisu, niiti wo ti veezu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ.<verse eid="LEV 23:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 23:39"/>«Alu dɔfelasiɛi ma volo puugɔ maazu lɔɔlusiɛi (15) ma, siɛgi zu wo zooi zu ani waaiti kulazu la, wa fɛtii ɠula Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI lɛbi vai ma. Wa naa ɠɛ folo lɔfela laawu. Folo mɔungi ɠa ɠɛ ga dooɠogi, dɔsaʋasiɛi ɓalaa ɠɛ ga dooɠogi. <verse eid="LEV 23:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 23:40"/>Folo mɔungi, wa gulu ʋagɔiti ma waai zeɠe, ta dɔɔ laaiti, ta gulu ɓekegiti, ti ɠaaɓiiliai, ta ziɛla wulu ɓekegiti. Wa ɠoozunɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, wa-ƓALAGI, wo naa ɠɛ folo lɔfela laawu. <verse eid="LEV 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 23:41"/>Kona-o-kona wa fɛtii naa ɠula Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI lɛbi vai ma, folo lɔfela laawu. Toɠa ga ɠɔoɠɔ tɔgi wo-mavofodaiti kpein bɛ. Wa ɠɛ kulazu alu dɔfelasiɛi ma. <verse eid="LEV 23:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 23:42"/>Wa zei kotaiti bu folo lɔfela laawu. Izilayɛle yooi zu, zou lointi kpein ta zei kotaiti bu, <verse eid="LEV 23:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 23:43"/>naa ɠa a kɛ, wo-mavofodaiti ti kwɛɛ ga gè Izilayɛle nuiti seini kotaiti bu, gè ti ɠulaai ma Ezipete yooi ʋa. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, wa-ƓALAGI.»<verse eid="LEV 23:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 23:44"/>Ʋele ɠana Moize kalagiti feeni la Izilayɛle nuiti zea, é ʋilɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-fɛti voloiti ba.<verse eid="LEV 23:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LEV 24"/>
  <para style="s">Deveiti <optbreak/> é lo seizu ɲadegai ná-fitinaiti ba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 27:20-21">Ɛgezɔde 27:20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 24:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LEV 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 24:2"/>«Devei ve Izilayɛle nuiti zea, ga ti ʋa è ʋɔ ga wolive wulɔ ʋagɔi, kpɛtɛai fitinai vaa zu, naa ɠa a kɛ wo yeeyɛ fitinaiti ba, yeenɔpɛ ti mina za. <verse eid="LEV 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 24:3"/>GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu, kwɛpele seɠezuɠoozagi ɠakalaʋɛ, nii é zeele woo ɠesui ɠakalaʋɛ, miná ɠa Aalɔn a sei ná, fitinaiti ti so, é zo kpɔkɔi ma, eyɛsu geelaalao, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. Toɠa ga ɠɔoɠɔ tɔgi, wo-mavofodaiti kpein bɛ. <verse eid="LEV 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 24:4"/>Toɠa fitinaiti kɛʋele ɓɛtɛ, fitina zei anii ɠa, é ga zanu kitei, ti ɗa zo yeenɔpɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu.<verse eid="LEV 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓului é ɠɛni veezu GALA bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 24:5"/>«Ɗa ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi zeɠe, è ɓulu puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12) ɓɛtɛ, ɓului ɠilagilagi ɠa ɠɛ ga kilo lɔzita. <verse eid="LEV 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 24:6"/>Ɗa ti ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ zanu kitei ma laɓalii ɠa, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, ga seizu felegɔ. <verse eid="LEV 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 24:7"/>Ɗa ansanse kitei ta ʋu seizu ɠilagilagi ma. Naa ʋolu ɗa ansanse kitei ɠala Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, ɓului ʋotogi zu, eɠɛ ɠizɛsui. <verse eid="LEV 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 24:8"/>Dooɠo foloi ɠilagilagi, ta ɗa ɓului naati kɛʋele ɓɛtɛ yeenɔpɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. Toɠa ga minazeɠegi é yɛsu ná ɠɔ, Izilayɛle nuiti ta-vaa zu. <verse eid="LEV 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 24:9"/>Ɓului naati ta ɠɛ ga Aalɔn ta ná-doun zunuiti tɔnɔ, ta ti mi ada ɲadegai ta, mazɔlɔɔ toɠa ɠɛ ti ʋɛ ga vebɛani ɲadega wolai, naati saama, niiti ti ɠalazu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. Toɠa ga ɠɔoɠɔ tɔgi.»<verse eid="LEV 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Woo ɲɔu wo nuiti <optbreak/> ta nu ʋaa nuiti sopelei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 24:10"/>Yeeta, Izilayɛle anzanu ɠila ta Ezipete zunu ɠila, ti-loun zunui ʋaani Izilayɛle nuiti saama. Kpɔɛi leʋeni ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ, Izilayɛle anzanui naa ná-doun zunui ta Izilayɛle zunui ta ti yɔɠɔzu. <verse eid="LEV 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 24:11"/>Izilayɛle anzanui naa ná-doun zunui woo ɲɔiti boni GALA daalɔɠɔma, é koto. Ti ʋaani la Moize ʋɔ. Dee laaseigi ɠɛni ga Selomite, Diɓili ná-doun anzanui, Dan ná-bolodai zu. <verse eid="LEV 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 24:12"/>Ti makɛni ga pagɔ, eyɛsu deve zɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ya.<verse eid="LEV 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 24:13"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LEV 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 24:14"/>«À woo ɲɔu wo nui ɠula wo-ʋuuzuʋɛ ʋa. Niiti kpein ti gooi mɛnigai, naati ti yeeiti pɛɛ unma, naa ʋoluma bɛbɛi kpein ge sɔ ga kɔtui, é za. <verse eid="LEV 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 24:15"/>Ɗa ɓɔɛ Izilayɛle nuiti pɔ ga, nu-o-nu a ná-GALAGI ɠotona, naama nui ɠa ná-kotoi ma ɠasɔi zeɠe. <verse eid="LEV 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 24:16"/>Zɔi nɔpɛ a woo ɲɔu wona Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laaseigi laalɔɠɔma, ta naama nui ʋaa, bɛbɛi kpein ka sɔ ga kɔtui, é za, é ɠɛni ga seikɔɠɔma nu ɓaa zou loun, tɔɔzei é woo ɲɔi woga GALA daaseigi laalɔɠɔma.<verse eid="LEV 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 24:17"/>«Zɔi a nu ʋaana, ta naama nui ʋaa. <verse eid="LEV 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 24:18"/>Zɔi a sua ʋaana, toɠa potogi ve ga suai ta. Zɛnvui ʋoto ka ɠɛ ga zɛnvui. <verse eid="LEV 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 24:19"/>Ni nui ta a seiɲɔɠɔi maawanana, toɠa ɠɛ la, eɠɛʋelei tɔ ɓɔɠɔi é kɛa la ga zɔi. <verse eid="LEV 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 24:20"/>Nii a nu ɠaei ɠale, naama nui ɠaei ɠa ɠale, nu ɠaazuɠɛzɛi ʋoto ka ɠɛ ga nu ɠaazuɠɛzɛi, nu ɲiiga ʋoto ka ɠɛ ga nu ɲiiga. Ta naama maawanai ɠɛɠalai ɠɛ ga naa, nii é kɛa ga zɔi. <verse eid="LEV 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 24:21"/>Zɔi a sua ʋaana, toɠa potogi ve. Kɛlɛ zɔi a nu ʋaana, ta naama nui ʋaa.<verse eid="LEV 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 24:22"/>«Tɔ gilagi nɔ ɠa seiɗai wo ma, seikɔɠɔma nu ʋɛɛ zou loun ʋa, mazɔlɔɔ nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, wa-ƓALAGI.»<verse eid="LEV 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 24:23"/>Moize ɓɔɛni Izilayɛle nuiti pɔ. Ti woo ɲɔu wo nui ɠulani ti-ʋuuzuʋɛ ʋa, ti sɔ ga kɔtuiti, é za. Izilayɛle nuiti ti kɛɛni ɠana, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma levei veeni la Moize ya.<verse eid="LEV 24:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="LEV 25"/>
  <para style="s">Zooi ná-dooɠo konagi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 15:1-11">Tɔ Sɛʋɛi Velesiɛi 15:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 25:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ Sinayi gizei ma, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LEV 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 25:2"/>«Ɓɔɛ Izilayɛle nuiti pɔ, è ɠɛ ti ma: Siɛgi zu wo ʋaazu lɛɛzu la zooi naa zu, gè feezu wo ʋɛ, wa ɗa zooi yɛ ná, é ɗa looɠo yeeɠɛɠalai tanigaa zu, naa ɠa ɠɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-lɛbiyai vaa ma. <verse eid="LEV 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 25:3"/>Kona dɔzita laawu, wa wa-ani zuwui vaza wa-ɓalagiti su. Kona dɔzita laawu, wa wa-leezɛn ɓeleiti suɓɛtɛ ga pagɔ, wo gaawaai ɠula. <verse eid="LEV 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 25:4"/>Kɛlɛ kona dɔfelasiɛi, dooɠogi ɠa ve zooi ya, dooɠogi ɠa ɠɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI lɛbi vai ma. Wo la ani zuwu vazaga wa-ɓalagiti ba. Wo la wa-leezɛn ɓeleiti suɓɛtɛa. <verse eid="LEV 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 25:5"/>Wo la molo ɠɔɠɔʋolu leʋea, wo mina leezɛn ɠula kpelei zu, nii su la ɓɛtɛni. Naa ɠa ɠɛ ga dooɠogi ɲɛgɛlɛin zooi ʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 25:6"/>Zooi ná-dooɠogi zaalai zu, wa ɠɔnɔgi zɔlɔɔ, wɔun wa, wa-wotiɠɛ zunuiti, ta wa-wotiɠɛ anzanuiti, ta nui nii wo salazu folo-o-folo, ta wɛɛn é zeini wo ɠɔɠɔma, <verse eid="LEV 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 25:7"/>ta wa-loganiiti, ta suaiti ti wa-yooi zu, zooi ʋaalɔnɔgi kpein ka ɠɛ ga daamianigi.<verse eid="LEV 25:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓɔɠɔyeemai ta unmɔɔ konagi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 25:8"/>«Wa dooɠo kona dɔfela ɠaalu, kona dɔfela zeizu lɔfela, naa ɠa é ga kona ʋuunaanigɔ maazu taaʋuugɔ (49). <verse eid="LEV 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 25:9"/>Alu dɔfelasiɛi ma voloi ʋuusiɛi ma, wa puʋugi vɛ, gooɠula, koto gba voloi, wa puʋugi vɛ wa-yooi kpein su. <verse eid="LEV 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 25:10"/>Wa kona ʋuulɔɔlusiɛi (50) naa leve ga kona ɲadegai, wo ɓɔɠɔyeemai laazeeli zooi zu zei wo nuiti kpein ma. Toɠa ɠɛ wo ʋɛ ga ɓɔɠɔyeema ɠonagi, ɛsɛ gilagilagi ná-zooi ɠa ɠaaɠale ma pɔ, ta ɛsɛ ka ɠale ma ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu. <verse eid="LEV 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 25:11"/>Kona ʋuulɔɔlusiɛi (50) ɠa ɠɛ wo ʋɛ ga ɓɔɠɔyeema ɠonagi: Wo la ani zuwu vazaga, wo mina molo ɠɔɠɔʋolu leʋe, wo mina leezɛn ɠula kpelei zu, nii su la ɓɛtɛni. <verse eid="LEV 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 25:12"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ɓɔɠɔyeema ɠonagi ʋe. Wa deve ga ɲadegɛ. Anii niiti ti ʋɔnɔsu ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ kpalagi zu, wa naati mi.<verse eid="LEV 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 25:13"/>«Ɓɔɠɔyeema ɠonagi naa zu, ɛsɛ gilagilagi ná-zooi ɠa ɠaaɠale ma pɔ. <verse eid="LEV 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 25:14"/>Ni wa zou ʋɔdina, ɓaa wo geya Izilayɛle nui ta ma, à mina tooma vaa ɠɛ. <verse eid="LEV 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 25:15"/>Wa zou ʋɔdi zɔngɔi ɓaa geya zɔngɔi ɠwɛteʋe, é tɔɔzei ɓɔɠɔyeema ɠona gaaɓelagi ma, konagi liegɔi teʋegai, ta molo leʋei liegɔi a ɠɛ, aisa ɓɔɠɔyeema ɠonagi ʋa zeeli. <verse eid="LEV 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 25:16"/>Konagi ta a ɠɛna laa ta ma, wa sɔngɔi ta la ma, konagi ma ge la ɠɛ dɛ mɔinni, wo ta ɠula sɔngɔi la. Mazɔlɔɔ molo leʋe laa liegɔi ɠa, é pɔdizu wo ma. <verse eid="LEV 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 25:17"/>Wo tanɔpɛ ge mina loo seiɲɔɠɔi ma. Wa lua wa-ƓALAGI ʋa, mazɔlɔɔ nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, wa-ƓALAGI.<verse eid="LEV 25:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 25:18"/>«À nà-tɔgiti so, ta nà-deveiti, wo ti makɛ, wo ziɛ ga tiye, wa zei zooi zu ziilɛigi zu. <verse eid="LEV 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 25:19"/>Zooi ɠa ná-kulanumaiti fe, wa daami wo, wo yiɠo, wo zei ziilɛigi zu. <verse eid="LEV 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 25:20"/>Ni wa ɠɛna ma: ‹Leeni ɠa gá mi konagi lɔfelasiɛi, mazɔlɔɔ gi la tii ɠɛɛni, gi la ʋaazu ani zuwu ma lɔnɔ kulazu?› <verse eid="LEV 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 25:21"/>Nà, nà-tuyai loo wo ʋɛ, konagi lɔzitasiɛi, nii a kona saʋagɔ molo leʋei liegɔi ve wo ya. <verse eid="LEV 25:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 25:22"/>Wa tii ɠɛ konagi lɔsaʋasiɛi ma, ta wa molo wɔlɔmai mi, eyɛsu molo leʋea niinɛi zeeli, wa ɠɛ ma wɔlɔmai miizu.<verse eid="LEV 25:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Poganiiti unmɔɔ fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 25:23"/>«Zooi la ʋɔdia, é ʋa yɛsu ɠɔ, mazɔlɔɔ zooi ɠa ga nɔ̀nɔ, wa pɔ̀ bɛ ga wɛɛinti, eɠɛ nuiti ti ʋaai zeizu zooi zu yeeɠɛɠala go laawu. <verse eid="LEV 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 25:24"/>Zooi zu ná kpein, ʋɛ wo ʋaazu zeizu ná, é ɠɛ ga wɔnɔ, wa tɔgi zei, é zobogi veezu ɛsɛ pɛ bɛ ga é ná-zooi unmɔɔ.<verse eid="LEV 25:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 25:25"/>«Ni Izilayɛle nui ta a ɠɛna zeaɲakalai zu, é ná-zooi ta ʋɔdi, nii maanɛai ga é lo unmɔɔ fai ɠa, é ga ná-nu ɠiteɠitegi, naa ɠa ʋa, é naa unmɔɔ, nii kɛɛloin pɔdia. <verse eid="LEV 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 25:26"/>Ni nui ta ɠa ná, nu la zea, maanɛai ga é lo unmɔɔ fai ɠa bɛ, ni a ani zɔlɔɔna ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ, nii a ná-unmɔɔ fai ɠɛ la, <verse eid="LEV 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 25:27"/>toɠa tɔɔzei ga konagiti gaaluga, é zo pɔdi voloi ma, é naa ʋotogi ve, nii é laazu maazu geya nui ʋɛ, ná-zooi ɠaaɠale ma pɔ. <verse eid="LEV 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 25:28"/>Ni é la ani zɔlɔɔni, a potogi leʋe da, zooi ɠa yɛ geya nui yeezu, eyɛsu ɓɔɠɔyeema ɠonagi zeeli. Toɠa ɠaaɠale ma, é ɠɛ zeezu, é ɠɛ ga nɔnɔ názu.<verse eid="LEV 25:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 25:29"/>«Ni nui ta a daa ʋɛlɛi ʋɔdina taai ta zu, maalatigai ga siɠigi, toɠa zoo é unmɔɔ kona gila daawu, é zo pɔdi voloi ma. Ná-unmɔɔ fai ɠa lɛbisu ga kona gila nɔ. <verse eid="LEV 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 25:30"/>Kɛlɛ pɛlɛi naa togai taai ta zu, maalatigai ga siɠigi, ni naa la unmɔɔni kona gilagi ɠɛɛzu é pilɛ da, toɠa ɠɛ ga geya nui nɔnɔ niina eyɛsu ɠɔ, ta nɔnɔ mavofodai, ti la mɔ teʋega, anɛɛ ɓɔɠɔyeema ɠonagi a zeelina. <verse eid="LEV 25:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 25:31"/>Pɛlɛiti ti taaiti su, siɠi ge la ti ma, naati ta leve, eɠɛʋelei zooi ma lɔgiti ti la. Pɔdi nui ɠa zoo é unmɔɔ, ni naa laade pɛlɛi ɠa leʋe ma nui ʋɔ ɓɔɠɔyeema ɠonagi.<verse eid="LEV 25:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 25:32"/>«Nii é ga Levi nuiti ta-ʋɛlɛiti ta-vai, niiti ti ta-laaiti su, Levi nuiti ta zoo ti unmɔɔ fai ɠɛ eyɛsu ɠɔ. <verse eid="LEV 25:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 25:33"/>Zɔi a pɛlɛi ta ɠeyana Levi nu ma taai zu, toɠa ɠula pɛlɛi naa wu, pɔdiai ma, ɓɔɠɔyeema ɠonagi ma. Mazɔlɔɔ Levi nuiti ta-ʋɛlɛiti ta-laaiti su, ta ga ta-ʋoganii Izilayɛle nuiti saama. <verse eid="LEV 25:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 25:34"/>Kpalagiti ti ta-laaiti maaɠoolii zu, naati maa la nɛɛni, ti ʋa ʋɔdi, mazɔlɔɔ tiya ɠa ta-ʋoganii ʋe eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="LEV 25:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tɔgi é lo bala nuiti <optbreak/> maaɠuyeiti ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 25:35"/>«Ni Izilayɛle nui ta a ɠɛna ga zeaɲaka nu wo ɠoba, aniiti balagai zea, wa yeezei bu, eɠɛʋelei wo kɛɛzu la wɛɛinti ɓaa seikɔɠɔma nuiti bɛ, naa ɠa a kɛ é zɛnvui wo wo ɠoba. <verse eid="LEV 25:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 25:36"/>À mina talama maaloli ma, ɓaa kulanumai, wa lua wa-ƓALAGI ʋa, wo-ɠɛɛloin zɛnvui wo wo ɠoba. <verse eid="LEV 25:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 25:37"/>À mina kuye ʋɛɛ ga wa-walii, wo ʋa ta la ma. Wo la wa-laamianigi vea zea ga lɔdɔgi, wo ʋa ta la ma. <verse eid="LEV 25:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 25:38"/>Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, wa-ƓALAGI, nii é wo ɠula Ezipete yooi ʋa, ga é Kanaan yooi ve wo ya, naa ɠa a kɛ gè ɠɛ ga wa-ƓALAGI.<verse eid="LEV 25:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tɔgi é lo <optbreak/> nuɓusɛiti unmɔɔ fai ʋa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 21:2-6">Ɛgezɔde 21:2-6</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="DEU 15:12-18">Tɔ Sɛʋɛi Velesiɛi 15:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 25:39"/>«Ni Izilayɛle nui ta a ɠɛna ga zeaɲaka nu wo ɠoba, é ɓɔɠɔ ʋɔdi wo ma, à mina duɔla wotii la unma. <verse eid="LEV 25:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 25:40"/>Toɠa ɠɛ wo ʋɔ bɛ, eɠɛ nui é botii ɠɛɛzu, wo ɗa sala, é ɠɛ eɠɛ seikɔɠɔma yeeɠɛɠala go nɔ zu. Toɠa yɛ wa-wotii laawu eyɛsu ɓɔɠɔyeema ɠonagi zeeli. <verse eid="LEV 25:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 25:41"/>Toɠa zeɠe názu wo ʋɔ bɛ, tɔ-o, ná-dointi-yo, é ɠale ma ná-bolodai zu, kɛɛɠɛ ʋoganii zaama. <verse eid="LEV 25:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 25:42"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nà-botiɠɛ nuiti be, gè ti ɠulaai Ezipete yooi ʋa, ti la ʋɔdia, eɠɛʋelei duɔiti ta ʋɔdi la. <verse eid="LEV 25:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 25:43"/>È la zeiɗa unda ga maaɓa, kɛlɛ wa lua wa-ƓALAGI ʋa.<verse eid="LEV 25:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 25:44"/>«Ziiti ti wo-maaɠoolii zu, naati saama ɠa wa duɔ zunui ɓaa duɔ anzanui zeɠena, ti ɠɛ ga wɔnɔ, tiya ɠa wa duɔiti geya ti zu. <verse eid="LEV 25:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 25:45"/>Niiti ti ʋaai zeizu wo zaama, yeeɠɛɠala go laawu, wa zoo wo naati geya, ta ti-mavofodaiti. Ta ɠɛ ga wɔnɔ. <verse eid="LEV 25:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 25:46"/>Wa ti yɛ ná, wa zeɠena ná, ti ɠɛ ga pogani wo-loun zunuiti bɛ, ti ɠɛ ga tɔnɔ. Wa zoo wo ti makɛ, ti ɠɛ ga duɔiti eyɛsu ɠɔ. Kɛlɛ wo-ɠɛɛlointi tetemazu, ti ga Izilayɛle nuiti, wo tanɔpɛ ge mina zei kɛɛɠɛloin unga ga maaɓa.<verse eid="LEV 25:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LEV 25:47"/>«Ni wɛɛn ɓaa seikɔɠɔma nu, a ɠɛna ga kpɛtɛ nui, Izilayɛle nui ta ɠɛ ga zeaɲaka nu koba, ni a ɓɔɠɔ ʋɔdina wɛɛn naa ma, ɓaa seikɔɠɔma nui naa ma, ɓaa wɛɛn ná-bolodai zu nui ta ma, <verse eid="LEV 25:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LEV 25:48"/>unmɔɔgi ma zobogi maanɛɛʋɛ é ɠɛ bɛ, anɛɛ ni é ɓega ga ɓɔɠɔ ʋɔdi. Kɛɛɠɛloin ta ɠa zoo é unmɔɔ. <verse eid="LEV 25:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LEV 25:49"/>Kɛɛɠɛ diɛ ɓaa deɠe zunui ta, ɓaa naa ná-doun zunui ta, ɓaa ná-nu ɠiteɠitegi ta, é ná-bolodai zu, naa ɠa zoo é unmɔɔ. Ɓaa ni sɔlɔɔ gani ɠa ná, nii zeelaai ma, toɠa ɓɔɠɔ unmɔɔ. <verse eid="LEV 25:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LEV 25:50"/>Ta geya nui ta konagi ɠaalu, é zo pɔdi voloi ma, é zeeli ɓɔɠɔyeema ɠonagi ma. Unmɔɔ salai ɠa leve, é zoloo nui ná-folo ɠila wotiɠɛ zalai ma, naa ɠa gaalusu, é zoloo konagi liegɔi ma. <verse eid="LEV 25:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LEV 25:51"/>Ni konagi wola mɔinʋɛ dɛ, ná-unmɔɔ fai zu, toɠa letemaʋɛ ma walii ɠula, nii zunui naa geyaai la. <verse eid="LEV 25:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LEV 25:52"/>Ni kona mɔinmɔin ge la mɔ yɛni, eyɛsu ɓɔɠɔyeema ɠonagi zeeli, toɠa gaalugi ɠɛ, é letemaʋɛ ma walii ɠaaɠale ma, ná-unmɔɔ fai zu, é zoloo naama ɠonagiti ma. <verse eid="LEV 25:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LEV 25:53"/>Toɠa ɠɛ maliɠii ʋɔ bɛ eɠɛ botiɠɛ nu, é ɗa zalai zeɠe konagi laawu. Naa la zeiɗa unda, é ʋa sopele ɲɔu ga maaɓa. <verse eid="LEV 25:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LEV 25:54"/>Ni é la unmɔɔni ga naama ʋelei tanɔpɛ, toɠa yɛ ná, eyɛsu ɓɔɠɔyeema ɠonagi zeeli, é ɠɛ ɓɔɠɔ yeema, tɔ-o, dointi-yo. <verse eid="LEV 25:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LEV 25:55"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Izilayɛle nuiti ta ga botiɠɛ nuiti bɛ̀, tɔɔzei gè ti ɠulani Ezipete yooi ʋa. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, wa-ƓALAGI.»<verse eid="LEV 25:55"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="LEV 26"/>
  <para style="s">Tuyaiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 7:12-24">Tɔ Sɛʋɛi Velesiɛi 7:12-24</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="DEU 28:1-14">28:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 26:1"/>«À mina kɔɔɠɔ ganigiti kpɛtɛ ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ. À mina vololiba ʋilɛ, ɓaa sale ɠɔtu. À mina kɔtui tanɔpɛ saɠa, wo ʋa ɗa nɔkɔ bu wa-yooi zu, mazɔlɔɔ nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, wa-ƓALAGI.<verse eid="LEV 26:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 26:2"/>«Wa nà-dooɠo foloiti maaɲɛ, wo unfe sèizu ɲadegai ma. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.<verse eid="LEV 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 26:3"/>«Ni wa ziɛna ga nà-deveiti, wo ɠolo nà-tɔgiti bɛ, ni wa ti zona, <verse eid="LEV 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 26:4"/>nà tonaiti fe wo ya ma yeeɠɛɠalai ma, zooi ɠa ná-kulanumaiti fe, guluiti ta waa. <verse eid="LEV 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 26:5"/>Wa yɛ ɠɔ moloi loɠazu, eyɛsu dɔɔ ɓɛtɛ yeeɠɛɠalai zeeli, wo yɛ ɠɔ dɔɔ ɓɛtɛ vai ɠɛɛzu, eyɛsu ani zuwu vaza yeeɠɛɠalai zeeli. Wa daamianigi zɔlɔɔ ga mɔinɗa, wo zei ga pagɔ ziilɛigi zu, wa-yooi zu. <verse eid="LEV 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 26:6"/>Nà ziilɛigi lɔ zooi zu, wa ɲiimɛnii wo, faa nɔpɛ ge la wo ɓɔlɔa. Nà sua vilɛiti kpein kula wa-yooi ʋa, kɔɔ la ɠɔa wa-yooi zu. <verse eid="LEV 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 26:7"/>Wa ʋilɛ wo zili nuiti polu, wo zobo sɔlɔɔ ti ma ga wa-woɠa zɔkpɔi, ti loo. <verse eid="LEV 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 26:8"/>Wo zaama, nu lɔɔlugɔ ɠa pilɛ sɔlɔɔ nu ungila (100) ma, ta nu ungila (100) ka nu waapuugɔ (10.000) ɓɛ. Wa-woɠa zɔkpɔi ɠa ɠɛ wo zili nuiti toozu bu. <verse eid="LEV 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 26:9"/>Nà yeeyɛ wo ʋa, gè wo ɠɛ ga kpuɠu nu, wo wola mɔin. Nà nà-minazeɠegi makɛ kpaan wo ʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 26:10"/>Wa molo wɔlɔmai mi, wo mɔtai likpi vɔlɔ, nii a kɛ wo ma niinɛi ʋuuzu zɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="LEV 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 26:11"/>Nà sèizuʋɛ ɓɛtɛ wo zaama, gè la mɔ ɠɛlɛa wo ʋa pɛ. <verse eid="LEV 26:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 26:12"/>Nà ziɛ wo zaama, gè ɠɛ ga wa-ƓALAGI, wo ɠɛ ga nà-nuɓusɛiti. <verse eid="LEV 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 26:13"/>Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, wa-ƓALAGI, nii é wo ɠulani Ezipete yooi ʋa, é wo ɠula duɔlai zu. Gè wa-unbawuluiti galeɠaleni, wo ziɛ unbuzeɠei zu.<verse eid="LEV 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Foovooiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 28:15-68">Tɔ Sɛʋɛi Velesiɛi 28:15-68</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 26:14"/>«Kɛlɛ ni wo la woiloni gòo ma, wo ʋa ziɛ ga devei niiti kpein, <verse eid="LEV 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 26:15"/>ni wa nà-deveiti wɔinzeɠena, wo ɠɛlɛ nà-tɔgiti ba, wo la ziɛni ga nà-deveiti kpein, wo nà-minazeɠegi ɠoloɠolo, <verse eid="LEV 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 26:16"/>à wɛlɛ ʋelegi gè ʋaazu wo zosu da: Nà ziiɓɔlɔi lɔ wo zaama, kɔsɔ kolegi ta kɔlɔkpadimai ɗa wo zo, ti ɗa wo-ɠaazuʋɛti maaɓidi, ta ɗa ɠula wo-zii la. Wa wa-ani zuwuiti faza fuun nɔ, mazɔlɔɔ wo zili nuiti ta wa-molo leʋeaiti seɠe. <verse eid="LEV 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 26:17"/>Nà ɠale ma wo laalɔɠɔma, wo-ɠɔɔɲɔɠɔiti ta zobo sɔlɔɔ wo ma. Niiti ti wo wɔinzeɠezu, naati ta zei wo unda. Wa ʋela, anɛɛ ni nu la ʋilɛni wo ʋolu, é ʋa ɗa wo ɓɛ.<verse eid="LEV 26:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 26:18"/>«Ni naa pɛ poluma, wo la woiloni gòo ma, nà wo maaɠolo ná zeizu ɠɛ lɔfela wa-ɠotoiti faa zu. <verse eid="LEV 26:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 26:19"/>Nà wa-wasogi ma zɛbɛi ɠoloɠolosu, geezuʋɛ ɠa ɓaa wo ma eɠɛ kɔlui, wa-yooi ɠɛ eɠɛ kɔlu ɓɔigi. <verse eid="LEV 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 26:20"/>Wo-zuvikɛi ɠa ɓe, é ɠula wo ya fuun, wa-yooi la mɔ ná-kulanumaiti fea, zooi ɠa wuluiti ti la mɔ waa.<verse eid="LEV 26:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 26:21"/>«Ni wa ɠɛlɛna, wo la kɛɛni, wo ʋa woilo gòo ma, nà wo loɠa ná zeizu ɠɛ lɔfela, eɠɛʋelei wa-ɠotoiti ti la. <verse eid="LEV 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 26:22"/>Nà dɔɓɔ zuaiti teʋe wo laalɔɠɔma, ti wo-lointi paa, ti wa-loganiiti suwuɠaaleʋe, ti wo maalɔi, wa-ʋeleiti ta ʋaazu ɠɛɛzu ga teʋebaiti.<verse eid="LEV 26:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 26:23"/>«Ni, anɛɛ naa ʋe, wo la vaani bu, gè ʋa wo maaɠolo, wa sàkpena, <verse eid="LEV 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 26:24"/>nà ɓalaa, nà wo zakpe, gè wo loɠa ná zeizu ɠɛ lɔfela mɔnɔ, wa-ɠotoiti faa zu. <verse eid="LEV 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 26:25"/>Nà kɔɔiti teʋe wo laalɔɠɔma, tɔɔzei wo minazeɠegi ɠoloɠologa. Wa ɠaalɛɛna ba wa-laaiti su, gè ɗɔfɔ zeeɓɛi lɔ wo zaama, wa lɔ wo zili nuiti zeezu. <verse eid="LEV 26:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 26:26"/>Siɛgi zu gè wo ʋalasu la wo-ɠɔnɔgi ma, anzanu puugɔ ɠa ɓului mɔ sulu gila su, ti ʋaa la wo ʋɔ, gaa a ɠwɛɛna, wa daami wo, wo la yiɠoa.<verse eid="LEV 26:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 26:27"/>«Ni, anɛɛ naa ʋe, wo la woiloni gòo ma, wa sàkpena, <verse eid="LEV 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 26:28"/>nà ɓalaa, nà wo zakpe ga ziiɠaawanai, gè wo loɠa ná zeizu ɠɛ lɔfela mɔnɔ, wa-ɠotoiti faa zu. <verse eid="LEV 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 26:29"/>Wa wo-loun zunuiti ma zuaiti mi, wo wo-loun anzanuiti ma zuaiti mi. <verse eid="LEV 26:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 26:30"/>Nà wa-zalaɠa ɠula adaʋɛti koloɠolo, ta wa-ansansegiti ma zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛti, gè wo-ma ʋoomaiti pu wa-ɠɔɔɠɔ ganigiti ma ʋoomaiti ma, nà ɠɛlɛ wo ʋa. <verse eid="LEV 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 26:31"/>Nà wa-laaiti kɛ ga teʋebai, gè wa-ada ɲadegaiti faza, wa-zalaɠa maku nɛɛnɛgiti ti la mɔ zìilɛiɗa. <verse eid="LEV 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 26:32"/>Nà ɓɔɠɔi, nà zooi zuɠoloɠolo, wo zili nuiti ti ʋaai, ti zei ná, naati koozu ɠa ʋili, ti laavɔ. <verse eid="LEV 26:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 26:33"/>Nà wo vaza ziiti saama, gè ʋilɛ wo ʋolu ga boɠa zɔkpɔi. Wa-yooi zu ɠa ɠoloɠolo, wa-laaiti ta ɠɛ ga teʋebai.<verse eid="LEV 26:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 26:34"/>«Naazu zooi ɠa dooɠo sɔlɔɔ, siɛgi kpein é kɛɛzu gaalɛi zu, wa ɠɛɛzu wo zili nuiti ta-yooi zu. Zooi ɠa looɠo názu. <verse eid="LEV 26:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LEV 26:35"/>Siɛgi kpein é kɛɛzu gaalɛi zu, toɠa dooɠogi zɔlɔɔ, nii é la ɠɛa sɔlɔɔsu wa-looɠo konagiti su, siɛgi zu wo zeini la ná.<verse eid="LEV 26:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LEV 26:36"/>«Wo zaama, niiti ti ɠɛɛzu zeini ti zili nuiti ta-yooiti su, nà ti-yiiti daave ga dualuagi. Daai é ɲiikpisu, naa lugi ɠa ti maalua. Ta ʋela, eɠɛʋelei nu a ɗa ʋela la sili nui ná-boɠa zɔkpɔi ʋa. Ta loo, anɛɛ ni nu la ʋilɛni ti ʋolu. <verse eid="LEV 26:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LEV 26:37"/>Ta ɓunɛsu ɓɔɠɔ ma, eɠɛʋelei nu a ɠɛ la boɠa zɔkpɔi ɠakala, anɛɛ ni nu la ʋilɛni ti ʋolu. Wo la ungalɔga wo zili nuiti kakala. <verse eid="LEV 26:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LEV 26:38"/>Wo undaa ɠa ʋili zii ɠiligiti saama. Wo zili nuiti ta-yooi ɠa wo maaɓili. <verse eid="LEV 26:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LEV 26:39"/>Niiti ta yɛ vulua wo zaama, naati ta ɓɔɠɔ undaaʋili ti zili nuiti ta-yooi zu, ta-vaaɠaaza golaiti ta ti-mɛmɛwolani ta-vaaɠaaza golaiti faa zu.<verse eid="LEV 26:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa <optbreak/> ná-minazeɠegi makɛ kpaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LEV 26:40"/>«Ta laa zɔ ga ga ta-vaaɠaaza golaiti, ta ti-mɛmɛwolani ta-vaaɠaaza golaiti, é lo wooveledaiti ba, ti ti ɠɛɛni ga ze, ta sakpegi ti bogai ga ze, <verse eid="LEV 26:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LEV 26:41"/>naa ɠa é kɛa gè ti zakpeni, gè li ga tiye ti zili nuiti ta-yooi zu. Ni ta ɓɔɠɔmaayeina, ta ti ta-vaaɠaaza golai ma ɠuyei zala, <verse eid="LEV 26:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LEV 26:42"/>nà ɠizɛ nà-minazeɠegi zu, gi yɔɠɔzu gá ti-mɛmɛwolani, Zakɔɓe, Izaake, ta Abalaame, nà ɠizɛ ɓalaa zooi zu. <verse eid="LEV 26:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LEV 26:43"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ta ɠula zooi ʋa, naa ɠa dooɠo sɔlɔɔ názu, siɛgi zu é gaalɛi zu la, ti maaɠoozaai ba. Ta ta-vaaɠaaza golai ma ɠuyei zala, tɔɔzei ti ɠɛlɛni nà-deveiti ta nà-tɔgiti ba. <verse eid="LEV 26:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LEV 26:44"/>Kɛlɛ siɛgi zu ti ɠɛɛzu la, ti zili nuiti ta-yooi zu, gè la ɠɛlɛa ti ʋa ɲɛgɛlɛin, gè la ti-ma zuwu ɠaaleʋea, gè la nà-minazeɠegi ɠoloɠologa ti letemazu, mazɔlɔɔ nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ta-ƓALAGI. <verse eid="LEV 26:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LEV 26:45"/>Nà ɠizɛsu nà-minazeɠe mɔungi zu ti-mɛmɛwolani tetemazu, niiti gè ti ɠulani la Ezipete yooi ʋa, ziiti gaazu, ga gè ɠɛ ga ta-ƓALAGI. Nà ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI.»<verse eid="LEV 26:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LEV 26:46"/>Kalagiti kana, ta deveiti, ta tɔgiti, niiti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ti zeini, ti yɔɠɔzu ta Izilayɛle nuiti, Sinayi gizei ma ga Moize maaʋele.<verse eid="LEV 26:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="LEV 27"/>
  <para style="s">Minazeɠe daazeeli zɔngɔi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LEV 27:1"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Moize ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="LEV 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LEV 27:2"/>«Ɓɔɛ Izilayɛle nuiti pɔ, è ɠɛ ti ma: Ni nui ta a minazeɠena ga é nui ta ɠɛ ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nɔnɔ, toɠa ná-minazeɠegi laazeeli ga sɔngɔi, <verse eid="LEV 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LEV 27:3"/>a lona zunui ta ʋa, nii é kona ʋuufelegɔ (20) zɔlɔɔga, eyɛsu é zeeli kona ʋuulɔzita (60) ma, sɔngɔi ɠa ɠɛ ga wali ɠae ʋuulɔɔlugɔ (50), é zoloo seizu ɲadegai ma walii ma. <verse eid="LEV 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LEV 27:4"/>Ni anzanu ʋe, sɔngɔi ɠa ɠɛ ga wali ɠae ʋuusaʋagɔ (30). <verse eid="LEV 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LEV 27:5"/>Zunu loungoi, é zo kona dɔɔlugɔ ma, é li kona ʋuufelegɔ (20) ʋɔ, sɔngɔi ɠa ɠɛ ga wali ɠae ʋuufelegɔ (20), anzanu loungoi ma zɔngɔi ɠa ɠɛ ga wali ɠae puugɔ. <verse eid="LEV 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LEV 27:6"/>É zo alu gila ma, é li kona dɔɔlugɔ ʋɔ, zunu loungoi ma zɔngɔi ɠa ɠɛ ga wali ɠae lɔɔlugɔ, anzanu loungoi ma zɔngɔi ɠa ɠɛ ga wali ɠae saʋagɔ. <verse eid="LEV 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LEV 27:7"/>É zo kona ʋuulɔzita (60) ma, é lɛ zeemaazu, zunui ma zɔngɔi ɠa ɠɛ ga wali ɠae puugɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ (15), ta anzanui ma zɔngɔi ɠa ɠɛ ga wali ɠae puugɔ. <verse eid="LEV 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LEV 27:8"/>Ni zɔi é minazeɠegi ɠɛai, naa ɠa ga zeaɲaka nu, é la zooga é ʋa sɔngɔi zala, toɠa ʋa ga zɔi nii é kalivaai, é dɛɛ ga zalaɠa ɠula nui. Naa ɠa deve, é soloo ná-sɔlɔɔgi ɠɛʋelei ma.<verse eid="LEV 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LEV 27:9"/>«Ni nu a minazeɠena ga é suai ta ve Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, nii a zoo ɠulazu ga zalaɠa, naa veeʋɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LEV 27:10"/>Nu la maavaliboga, nu la ma ʋagɔi ʋotogi ɠɛa ga ma ɲɔi, ɓaa ma ɲɔi ʋotogi ɠɛ ga ma ʋagɔi. Ni nu a suai ʋotogi ɠɛɛna ga taɠili, ti felegɔ ta ve Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ.<verse eid="LEV 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LEV 27:11"/>«Ni nu a minazeɠena ga é sua ɠɔzɔai ta ve Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, nii é la zooga ɠulazu ga zalaɠa, toɠa lɛ ga zalaɠa ɠula nui, <verse eid="LEV 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LEV 27:12"/>naa ɠa sɔngɔi leve, é zoloo pa pelei ɓaa ɲɔu ʋelei ma, ná-devei ɠa ta yeezei bu. <verse eid="LEV 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LEV 27:13"/>Ni fee nui ɠa pɔ é unmɔɔ, toɠa ta la ma ga dɔɔlugɔi zeizu ɠilagi.<verse eid="LEV 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LEV 27:14"/>«Ni nui ta wɔinʋɛ ga é ná-pɛlɛi ve Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, é kɛ ga nɔnɔ, zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa sɔngɔi leve, é zoloo ná-pagi ɓaa ná-ɲɔi ma, ta yeezei naa wu, sɔngɔi nɔpɛ é devezu. <verse eid="LEV 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LEV 27:15"/>Ni zɔi nii é feai, toɠa pɔ é unmɔɔ, toɠa sɔngɔi ma ɠaaɠwɛsu lɔɔlugɔi ɠilazuʋɛ la sɔngɔi ma, naa ɠa ɠɛ ga nɔnɔ ʋolu ga niinɛ.<verse eid="LEV 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LEV 27:16"/>«Ni nui ta a ná-kpalagi veena Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, sɔngɔi liegɔi ɠa ɠwɛɛ, é zoloo ani zuwui liegɔi ma, nii a vaza ba, wali ɠae ʋuulɔɔlugɔ (50) moloi é ga wɔɔlezegi naama ɠilo unsaʋagɔ (300). <verse eid="LEV 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LEV 27:17"/>Ni a ná-kpalagi veena ɓɔɠɔyeema ɠonagi lɔɔzeigi, ta va sɔngɔi liegɔi wu. <verse eid="LEV 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LEV 27:18"/>Ni toɠa ná-kpalagi ve ɓɔɠɔyeema ɠonagi a leʋena, zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa sɔngɔi ɠaalu, é zoloo konagi liegɔi ma, nii zɛgai ná, eyɛsu ɓɔɠɔyeema ɠonagi zɔi zeeli, ta ta ɠula sɔngɔi liegɔi la. <verse eid="LEV 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LEV 27:19"/>Ni kpala nui ɠa pɔ é ná-kpalagi unmɔɔ, toɠa sɔngɔi ma ɠaaɠwɛsu lɔɔlugɔi ɠilazuʋɛ ʋɛɛ ba, eɠɛʋelei zalaɠa ɠula nui a ɠida la sɔngɔi liegɔi wu, toɠa kpalagi zeɠe ʋolu. <verse eid="LEV 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LEV 27:20"/>Ni é la kpalagi unmɔɔni, é ʋɔdi zunui taɠili ma, zobo ge la mɔ ná, é ʋa unmɔɔ, <verse eid="LEV 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LEV 27:21"/>ɓɔɠɔyeema ɠonagi a zeelina, kpalagi naa ɠa ɠɛ ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nɔnɔ, é ɠɛ ga zalaɠa ɠula nui nɔnɔ, eɠɛ kpalagi nii feai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="LEV 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LEV 27:22"/>«Ni nui ta a kpalagi veena Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, nii é geyaai, é la ʋɛɛni ná-poganiiti ba, <verse eid="LEV 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LEV 27:23"/>zalaɠa ɠula nui ɠa ɠida sɔngɔi liegɔi wu, é zoloo konagi liegɔi ma, a yɛ ná, eyɛsu ɓɔɠɔyeema ɠonagi zɔi zeeli. Zou vee nui ɠa naama walii liegɔi zala, naama voloi nɔ yeei deveai la, mazɔlɔɔ kpalagi veeʋɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LEV 27:24"/>Kɛlɛ ɓɔɠɔyeema ɠonagi ma, kpalagi ɠa ɠaaɠale ma naa ma, nii é ɠeyani ma, nii zooi ɓɔɠɔi ɠɛa zea ga poganii.<verse eid="LEV 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LEV 27:25"/>«Sɔngɔi kpein ka wo é zoloo seizu ɲadegai ma walii ma, nii ma ɠae ɠilagi wuɲɛgi ga galamu puugɔi.<verse eid="LEV 27:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LEV 27:26"/>«Nu nɔpɛ ge la zooga é ʋa ná-togani ma yiʋo mɔungi ve Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, mazɔlɔɔ ma mɔungi kpein ka niina ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nɔnɔi, é ɠɛni ga togani goiti ɓaa ma wolaiti ti-ma yiʋoiti. <verse eid="LEV 27:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LEV 27:27"/>Ni toɠa ɠɛ ga sua ɠɔzɔai ta, é la ɠulaa ga zalaɠa, toɠa unmɔɔ, eɠɛʋelei sɔngɔi la, é sɔngɔi ma ɠaaɠwɛsu lɔɔlugɔi ɠilazuʋɛ zeɠe, é pɛɛ ba. Ni é la unmɔɔni, toɠa ʋɔdi, eɠɛʋelei sɔngɔi la.<verse eid="LEV 27:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LEV 27:28"/>«Naa ʋoluma, nii kpein nu a kona Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma, kɔligaa zaama ti ga nɔnɔi, naa la zooga ʋɔdizu, ɓaa é ʋa unmɔɔ, é ɠɛni ga nu vului, ɓaa toganii, ɓaa kpalagi é ga zeaɠɔligi. Nii kpein a ɠona Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma, naa ɠa ɠɛ ga nɔnɔ ta anii gola ɲadegai. <verse eid="LEV 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LEV 27:29"/>Anɛɛ ni nuɓusɛi ʋe a kona, nu la zooga é ʋa unmɔɔ, ta naama nui ʋaa.<verse eid="LEV 27:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LEV 27:30"/>«Zooi ná-puusiɛiti, é ɠɛni ga zooi ʋaalɔnɔgiti, ɓaa guluiti gaawaaiti, ta ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nɔnɔ, ani ʋe feai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LEV 27:31"/>Ni nui ta ɠa pɔ é ná-puusiɛi ma anii ta unmɔɔ, toɠa sɔngɔi ma ɠaaɠwɛsu lɔɔlugɔi ɠilazuʋɛ zeɠe, é pɛɛ ba. <verse eid="LEV 27:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LEV 27:32"/>Puusiɛ vai, nii é ʋilɛsu nikɛiti ba, ta baalagiti, ta boliiti, toganii a leʋena puu, tukpɔi wu, puusiɛi ɠa ve Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="LEV 27:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LEV 27:33"/>Togani nui la zooga é ʋa ziimazeɠe kɛ, ma ʋagɔi ta ma ɲɔi zu. Nu la ta maavaliboga ga taɠili. Ni nu a ta ʋotogi ɠɛɛna ga taɠili, ti felegɔ ta ɠɛ ga ani ɲadegai, ti la zooga unmɔɔsu.»<verse eid="LEV 27:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LEV 27:34"/>Deveiti kana Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ti veeni Moize ya, Izilayɛle nuiti ta vaa ma, Sinayi gizei ma.<verse eid="LEV 27:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LEV 27"/>
</usx>
